  - key: Blind19.description
    source: '[Passive] Must be placed on the seat next to the Cemetery. Each time
      Blind activates, it reveals the true identity and infection status of the most
      recently deceased card it has not yet examined.

      [Decay] [Passive] Must
      be placed on the seat next to the Cemetery. Each time Blind activates, it reveals
      falsified information about the identity and infection status of the most recently
      deceased card it has not yet examined.'
    english: '[Passive] Must be placed on the seat next to the Cemetery. Each time
      Blind activates, it reveals the true identity and infection status of the most
      recently deceased card it has not yet examined.

      [Decay] [Passive] Must
      be placed on the seat next to the Cemetery. Each time Blind activates, it reveals
      falsified information about the identity and infection status of the most recently
      deceased card it has not yet examined.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] Ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t
      \u1EDF gh\u1EBF c\u1EA1nh Ngh\u0129a trang. M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t,
      Blind ti\u1EBFt l\u1ED9 danh t\xEDnh th\u1EADt v\xE0 tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i nhi\u1EC5m
      b\u1EC7nh c\u1EE7a l\xE1 b\xE0i ch\u1EBFt g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t m\xE0 n\xF3 ch\u01B0a
      t\u1EEBng ki\u1EC3m tra.\n[Tha h\xF3a] [B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] Ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      \u0111\u1EB7t \u1EDF gh\u1EBF c\u1EA1nh Ngh\u0129a trang. M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n
      k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t, Blind cung c\u1EA5p th\xF4ng tin gi\u1EA3 v\u1EC1 danh t\xEDnh
      v\xE0 tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh c\u1EE7a l\xE1 b\xE0i ch\u1EBFt
      g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t m\xE0 n\xF3 ch\u01B0a t\u1EEBng ki\u1EC3m tra."
  - key: Blind19.infectedDescription
    source: '[Decay] [Passive] Must be placed on the seat next to the Cemetery. Each
      time Blind activates, it reveals falsified information about the identity and
      infection status of the most recently deceased card it has not yet examined.'
    english: '[Decay] [Passive] Must be placed on the seat next to the Cemetery.
      Each time Blind activates, it reveals falsified information about the identity
      and infection status of the most recently deceased card it has not yet examined.
      [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[Tha h\xF3a] [B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] Ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      \u0111\u1EB7t \u1EDF gh\u1EBF c\u1EA1nh Ngh\u0129a trang. M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n
      k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t, Blind cung c\u1EA5p th\xF4ng tin gi\u1EA3 v\u1EC1 danh t\xEDnh
      v\xE0 tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh c\u1EE7a l\xE1 b\xE0i ch\u1EBFt
      g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t m\xE0 n\xF3 ch\u01B0a t\u1EEBng ki\u1EC3m tra. [<color=red>Infected</color>]"
  - key: Controller22.description
    source: '[Passive] Reverses the Sacrifice Phase rules. While this card is on
      the board, the card with the lowest number of votes (minimum 1) will be executed
      instead of the highest.'
    english: '[Passive] Reverses the Sacrifice Phase rules. While this card is on
      the board, the card with the lowest number of votes (minimum 1) will be executed
      instead of the highest.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] \u0110\u1EA3o ng\u01B0\u1EE3c lu\u1EADt
      Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF. Khi l\xE1 n\xE0y \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n, c\xE1c l\xE1 c\xF3
      s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu th\u1EA5p nh\u1EA5t nh\u01B0ng \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 1 phi\u1EBFu
      s\u1EBD b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, thay cho nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu
      nh\u1EA5t."
  - key: Controller22.infectedDescription
    source: '[Passive] Reverses the Sacrifice Phase rules. While this card is on
      the board, the card with the lowest number of votes (minimum 1) will be executed
      instead of the highest. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Passive] Reverses the Sacrifice Phase rules. While this card is on
      the board, the card with the lowest number of votes (minimum 1) will be executed
      instead of the highest. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] \u0110\u1EA3o ng\u01B0\u1EE3c lu\u1EADt
      Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF. Khi l\xE1 n\xE0y \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n, c\xE1c l\xE1 c\xF3
      s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu th\u1EA5p nh\u1EA5t nh\u01B0ng \xEDt nh\u1EA5t 1 phi\u1EBFu
      s\u1EBD b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, thay cho nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu
      nh\u1EA5t. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3 nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Detactive23.description
    source: '[Passive][Once] If placed between two neighbors, identifies the more
      suspicious one and adds +1 Suspicion to them (prioritizes Curs).

      (Base
      Suspicion: Cur = 2, Villager = 1)'
    english: '[Passive][Once] If placed between two neighbors, identifies the more
      suspicious one and adds +1 Suspicion to them (prioritizes Cursermancer).

      (Base
      Suspicion: Cursermancer = 2, Villager = 1)'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] [M\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EB7t]
      N\u1EBFu ng\u1ED3i gi\u1EEFa hai l\xE1, x\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh l\xE1 \u0111\xE1ng
      nghi h\u01A1n v\xE0 c\u1ED9ng 1 \u0111i\u1EC3m Nghi ng\u1EDD cho l\xE1 \u0111\xF3;
      \u01B0u ti\xEAn Cursermancer.\nNghi ng\u1EDD c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n: Cursermancer
      = 2, D\xE2n l\xE0ng = 1."
  - key: Detactive23.infectedDescription
    source: "[Passive][Once] If placed between two neighbors, identifies the more
      suspicious one and adds +1 Suspicion to them (prioritizes Curs). \n(Base Suspicion:
      Cur = 2, Villager = 1) [<color=red>Infected</color>]"
    english: "[Passive][Once] If placed between two neighbors, identifies the more
      suspicious one and adds +1 Suspicion to them (prioritizes Cursermancer). \n(Base
      Suspicion: Cursermancer = 2, Villager = 1) [<color=red>Infected</color>]"
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] [M\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EB7t]
      N\u1EBFu ng\u1ED3i gi\u1EEFa hai l\xE1, x\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh l\xE1 \u0111\xE1ng
      nghi h\u01A1n v\xE0 c\u1ED9ng 1 \u0111i\u1EC3m Nghi ng\u1EDD cho l\xE1 \u0111\xF3;
      \u01B0u ti\xEAn Cursermancer.\nNghi ng\u1EDD c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n: Cursermancer
      = 2, D\xE2n l\xE0ng = 1. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3 nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Elder17.description
    source: '[Passive] [Aura] The targets can''t be moved.'
    english: '[Passive] [Aura] The targets can''t be moved.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] [H\xE0o quang] C\xE1c l\xE1 trong v\xF9ng
      \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB di chuy\u1EC3n."
  - key: Elder17.infectedDescription
    source: '[Passive] [Aura] The targets can''t be moved. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Passive] [Aura] The targets can''t be moved. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] [H\xE0o quang] C\xE1c l\xE1 trong v\xF9ng
      \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB di chuy\u1EC3n. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3
      nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Gambler24.description
    source: '[Active]: Secretly bet on a target. You win if you are the ONLY gambler
      (as 1st voter) OR if BOTH players gambled (as 2nd voter).

      Reward: Target
      gets +1 vote.

      Penalty: The card you voted for the most loses 1 vote.'
    english: '[Active]: Secretly bet on a target. You win if you are the ONLY gambler
      (as 1st voter) OR if BOTH players gambled (as 2nd voter).

      Reward: Target
      gets +1 vote.

      Penalty: The card you voted for the most loses 1 vote.'
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] B\xED m\u1EADt c\u01B0\u1EE3c v\xE0o m\u1ED9t
      m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu. Th\u1EAFng n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECF
      phi\u1EBFu th\u1EE9 nh\u1EA5t v\xE0 ch\u1EC9 m\xECnh b\u1EA1n c\u01B0\u1EE3c,
      ho\u1EB7c b\u1EA1n l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu th\u1EE9 hai v\xE0
      c\u1EA3 hai \u0111\u1EC1u c\u01B0\u1EE3c.\nTh\u1EAFng: m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      c\u1ED9ng 1 phi\u1EBFu.\nThua: m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c phe b\u1EA1n
      b\u1ECF nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t b\u1ECB tr\u1EEB 1 phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: Gambler24.infectedDescription
    source: '[Active]: Secretly bet on a target. You win if you are the ONLY gambler
      (as 1st voter) OR if BOTH players gambled (as 2nd voter).

      Reward: Target
      gets +1 vote.

      Penalty: The card you voted for the most loses 1 vote.
      [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Active]: Secretly bet on a target. You win if you are the ONLY gambler
      (as 1st voter) OR if BOTH players gambled (as 2nd voter).

      Reward: Target
      gets +1 vote.

      Penalty: The card you voted for the most loses 1 vote.
      [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] B\xED m\u1EADt c\u01B0\u1EE3c v\xE0o m\u1ED9t
      m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu. Th\u1EAFng n\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECF
      phi\u1EBFu th\u1EE9 nh\u1EA5t v\xE0 ch\u1EC9 m\xECnh b\u1EA1n c\u01B0\u1EE3c,
      ho\u1EB7c b\u1EA1n l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu th\u1EE9 hai v\xE0
      c\u1EA3 hai \u0111\u1EC1u c\u01B0\u1EE3c.\nTh\u1EAFng: m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      c\u1ED9ng 1 phi\u1EBFu.\nThua: m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c phe b\u1EA1n
      b\u1ECF nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t b\u1ECB tr\u1EEB 1 phi\u1EBFu. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3
      nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Invoker19.description
    source: '[Active] During the Sacrifice Phase, the player who last placed this
      card may use it on a seat next to the Cemetery. Left-click to discover up to
      3 fallen cards and choose 1 to resurrect into its original owner''s hand. Once
      per ritual; a completed selection consumes the use.'
    english: '[Active] During the Sacrifice Phase, the player who last placed this
      card may use it on a seat next to the Cemetery. Left-click to discover up to
      3 fallen cards and choose 1 to resurrect into its original owner''s hand. Once
      per ritual; a completed selection consumes the use.'
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] Trong pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      \u0111\u1EB7t l\xE1 n\xE0y g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng khi n\xF3 ng\u1ED3i s\xE1t Ngh\u0129a trang. B\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t
      tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 xem t\u1ED1i \u0111a 3 l\xE1 \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt v\xE0
      ch\u1ECDn 1 l\xE1 h\u1ED3i sinh v\u1EC1 tay ch\u1EE7 s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu g\u1ED1c.
      M\u1ED7i nghi th\u1EE9c d\xF9ng m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n; ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t l\u1EF1a
      ch\u1ECDn m\u1EDBi t\xEDnh l\xE0 \u0111\xE3 d\xF9ng."
  - key: Invoker19.infectedDescription
    source: '[Active] During the Sacrifice Phase, the player who last placed this
      card may use it on a seat next to the Cemetery. Left-click to discover up to
      3 fallen cards and choose 1 to resurrect into its original owner''s hand. Once
      per ritual; a completed selection consumes the use. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Active] During the Sacrifice Phase, the player who last placed this
      card may use it on a seat next to the Cemetery. Left-click to discover up to
      3 fallen cards and choose 1 to resurrect into its original owner''s hand. Once
      per ritual; a completed selection consumes the use. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] Trong pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      \u0111\u1EB7t l\xE1 n\xE0y g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng khi n\xF3 ng\u1ED3i s\xE1t Ngh\u0129a trang. B\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t
      tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 xem t\u1ED1i \u0111a 3 l\xE1 \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt v\xE0
      ch\u1ECDn 1 l\xE1 h\u1ED3i sinh v\u1EC1 tay ch\u1EE7 s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu g\u1ED1c.
      M\u1ED7i nghi th\u1EE9c d\xF9ng m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n; ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t l\u1EF1a
      ch\u1ECDn m\u1EDBi t\xEDnh l\xE0 \u0111\xE3 d\xF9ng. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3
      nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Jester20.description
    source: '[Passive] Chaos in the Ballot Box! During the Sacrifice phase, Jester
      has a 75% chance to secretly cast exactly 3 extra votes at random targets (excluding
      itself). Multiple votes may target the same card.'
    english: '[Passive] Chaos in the Ballot Box! During the Sacrifice phase, Jester
      has a 75% chance to secretly cast exactly 3 extra votes at random targets (excluding
      itself). Multiple votes may target the same card.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] H\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n trong h\xF2m phi\u1EBFu!
      Trong giai \u0111o\u1EA1n Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, Jester c\xF3 75% x\xE1c su\u1EA5t
      b\xED m\u1EADt tung \u0111\xFAng 3 phi\u1EBFu b\u1EA7u b\u1ED5 sung v\xE0o
      c\xE1c l\xE1 b\xE0i ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn (tr\u1EEB ch\xEDnh n\xF3). Nhi\u1EC1u
      phi\u1EBFu c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\xF9ng nh\u1EAFm v\xE0o m\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i."
  - key: Jester20.curInfectedDescription
    source: '[Passive] Chaos in the Ballot Box! During the Sacrifice phase, Jester
      has a 75% chance to secretly cast exactly 3 extra votes at random targets (excluding
      itself). Multiple votes may target the same card.'
    english: '[Passive] Chaos in the Ballot Box! During the Sacrifice phase, Jester
      has a 75% chance to secretly cast exactly 3 extra votes at random targets (excluding
      itself). Multiple votes may target the same card.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] H\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n trong h\xF2m phi\u1EBFu!
      Trong giai \u0111o\u1EA1n Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, Jester c\xF3 75% x\xE1c su\u1EA5t
      b\xED m\u1EADt tung \u0111\xFAng 3 phi\u1EBFu b\u1EA7u b\u1ED5 sung v\xE0o
      c\xE1c l\xE1 b\xE0i ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn (tr\u1EEB ch\xEDnh n\xF3). Nhi\u1EC1u
      phi\u1EBFu c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\xF9ng nh\u1EAFm v\xE0o m\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i."
  - key: Master21.description
    source: '[Passive] Adds seats above/below, and left at Seat 1. Occupied extras
      block manual moves only. Skill pushes carry seats and occupants along. A forced
      return sends all occupants to their owners'' hands. Losing the left seat returns
      its occupant. If Game Master dies, all occupants die; Preacher cannot save
      them.'
    english: '[Passive] Adds seats above/below, and left at Seat 1. Occupied extras
      block manual moves only. Skill pushes carry seats and occupants along. A forced
      return sends all occupants to their owners'' hands. Losing the left seat returns
      its occupant. If Game Master dies, all occupants die; Preacher cannot save
      them.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] T\u1EA1o gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 ph\xEDa tr\xEAn
      v\xE0 d\u01B0\u1EDBi; th\xEAm gh\u1EBF b\xEAn tr\xE1i khi \u1EDF gh\u1EBF s\u1ED1
      1. Gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 c\xF3 b\xE0i ch\u1EC9 kh\xF3a thao t\xE1c di chuy\u1EC3n
      th\u1EE7 c\xF4ng. K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1EA9y s\u1EBD mang theo c\xE1c
      gh\u1EBF v\xE0 b\xE0i tr\xEAn \u0111\xF3. N\u1EBFu b\u1ECB tr\u1EA3 v\u1EC1
      tay, to\xE0n b\u1ED9 b\xE0i tr\xEAn gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 c\u0169ng v\u1EC1 tay
      ch\u1EE7 s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng. M\u1EA5t gh\u1EBF tr\xE1i
      s\u1EBD tr\u1EA3 l\xE1 tr\xEAn gh\u1EBF \u0111\xF3 v\u1EC1 tay. Khi Game Master
      ch\u1EBFt, t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 b\xE0i tr\xEAn gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 ch\u1EBFt theo,
      k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 c\xF3 khi\xEAn Preacher."
  - key: Master21.infectedDescription
    source: '[Passive] Adds seats above/below, and left at Seat 1. Occupied extras
      block manual moves only. Skill pushes carry seats and occupants along. A forced
      return sends all occupants to their owners'' hands. Losing the left seat returns
      its occupant. If Game Master dies, all occupants die; Preacher cannot save
