      them. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] T\u1EA1o gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 ph\xEDa tr\xEAn
      v\xE0 d\u01B0\u1EDBi; th\xEAm gh\u1EBF b\xEAn tr\xE1i khi \u1EDF gh\u1EBF s\u1ED1
      1. Gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 c\xF3 b\xE0i ch\u1EC9 kh\xF3a thao t\xE1c di chuy\u1EC3n
      th\u1EE7 c\xF4ng. K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1EA9y s\u1EBD mang theo c\xE1c
      gh\u1EBF v\xE0 b\xE0i tr\xEAn \u0111\xF3. N\u1EBFu b\u1ECB tr\u1EA3 v\u1EC1
      tay, to\xE0n b\u1ED9 b\xE0i tr\xEAn gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 c\u0169ng v\u1EC1 tay
      ch\u1EE7 s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng. M\u1EA5t gh\u1EBF tr\xE1i
      s\u1EBD tr\u1EA3 l\xE1 tr\xEAn gh\u1EBF \u0111\xF3 v\u1EC1 tay. Khi Game Master
      ch\u1EBFt, t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 b\xE0i tr\xEAn gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 ch\u1EBFt theo,
      k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 c\xF3 khi\xEAn Preacher. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3 nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Prankster24.description
    source: '[Passive] Play: 3 Hearts. A card in the neighboring seat on the left
      triggers a push to a random empty regular seat. On play only: 10% chance to
      return it to hand instead. Elder blocks this effect. Game Master''s seats and
      occupants follow a push; they return to hand if Game Master returns.'
    english: '[Passive] Play: 3 Hearts. A card in the neighboring seat on the left
      triggers a push to a random empty regular seat. On play only: 10% chance to
      return it to hand instead. Elder blocks this effect. Game Master''s seats and
      occupants follow a push; they return to hand if Game Master returns.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] \u0110\u1EB7t b\xE0i t\u1ED1n 3 tim. Khi
      c\xF3 b\xE0i \u1EDF gh\u1EBF li\u1EC1n b\xEAn tr\xE1i, \u0111\u1EA9y l\xE1
      \u0111\xF3 sang m\u1ED9t gh\u1EBF ch\xEDnh \u0111ang tr\u1ED1ng ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn.
      Ri\xEAng l\xFAc v\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EB7t: c\xF3 10% c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i tr\u1EA3
      l\xE1 \u0111\xF3 v\u1EC1 tay. Elder ch\u1EB7n hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng n\xE0y. N\u1EBFu
      Game Master b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EA9y, c\xE1c gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 v\xE0 b\xE0i tr\xEAn
      \u0111\xF3 \u0111i theo; n\u1EBFu v\u1EC1 tay th\xEC ch\xFAng c\u0169ng v\u1EC1
      tay t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng."
  - key: Prankster24.infectedDescription
    source: '[Passive] Play: 3 Hearts. A card in the neighboring seat on the left
