  - key: Preacher18.description
    source: '[Passive] [Aura] The Targets can''t be infected and shot by Cursermancer
      or Hunter.'
    english: '[Passive] [Aura] The Targets can''t be infected and shot by Cursermancer
      or Hunter.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] [H\xE0o quang] C\xE1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 kh\u1ECFi l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m c\u1EE7a Cursermancer
      v\xE0 ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn c\u1EE7a Hunter."
  - key: Preacher18.infectedDescription
    source: '[Passive] [Aura] The Targets can''t be infected and shot by Cursermancer
      or Hunter. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Passive] [Aura] The Targets can''t be infected and shot by Cursermancer
      or Hunter. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] [H\xE0o quang] C\xE1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 kh\u1ECFi l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m c\u1EE7a Cursermancer
      v\xE0 ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn c\u1EE7a Hunter. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3 nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Reeve17.description
    source: '[Passive]As long as there is at least one normal Villager on the board,
      immediately ends the placement phase and forces the game to enter the Curse
      Phase.'
    english: '[Passive]As long as there is at least one normal Villager on the board,
      immediately ends the placement phase and forces the game to enter the Curse
      Phase.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] Khi c\xF2n \xEDt nh\u1EA5t m\u1ED9t D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng tr\xEAn b\xE0n, l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c k\u1EBFt th\xFAc
      pha \u0111\u1EB7t b\xE0i v\xE0 chuy\u1EC3n sang pha Nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a."
  - key: Reeve17.infectedDescription
    source: '[Passive]As long as there is at least one normal Villager on the board,
      immediately ends the placement phase and forces the game to enter the Curse
      Phase. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Passive]As long as there is at least one normal Villager on the board,
      immediately ends the placement phase and forces the game to enter the Curse
