  - key: Saboteur18.description
    source: '[Passive] [Aura] Disables the printed skills of the two horizontal neighbors.
      Does not block Cursermancer infection.'
    english: '[Passive] [Aura] Disables the printed skills of the two horizontal
      neighbors. Does not block Cursermancer infection.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] [H\xE0o quang] Kh\xF3a k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng
      g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a hai l\xE1 k\u1EC1 ngang. Kh\xF4ng kh\xF3a kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng
      l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m c\u1EE7a Cursermancer."
  - key: Saboteur18.infectedDescription
    source: '[Passive] [Aura] Disables the printed skills of the two horizontal neighbors.
      Does not block Cursermancer infection. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Passive] [Aura] Disables the printed skills of the two horizontal
      neighbors. Does not block Cursermancer infection. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] [H\xE0o quang] Kh\xF3a k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng
      g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a hai l\xE1 k\u1EC1 ngang. Kh\xF4ng kh\xF3a kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng
      l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m c\u1EE7a Cursermancer. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3 nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Sacrifier21.description
    source: '[Passive] If this card is on the board during the Sacrifice Phase, it
      overrides all votes and is instantly executed instead of the voted targets.'
    english: '[Passive] If this card is on the board during the Sacrifice Phase,
      it overrides all votes and is instantly executed instead of the voted targets.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] N\u1EBFu \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n trong pha
      Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, l\xE1 n\xE0y ghi \u0111\xE8 k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu
      v\xE0 b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF thay cho c\xE1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      b\u1EA7u."
  - key: Sacrifier21.infectedDescription
    source: '[Passive] If this card is on the board during the Sacrifice Phase, it
      overrides all votes and is instantly executed instead of the voted targets.
      [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Passive] If this card is on the board during the Sacrifice Phase,
      it overrides all votes and is instantly executed instead of the voted targets.
      [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] N\u1EBFu \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n trong pha
      Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, l\xE1 n\xE0y ghi \u0111\xE8 k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu
      v\xE0 b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF thay cho c\xE1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      b\u1EA7u. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3 nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Snooper22.description
    source: '[Sacrifice] [Hybrid]

      [Passive] Automatically casts 1 Vote against
      the Cursermancer during the Sacrifice Phase.

      [Active] [Decay] If infected,
      The Cursermancer takes control and manually aims this Vote at any target.'
    english: '[Sacrifice] [Hybrid]

      [Passive] Automatically casts 1 Vote against
      the Cursermancer during the Sacrifice Phase.

      [Active] [Decay] If infected,
      The Cursermancer takes control and manually aims this Vote at any target.'
    vietnamese: "[Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF] [K\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p]\n[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng]
      T\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng th\xEAm 1 phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o Cursermancer khi Hi\u1EBFn
      t\u1EBF.\n[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] [Tha ho\xE1] Khi b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m, phe
      Cursermancer \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n v\xE0 t\u1EF1 ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu
      cho phi\u1EBFu n\xE0y."
  - key: Snooper22.infectedDescription
    source: "[Sacrifice] [Hybrid] \n[Passive] Automatically casts 1 Vote against
      the Cursermancer during the Sacrifice Phase.\n[Active] [Decay] The Cursermancer
      takes control and manually aims this Vote at any target . [<color=red>Infected</color>]"
    english: "[Sacrifice] [Hybrid] \n[Active] [Decay] The Cursermancer takes control
      and manually aims this Vote at any target . [<color=red>Infected</color>]"
    vietnamese: "[Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF] [K\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p]\n[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng]
      [Tha ho\xE1] Khi b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m, phe Cursermancer \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n
      v\xE0 t\u1EF1 ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu cho phi\u1EBFu n\xE0y. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3
      nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Totem2.description
    source: 'Effect: [Passive] This card is exceptionally light. It only costs 1
      Heart to place onto the board or return to the hand.'
    english: 'Effect: [Passive] This card is exceptionally light. It only costs 1
      Heart to place onto the board or return to the hand.'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] Ch\u1EC9 t\u1ED1n 1 tim \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t
      l\xE1 n\xE0y l\xEAn b\xE0n ho\u1EB7c thu v\u1EC1 tay."
  - key: Totem2.infectedDescription
    source: 'Effect: [Passive] This card is exceptionally light. It only costs 1
      Heart to place onto the board or return to the hand. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: 'Effect: [Passive] This card is exceptionally light. It only costs 1
      Heart to place onto the board or return to the hand. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[B\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng] Ch\u1EC9 t\u1ED1n 1 tim \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t
      l\xE1 n\xE0y l\xEAn b\xE0n ho\u1EB7c thu v\u1EC1 tay. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3
      nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Trader20.description
    source: After all extra votes and vote penalties are resolved, share the highest
      vote count in this card and its horizontal neighbors equally among the occupied
      cards only. Round down and discard the remainder.
    english: After all extra votes and vote penalties are resolved, share the highest
      vote count in this card and its horizontal neighbors equally among the occupied
      cards only. Round down and discard the remainder.
    vietnamese: "Sau khi gi\u1EA3i quy\u1EBFt m\u1ECDi phi\u1EBFu c\u1ED9ng v\xE0
      phi\u1EBFu tr\u1EEB, l\u1EA5y s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu cao nh\u1EA5t trong nh\xF3m
      g\u1ED3m l\xE1 n\xE0y v\xE0 c\xE1c l\xE1 k\u1EC1 ngang, r\u1ED3i chia \u0111\u1EC1u
      ch\u1EC9 cho nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 \u0111ang c\xF3. L\xE0m tr\xF2n xu\u1ED1ng v\xE0
      b\u1ECF ph\u1EA7n d\u01B0."
  - key: Trader20.infectedDescription
    source: 'After all extra votes and vote penalties are resolved, share the highest
      vote count in this card and its horizontal neighbors equally among the occupied
      cards only. Round down and discard the remainder. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: 'After all extra votes and vote penalties are resolved, share the highest
      vote count in this card and its horizontal neighbors equally among the occupied
      cards only. Round down and discard the remainder. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "Sau khi gi\u1EA3i quy\u1EBFt m\u1ECDi phi\u1EBFu c\u1ED9ng v\xE0
      phi\u1EBFu tr\u1EEB, l\u1EA5y s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu cao nh\u1EA5t trong nh\xF3m
      g\u1ED3m l\xE1 n\xE0y v\xE0 c\xE1c l\xE1 k\u1EC1 ngang, r\u1ED3i chia \u0111\u1EC1u
      ch\u1EC9 cho nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 \u0111ang c\xF3. L\xE0m tr\xF2n xu\u1ED1ng v\xE0
      b\u1ECF ph\u1EA7n d\u01B0. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3 nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Villager16.description
    source: 'Effect: Has no special abilities. Relies strictly on pure deduction
      and voting in the Sacrifice Phase to root out the evil.'
    english: 'Effect: Has no special abilities. Relies strictly on pure deduction
      and voting in the Sacrifice Phase to root out the evil.'
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t. D\u1EF1a
      v\xE0o suy lu\u1EADn v\xE0 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu trong pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF \u0111\u1EC3
      t\xECm ra k\u1EBB mang l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n."
  - key: Villager16.curDescription
    source: 'Effect: [Active] Infects the nearest uninfected card in one of four
      directions (Up, Down, Left, Right).'
    english: 'Effect: [Active] Infects the nearest uninfected card in one of four
      directions (Up, Down, Left, Right).'
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] L\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m cho l\xE1 ch\u01B0a
      nhi\u1EC5m g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t theo m\u1ED9t trong b\u1ED1n h\u01B0\u1EDBng:
      tr\xEAn, d\u01B0\u1EDBi, tr\xE1i, ph\u1EA3i."
  - key: Villager16.infectedDescription
    source: 'Effect: [Status] The plague''s mark is upon you. Beware the Villagers''
      scrutiny (check); from this moment on, to be discovered is to welcome the cold,
      silent embrace of death.'
    english: 'Effect: [Status] The plague''s mark is upon you. Beware the Villagers''
      scrutiny (check); from this moment on, to be discovered is to welcome the cold,
      silent embrace of death.'
    vietnamese: "[Tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i] L\xE1 n\xE0y \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m
      b\u1EC7nh. N\u1EBFu b\u1ECB Thanh tr\u1EEBng ph\xE1t hi\u1EC7n, l\xE1 s\u1EBD
      b\u1ECB ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t."
  - key: Villager16.curInfectedDescription
    source: 'Effect: [Active] Infects an enemy. Your shadows can no longer hide the
      rot. Guard yourself against the villagers'' gaze (check); discovery is now
      a one-way path to the executioner''s blade.'
    english: 'Effect: [Active] Infects an enemy. Your shadows can no longer hide
      the rot. Guard yourself against the villagers'' gaze (check); discovery is
      now a one-way path to the executioner''s blade.'
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] C\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m cho \u0111\u1ED1i
      ph\u01B0\u01A1ng. B\u1EA3n th\xE2n \u0111ang b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh v\xE0
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t b\u1EDFi Thanh tr\u1EEBng."
  - key: Villager9.description
    source: "Effect: [Active] Right-click and drag the targeting arrow to an enemy
      to instantly execute them. This skill can only be activated before the Curse
      Phase begins. Once fired, the weapon must be reloaded\u2014the skill will refresh
      only after the Sacrifice/Execution Phase concludes (once the voting is complete)."
    english: "Effect: [Active] Right-click and drag the targeting arrow to an enemy
      to instantly execute them. This skill can only be activated before the Curse
      Phase begins. Once fired, the weapon must be reloaded\u2014the skill will refresh
      only after the Sacrifice/Execution Phase concludes (once the voting is complete)."
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] Gi\u1EEF chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i r\u1ED3i
      k\xE9o m\u0169i ng\u1EAFm t\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t l\xE1 \u0111\u1ECBch \u0111\u1EC3
      ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t ngay. Ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi pha Nguy\u1EC1n
      r\u1EE7a b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u. Sau khi b\u1EAFn, k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EC9
      h\u1ED3i l\u1EA1i khi pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF/X\u1EED t\u1EED \u0111\xE3 k\u1EBFt
      th\xFAc."
  - key: Villager9.infectedDescription
    source: "Effect: [Active] Right-click and drag the targeting arrow to an enemy
      to instantly execute them. This skill can only be activated before the Curse
      Phase begins. Once fired, the weapon must be reloaded\u2014the skill will refresh
      only after the Sacrifice/Execution Phase concludes (once the voting is complete).
      [<color=red>Infected</color>]"
    english: "Effect: [Active] Right-click and drag the targeting arrow to an enemy
      to instantly execute them. This skill can only be activated before the Curse
      Phase begins. Once fired, the weapon must be reloaded\u2014the skill will refresh
      only after the Sacrifice/Execution Phase concludes (once the voting is complete).
      [<color=red>Infected</color>]"
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] Gi\u1EEF chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i r\u1ED3i
      k\xE9o m\u0169i ng\u1EAFm t\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t l\xE1 \u0111\u1ECBch \u0111\u1EC3
      ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t ngay. Ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi pha Nguy\u1EC1n
      r\u1EE7a b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u. Sau khi b\u1EAFn, k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EC9
      h\u1ED3i l\u1EA1i khi pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF/X\u1EED t\u1EED \u0111\xE3 k\u1EBFt
      th\xFAc. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3 nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Witch23.description
    source: '[Active] [Once per ritual] 5 Hearts: Left-click to banish all other
      infected cards on the board. Does not affect itself or cards in hand. Recharges
      after the Sacrifice/Execution Phase finishes.'
    english: '[Active] [Once per ritual] 5 Hearts: Left-click to banish all other
      infected cards on the board. Does not affect itself or cards in hand. Recharges
      after the Sacrifice/Execution Phase finishes.'
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] [M\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i nghi th\u1EE9c]
      T\u1ED1n 5 tim: b\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t
      m\u1ECDi l\xE1 b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n. Kh\xF4ng \u1EA3nh
      h\u01B0\u1EDFng b\u1EA3n th\xE2n ho\u1EB7c b\xE0i tr\xEAn tay. H\u1ED3i l\u1EA1i
      sau khi pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF/X\u1EED t\u1EED k\u1EBFt th\xFAc."
  - key: Witch23.infectedDescription
    source: '[Active] [Once per ritual] 5 Hearts: Left-click to banish all other
      infected cards on the board. Does not affect itself or cards in hand. Recharges
      after the Sacrifice/Execution Phase finishes. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    english: '[Active] [Once per ritual] 5 Hearts: Left-click to banish all other
      infected cards on the board. Does not affect itself or cards in hand. Recharges
      after the Sacrifice/Execution Phase finishes. [<color=red>Infected</color>]'
    vietnamese: "[Ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng] [M\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n m\u1ED7i nghi th\u1EE9c]
      T\u1ED1n 5 tim: b\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t
      m\u1ECDi l\xE1 b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n. Kh\xF4ng \u1EA3nh
      h\u01B0\u1EDFng b\u1EA3n th\xE2n ho\u1EB7c b\xE0i tr\xEAn tay. H\u1ED3i l\u1EA1i
      sau khi pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF/X\u1EED t\u1EED k\u1EBFt th\xFAc. [<color=red>\u0110\xE3
      nhi\u1EC5m</color>]"
  - key: Blind19.quote.0
    source: Sight is a distraction. I see the truth.
    english: Sight is a distraction. I see the truth.
    vietnamese: "M\u1EAFt nh\xECn d\u1EC5 khi\u1EBFn ta l\u1EA1c l\u1ED1i. Ta th\u1EA5y
      s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt."
  - key: Blind19.quote.1
    source: I see it all.
    english: I see it all.
    vietnamese: "Ta th\u1EA5y t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3."
  - key: Blind19.quote.2
    source: The shadows cling to you. Step into the light.
    english: The shadows cling to you. Step into the light.
    vietnamese: "B\xF3ng t\u1ED1i \u0111ang b\xE1m l\u1EA5y ng\u01B0\u01A1i. H\xE3y
      b\u01B0\u1EDBc ra \xE1nh s\xE1ng."
  - key: Controller22.quote.0
    source: Logic dictates that the Cursermancer is hiding among us.
    english: Logic dictates that the Cursermancer is hiding among us.
    vietnamese: "Cursermancer \u0111ang \u1EA9n gi\u1EEFa ch\xFAng ta. \u0110\xF3
      l\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u h\u1EE3p l\xFD nh\u1EA5t."
  - key: Controller22.quote.1
    source: I am recalculating the odds. Someone here is lying.
    english: I am recalculating the odds. Someone here is lying.
    vietnamese: "Ta \u0111ang t\xEDnh l\u1EA1i kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng. C\xF3 k\u1EBB
      \u0111ang n\xF3i d\u1ED1i."
  - key: Controller22.quote.2
    source: The votes are the only shield we have against the dark.
    english: The votes are the only shield we have against the dark.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 phi\u1EBFu l\xE0 t\u1EA5m khi\xEAn cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i."
  - key: Detactive23.quote.0
    source: "Let\u2019s see who\u2019s hiding behind these masks"
    english: "Let\u2019s see who\u2019s hiding behind these masks"
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EC3 xem ai \u0111ang n\u1EA5p sau nh\u1EEFng chi\u1EBFc
      m\u1EB7t n\u1EA1."
  - key: Detactive23.quote.1
    source: Two sides to every story, but only one truth
    english: Two sides to every story, but only one truth
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED7i chuy\u1EC7n c\xF3 hai ph\xEDa, nh\u01B0ng s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt
      ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 m\u1ED9t."
  - key: Detactive23.quote.2
    source: I'm keeping a close eye on both of you.
    english: I'm keeping a close eye on both of you.
    vietnamese: "Ta \u0111ang \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EAFt t\u1EDBi c\u1EA3 hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi."
  - key: Elder17.quote.0
    source: I have seen this curse before... many lifetimes ago.
    english: I have seen this curse before... many lifetimes ago.
    vietnamese: "Ta t\u1EEBng th\u1EA5y l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n n\xE0y... t\u1EEB nhi\u1EC1u
      ki\u1EBFp tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - key: Elder17.quote.1
    source: will stand my ground until the sun rises or the world ends.
    english: will stand my ground until the sun rises or the world ends.
    vietnamese: "Ta s\u1EBD gi\u1EEF v\u1EEFng ch\u1ED7 n\xE0y cho t\u1EDBi b\xECnh
      minh, ho\u1EB7c ng\xE0y t\u1EADn th\u1EBF."
  - key: Elder17.quote.2
    source: Is this the end?
    english: Is this the end?
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE2y c\xF3 ph\u1EA3i d\u1EA5u ch\u1EA5m h\u1EBFt kh\xF4ng?"
  - key: Gambler24.quote.0
    source: High stakes, high rewards. Place your bets!
    english: High stakes, high rewards. Place your bets!
    vietnamese: "C\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EDBn, th\u1EAFng l\u1EDBn. \u0110\u1EB7t c\u01B0\u1EE3c
      \u0111i n\xE0o!"
  - key: Gambler24.quote.1
    source: I see your bluff, and I raise you a life.
    english: I see your bluff, and I raise you a life.
    vietnamese: "Ta th\u1EA5y ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111ang b\u1ECBp. Ta c\u01B0\u1EE3c
      th\xEAm m\u1ED9t m\u1EA1ng."
  - key: Gambler24.quote.2
    source: I've already calculated the odds. You're going to lose.
    english: I've already calculated the odds. You're going to lose.
    vietnamese: "Ta t\xEDnh c\u1EA3 r\u1ED3i. Ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD thua."
  - key: Gambler24.quote.3
    source: Snake eyes... Looks like someone's luck just ran out.
    english: Snake eyes... Looks like someone's luck just ran out.
    vietnamese: "Hai con m\u1ED9t... c\xF3 v\u1EBB v\u1EADn may c\u1EE7a ai \u0111\xF3
      v\u1EEBa c\u1EA1n."
  - key: Invoker19.quote.0
    source: The grave is not the end. It's just a waiting room.
    english: The grave is not the end. It's just a waiting room.
    vietnamese: "Ngh\u0129a trang kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i k\u1EBFt th\xFAc. Ch\u1EC9 l\xE0
      ph\xF2ng ch\u1EDD th\xF4i."
  - key: Invoker19.quote.1
    source: I can hear the dead whispering... they want to return.
    english: I can hear the dead whispering... they want to return.
    vietnamese: "Ta nghe ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u1EBFt th\xEC th\u1EA7m... h\u1ECD mu\u1ED1n
      quay v\u1EC1."
  - key: Invoker19.quote.2
    source: A soul for a soul. The balance must be maintained.
    english: A soul for a soul. The balance must be maintained.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t linh h\u1ED3n \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1ED9t linh h\u1ED3n. C\xE1n
      c\xE2n ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF."
  - key: Jester20.quote.0
    source: Eeny, meeny, miny, moe... who is next?
    english: Eeny, meeny, miny, moe... who is next?
    vietnamese: "\xDAm ba la... ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ti\u1EBFp theo l\xE0 ai \u0111\xE2y?"
  - key: Jester20.quote.1
    source: Hehehe... don't look at me, I'm just a fool.
    english: Hehehe... don't look at me, I'm just a fool.
    vietnamese: "H\xEA h\xEA... \u0111\u1EEBng nh\xECn ta, ta ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 th\u1EB1ng
      h\u1EC1."
  - key: Jester20.quote.2
    source: More votes! More chaos! MORE!
    english: More votes! More chaos! MORE!
    vietnamese: "Th\xEAm phi\u1EBFu! Th\xEAm h\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n! TH\xCAM N\u1EEEA!"
  - key: Master21.quote.0
    source: Don't look at me. Look at the liar sitting right next to you.
    english: Don't look at me. Look at the liar sitting right next to you.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng nh\xECn ta. H\xE3y nh\xECn k\u1EBB n\xF3i d\u1ED1i
      ng\u1ED3i c\u1EA1nh ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
  - key: Master21.quote.1
    source: fascinating move... or a fatal mistake? We shall see.
    english: fascinating move... or a fatal mistake? We shall see.
    vietnamese: "N\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111i th\xFA v\u1ECB... hay sai l\u1EA7m ch\u1EBFt
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi? R\u1ED3i s\u1EBD r\xF5."
  - key: Master21.quote.2
    source: Tick-tock... the ritual waits for no one.
    english: Tick-tock... the ritual waits for no one.
    vietnamese: "T\xEDch t\u1EAFc... nghi th\u1EE9c ch\u1EB3ng \u0111\u1EE3i ai."
  - key: Prankster24.quote.0
    source: This spot has my name written all over it.
    english: This spot has my name written all over it.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ED7 n\xE0y r\xF5 r\xE0ng d\xE0nh cho ta."
  - key: Prankster24.quote.1
    source: You're looking a bit tense. Want me to help you move?
    english: You're looking a bit tense. Want me to help you move?
    vietnamese: "Tr\xF4ng ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\u0103ng th\u1EB3ng qu\xE1. Mu\u1ED1n
      ta gi\xFAp \u0111\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7 kh\xF4ng?"
  - key: Prankster24.quote.2
    source: Don't look at me, I'm behaving... for now.
    english: Don't look at me, I'm behaving... for now.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng nh\xECn ta, ta \u0111ang ngoan m\xE0... t\u1EA1m
      th\u1EDDi th\xF4i."
  - key: Prankster24.quote.3
    source: It's too quiet here. Someone needs a prank.
    english: It's too quiet here. Someone needs a prank.
    vietnamese: "Y\xEAn \u1EAFng qu\xE1. Ph\u1EA3i tr\xEAu ai \u0111\xF3 m\u1EDBi
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
  - key: Preacher18.quote.0
    source: Begone, Cursermancer! Your darkness cannot reach us here.
    english: Begone, Cursermancer! Your darkness cannot reach us here.
    vietnamese: "L\xF9i l\u1EA1i, Cursermancer! B\xF3ng t\u1ED1i c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      kh\xF4ng ch\u1EA1m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\xFAng ta."
  - key: Preacher18.quote.1
    source: Fear not the shadows, for the light is with us.
    english: Fear not the shadows, for the light is with us.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng s\u1EE3 b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i, \xE1nh s\xE1ng \u0111ang
      \u1EDF b\xEAn ta."
  - key: Preacher18.quote.2
    source: Stay within the circle. My faith is stronger than your ritual.
    english: Stay within the circle. My faith is stronger than your ritual.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y \u1EDF trong v\xF2ng tr\xF2n. \u0110\u1EE9c tin c\u1EE7a
      ta m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n nghi th\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
  - key: Reeve17.quote.0
    source: Are we going to talk all day, or are we going to survive?
    english: Are we going to talk all day, or are we going to survive?
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ECBnh n\xF3i su\u1ED1t ng\xE0y hay \u0111\u1ECBnh s\u1ED1ng
      s\xF3t \u0111\xE2y?"
  - key: Reeve17.quote.1
    source: I am the law here, and I say we are done waiting.
    english: I am the law here, and I say we are done waiting.
    vietnamese: "Ta l\xE0 lu\u1EADt \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y, v\xE0 ta n\xF3i ch\u1EDD
      th\u1EBF \u0111\u1EE7 r\u1ED3i."
  - key: Reeve17.quote.2
    source: Order in the village!
    english: Order in the village!
    vietnamese: "Gi\u1EEF tr\u1EADt t\u1EF1 trong l\xE0ng!"
  - key: Saboteur18.quote.0
    source: Oh? Why are my two lovely neighbors so awfully quiet today?
    english: Oh? Why are my two lovely neighbors so awfully quiet today?
    vietnamese: "\u1ED2? Sao hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\xE0ng x\xF3m \u0111\xE1ng m\u1EBFn
      h\xF4m nay im l\u1EB7ng th\u1EBF?"
  - key: Saboteur18.quote.1
    source: Don't waste your energy. I already cut your strings.
    english: Don't waste your energy. I already cut your strings.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng ph\xED s\u1EE9c. Ta c\u1EAFt d\xE2y c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      r\u1ED3i."
  - key: Saboteur18.quote.2
    source: System error? Nope, that was me.
    english: System error? Nope, that was me.
    vietnamese: "L\u1ED7i h\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng \u01B0? Kh\xF4ng, l\xE0 ta \u0111\u1EA5y."
  - key: Sacrifier21.quote.0
    source: Why me?! There are others... pick someone else, please!
    english: Why me?! There are others... pick someone else, please!
    vietnamese: "Sao l\u1EA1i l\xE0 ta?! C\xF2n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c m\xE0...
      xin h\xE3y ch\u1ECDn ai kh\xE1c!"
  - key: Sacrifier21.quote.1
    source: "You\u2019re all monsters! You're just murdering me to save yourselves!"
    english: "You\u2019re all monsters! You're just murdering me to save yourselves!"
    vietnamese: "To\xE0n l\u0169 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt! C\xE1c ng\u01B0\u01A1i gi\u1EBFt
      ta \u0111\u1EC3 c\u1EE9u m\xECnh!"
  - key: Sacrifier21.quote.2
    source: Help! They're forcing me into the circle! Somebody help me!
    english: Help! They're forcing me into the circle! Somebody help me!
    vietnamese: "C\u1EE9u v\u1EDBi! H\u1ECD \u0111ang \xE9p ta v\xE0o v\xF2ng tr\xF2n!
      Ai c\u1EE9u ta v\u1EDBi!"
  - key: Sacrifier21.quote.3
    source: I refuse! I won't go quietly! I won't let the darkness take me!
    english: I refuse! I won't go quietly! I won't let the darkness take me!
    vietnamese: "Ta kh\xF4ng ch\u1ECBu! Ta kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EC3 b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i
      mang m\xECnh \u0111i \u0111\xE2u!"
  - key: Trader20.quote.0
    source: Everything has a price. Even your survival.
    english: Everything has a price. Even your survival.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ECDi th\u1EE9 \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 gi\xE1. K\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 m\u1EA1ng
      s\u1ED1ng c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
  - key: Trader20.quote.1
    source: A fair trade? There's no such thing in this village
    english: A fair trade? There's no such thing in this village
    vietnamese: "Trao \u0111\u1ED5i c\xF4ng b\u1EB1ng \u01B0? L\xE0ng n\xE0y l\xE0m
      g\xEC c\xF3 chuy\u1EC7n \u0111\xF3."
  - key: Trader20.quote.2
    source: The votes are moving... but where will they land?
    english: The votes are moving... but where will they land?
    vietnamese: "Nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu \u0111ang \u0111\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7...
      r\u1ED3i s\u1EBD r\u01A1i v\xE0o \u0111\xE2u?"
  - key: Trader20.quote.3
    source: I deal in secrets and safety. Want to make a deal?
    english: I deal in secrets and safety. Want to make a deal?
    vietnamese: "Ta bu\xF4n b\xED m\u1EADt v\xE0 s\u1EF1 an to\xE0n. Mu\u1ED1n giao
      k\xE8o ch\u1EE9?"
  - key: Villager1.quote.0
    source: I'm just a simple villager, I swear!
    english: I'm just a simple villager, I swear!
    vietnamese: "T\xF4i ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng,
      t\xF4i th\u1EC1!"
  - key: Villager1.quote.1
    source: Don't look at me like that... I'm scared.
    english: Don't look at me like that... I'm scared.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng nh\xECn t\xF4i nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF... t\xF4i s\u1EE3."
  - key: Villager1.quote.2
    source: Did you hear that noise coming from the seat next to me?
    english: Did you hear that noise coming from the seat next to me?
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 nghe ti\u1EBFng \u0111\u1ED9ng \u1EDF gh\u1EBF b\xEAn
      c\u1EA1nh t\xF4i kh\xF4ng?"
  - key: Villager1.quote.3
    source: It's getting so cold in here... is someone watching us?
    english: It's getting so cold in here... is someone watching us?
    vietnamese: "L\u1EA1nh qu\xE1... c\xF3 ai \u0111ang nh\xECn ch\xFAng ta sao?"
  - key: Villager9.quote.0
    source: One shot, one kill. I never miss my mark.
    english: One shot, one kill. I never miss my mark.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t ph\xE1t, m\u1ED9t m\u1EA1ng. Ta kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD b\u1EAFn
      tr\u01B0\u1EE3t."
  - key: Villager9.quote.1
    source: Hmm...Where is my target?
    english: Hmm...Where is my target?
    vietnamese: "H\u1EEBm... m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\u1EE7a ta \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u?"
  - key: Villager9.quote.2
    source: The Cursermancer is near. I can feel the rot in the air
    english: The Cursermancer is near. I can feel the rot in the air
    vietnamese: "Cursermancer \u0111ang \u1EDF g\u1EA7n. Ta ng\u1EEDi th\u1EA5y m\xF9i
      b\u1EC7nh trong kh\xF4ng kh\xED."
  - key: Witch23.quote.0
    source: My seat defines my vision. Odd or even, the dark plays no favorites.
    english: My seat defines my vision. Odd or even, the dark plays no favorites.
    vietnamese: "Gh\u1EBF ng\u1ED3i \u0111\u1ECBnh t\u1EA7m nh\xECn. Ch\u1EB5n hay
      l\u1EBB, b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i ch\u1EB3ng thi\xEAn v\u1ECB ai."
  - key: Witch23.quote.1
    source: Do not stare. You stripped your own magic away; do not covet mine
    english: Do not stare. You stripped your own magic away; do not covet mine
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng nh\xECn ch\u1EB1m ch\u1EB1m. Ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\xE3
      t\u1EF1 b\u1ECF ph\xE9p thu\u1EADt, \u0111\u1EEBng th\xE8m mu\u1ED1n ph\xE9p
      c\u1EE7a ta."
  - key: Witch23.quote.2
    source: The infection whispers. It hides in the numbers. I can hear it
    english: The infection whispers. It hides in the numbers. I can hear it
    vietnamese: "B\u1EC7nh d\u1ECBch th\xEC th\u1EA7m, \u1EA9n trong nh\u1EEFng con
      s\u1ED1. Ta nghe th\u1EA5y n\xF3."
  - key: tutorial.0.title
    source: "L\xE0m quen b\xE0n ch\u01A1i"
    english: Meet the board
    vietnamese: "L\xE0m quen b\xE0n ch\u01A1i"
  - key: tutorial.0.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u h\u1ECDc. B\u1EA1n s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 thao
      t\xE1c c\u1EA3 hai phe tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t b\xE0n b\xE0i m\u1EABu."
    english: Click Start tutorial. You will control both sides on a sample board.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u h\u1ECDc. B\u1EA1n s\u1EBD t\u1EF1
      thao t\xE1c c\u1EA3 hai phe tr\xEAn m\u1ED9t b\xE0n b\xE0i m\u1EABu."
  - key: tutorial.0.purpose
    source: "Vi\u1EC1n v\xE0ng: \u0111i\u1EC3m b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u. Vi\u1EC1n
      xanh: n\u01A1i th\u1EA3. B\xE0i h\u1ECDc d\xF9ng 7 l\xE1 c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh,
      b\u1ECF qua ch\u1ECDn b\xE0i trung l\u1EADp."
    english: 'Gold outline: start here. Green outline: drop here. This lesson uses
      7 fixed cards and skips the neutral draft.'
    vietnamese: "Vi\u1EC1n v\xE0ng: \u0111i\u1EC3m b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u. Vi\u1EC1n
      xanh: n\u01A1i th\u1EA3. B\xE0i h\u1ECDc d\xF9ng 7 l\xE1 c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh,
      b\u1ECF qua ch\u1ECDn b\xE0i trung l\u1EADp."
  - key: tutorial.0.success
    source: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EEB vi\u1EC7c ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2 b\xED
      m\u1EADt."
    english: Start by choosing the secret roles.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u t\u1EEB vi\u1EC7c ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2 b\xED
      m\u1EADt."
  - key: tutorial.1.title
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn Cursermancer th\u1EE9 nh\u1EA5t"
    english: Choose the first Cursermancer
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn Cursermancer th\u1EE9 nh\u1EA5t"
  - key: tutorial.1.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I v\xE0o l\xE1 S\u1ED0 1 c\xF3 vi\u1EC1n v\xE0ng
      trong khay b\xE0i."
    english: LEFT-CLICK card NUMBER 1 with the gold outline in the hand.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I v\xE0o l\xE1 S\u1ED0 1 c\xF3 vi\u1EC1n
      v\xE0ng trong khay b\xE0i."
  - key: tutorial.1.purpose
    source: "Cursermancer l\xE0 vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t l\xE1
      b\xE0i. Trong v\xE1n hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, c\u1EA7n ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t Cursermancer
      \u1EDF m\u1ED7i nh\xF3m b\xE0i g\u1ED1c."
    english: Cursermancer is a secret role assigned to a card. A two-player match
      needs one in each original faction.
    vietnamese: "Cursermancer l\xE0 vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t l\xE1
      b\xE0i. Trong v\xE1n hai ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, c\u1EA7n ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t Cursermancer
      \u1EDF m\u1ED7i nh\xF3m b\xE0i g\u1ED1c."
  - key: tutorial.1.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh Cursermancer b\xED m\u1EADt."
    english: Card 1 is now a secret Cursermancer.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh Cursermancer b\xED
      m\u1EADt."
  - key: tutorial.2.title
    source: "M\u1EDF nh\xF3m D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
    english: Open the Villager hand
    vietnamese: "M\u1EDF nh\xF3m D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
  - key: tutorial.2.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m tab D\xC2N L\xC0NG \u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u khay b\xE0i b\xEAn
      d\u01B0\u1EDBi."
    english: Click the VILLAGERS tab at the top of the hand below.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m tab D\xC2N L\xC0NG \u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u khay b\xE0i b\xEAn
      d\u01B0\u1EDBi."
  - key: tutorial.2.purpose
    source: "Tab \u0111\u1ED5i nh\xF3m b\xE0i \u0111ang xem. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      \u0111\xE1nh c\u1EA3 b\xE0i nh\xF3m kh\xE1c, nh\u01B0ng s\u1EBD t\u1ED1n nhi\u1EC1u
      tim h\u01A1n."
    english: Tabs change the original faction you are viewing. You may play another
      faction's cards, but it costs more hearts.
    vietnamese: "Tab \u0111\u1ED5i nh\xF3m b\xE0i \u0111ang xem. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      \u0111\xE1nh c\u1EA3 b\xE0i nh\xF3m kh\xE1c, nh\u01B0ng s\u1EBD t\u1ED1n nhi\u1EC1u
      tim h\u01A1n."
  - key: tutorial.2.success
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111ang xem nh\xF3m b\xE0i D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
    english: You are viewing the Villager hand.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111ang xem nh\xF3m b\xE0i D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
  - key: tutorial.3.title
    source: "M\u1ED9t Cursermancer ng\u1EE5y trang"
    english: A disguised Cursermancer
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t Cursermancer ng\u1EE5y trang"
  - key: tutorial.3.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I v\xE0o l\xE1 S\u1ED0 11 c\xF3 vi\u1EC1n
      v\xE0ng."
    english: LEFT-CLICK card NUMBER 11 with the gold outline.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I v\xE0o l\xE1 S\u1ED0 11 c\xF3 vi\u1EC1n
      v\xE0ng."
  - key: tutorial.3.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 thu\u1ED9c nh\xF3m D\xE2n l\xE0ng v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 mang
      vai tr\xF2 Cursermancer. Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n s\u1ED1 9 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ch\u1ECDn l\xE0m Cursermancer."
    english: A Villager card can secretly be a Cursermancer. Hunter number 9 cannot
      be selected.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 thu\u1ED9c nh\xF3m D\xE2n l\xE0ng v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      mang vai tr\xF2 Cursermancer. Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n s\u1ED1 9 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ch\u1ECDn l\xE0m Cursermancer."
  - key: tutorial.3.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 l\xE0 Cursermancer ng\u1EE5y trang trong nh\xF3m D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng."
    english: Card 11 is a Cursermancer disguised among the Villagers.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 l\xE0 Cursermancer ng\u1EE5y trang trong nh\xF3m
      D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
  - key: text.303
    source: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE1n"
    english: Start match
    vietnamese: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE1n"
  - key: tutorial.4.instruction
    source: "\u0110\xE3 c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 2 Cursermancer. B\u1EA5m B\u1EAET \u0110\u1EA6U
      V\xC1N \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
    english: Both Cursermancers are selected. Click the highlighted START MATCH button.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 2 Cursermancer. B\u1EA5m B\u1EAET
      \u0110\u1EA6U V\xC1N \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
  - key: tutorial.4.purpose
    source: "Trong b\xE0i h\u1ECDc n\xE0y D\xE2n l\xE0ng \u0111i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc.
      M\u1ED7i l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\xF3 5 tim \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t
      b\xE0i ho\u1EB7c d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
    english: Villagers act first in this lesson. Each action turn grants 5 hearts
      to play cards or use skills.
    vietnamese: "Trong b\xE0i h\u1ECDc n\xE0y D\xE2n l\xE0ng \u0111i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc.
      M\u1ED7i l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\xF3 5 tim \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t
      b\xE0i ho\u1EB7c d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
  - key: tutorial.4.success
    source: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t D\xE2n l\xE0ng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\u1EDBi 5 tim."
    english: The Villager turn starts with 5 hearts.
    vietnamese: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t D\xE2n l\xE0ng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\u1EDBi 5
      tim."
  - key: tutorial.5.title
    source: "Xem m\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i"
    english: Inspect a card
    vietnamese: "Xem m\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i"
  - key: tutorial.5.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I v\xE0o l\xE1 S\u1ED0 10 trong khay b\xE0i."
    english: RIGHT-CLICK card NUMBER 10 in the hand.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I v\xE0o l\xE1 S\u1ED0 10 trong khay
      b\xE0i."
  - key: tutorial.5.purpose
    source: "Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng to l\xE1 b\xE0i v\xE0 m\u1EDF m\xF4 t\u1EA3.
      Xem b\xE0i kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng."
    english: Right-click enlarges a card and shows its description. Inspection is
      free and does not activate a skill.
    vietnamese: "Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i ph\xF3ng to l\xE1 b\xE0i v\xE0 m\u1EDF m\xF4
      t\u1EA3. Xem b\xE0i kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i l\xE0 d\xF9ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
  - key: tutorial.5.success
    source: "M\u1EB7t b\xE0i v\xE0 m\xF4 t\u1EA3 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xF3ng
      to."
    english: The card and its description are enlarged.
    vietnamese: "M\u1EB7t b\xE0i v\xE0 m\xF4 t\u1EA3 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ph\xF3ng to."
  - key: tutorial.6.title
    source: "\u0110\xF3ng ph\u1EA7n xem b\xE0i"
    english: Close the inspection
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xF3ng ph\u1EA7n xem b\xE0i"
  - key: tutorial.6.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa v\xE0o l\xE1 \u0111ang
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xF3ng to."
    english: RIGHT-CLICK the enlarged card again.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa v\xE0o l\xE1 \u0111ang
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xF3ng to."
  - key: tutorial.6.purpose
    source: "\u0110\xF3ng ph\u1EA7n xem tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi k\xE9o b\xE0i. L\xE1
      s\u1EBD tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i \u0111\xFAng khay v\xE0 k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc ban
      \u0111\u1EA7u."
    english: Close inspection before dragging. The card returns to its original hand
      and size.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xF3ng ph\u1EA7n xem tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi k\xE9o b\xE0i. L\xE1
      s\u1EBD tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i \u0111\xFAng khay v\xE0 k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc ban
      \u0111\u1EA7u."
  - key: tutorial.6.success
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFt c\xE1ch xem v\xE0 \u0111\xF3ng m\xF4 t\u1EA3."
    english: You can now inspect and close a card.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFt c\xE1ch xem v\xE0 \u0111\xF3ng m\xF4
      t\u1EA3."
  - key: tutorial.7.title
    source: "\u0110\u1EB7t l\xE1 \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn"
    english: Play your first card
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EB7t l\xE1 \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn"
  - key: tutorial.7.instruction
    source: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I \u1EDF l\xE1 S\u1ED0 10, k\xE9o \u0111\u1EBFn
      GH\u1EBE VI\u1EC0N XANH r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: HOLD LEFT MOUSE on card NUMBER 10, drag it to the GREEN OUTLINED SEAT,
      then release.
    vietnamese: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I \u1EDF l\xE1 S\u1ED0 10, k\xE9o \u0111\u1EBFn
      GH\u1EBE VI\u1EC0N XANH r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: tutorial.7.purpose
    source: "\u0110\u1EB7t b\xE0i thu\u1ED9c phe \u0111ang ch\u01A1i t\u1ED1n 2 tim.
      Gh\u1EBF l\xE0 v\u1ECB tr\xED ch\u1EE9a m\u1ED9t l\xE1 tr\xEAn b\xE0n, kh\xF4ng
      ph\u1EA3i khay b\xE0i."
    english: Playing a card of the active faction costs 2 hearts. A seat holds one
      card on the board; it is not a hand.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EB7t b\xE0i thu\u1ED9c phe \u0111ang ch\u01A1i t\u1ED1n
      2 tim. Gh\u1EBF l\xE0 v\u1ECB tr\xED ch\u1EE9a m\u1ED9t l\xE1 tr\xEAn b\xE0n,
      kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i khay b\xE0i."
  - key: tutorial.7.success
    source: "\u0110\u1EB7t th\xE0nh c\xF4ng: 5 tim \u2192 3 tim."
    english: "Card placed: 5 hearts \u2192 3 hearts."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EB7t th\xE0nh c\xF4ng: 5 tim \u2192 3 tim."
  - key: tutorial.8.title
    source: "\u0110\u01B0a Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n l\xEAn b\xE0n"
    english: Play the Hunter
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u01B0a Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n l\xEAn b\xE0n"
  - key: tutorial.8.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 S\u1ED0 9 \u0111\u1EBFn gh\u1EBF c\xF3
      vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: LEFT-DRAG card NUMBER 9 to the green outlined seat, then release.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 S\u1ED0 9 \u0111\u1EBFn gh\u1EBF
      c\xF3 vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: tutorial.8.purpose
    source: "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng khi \u0111\xE3
      \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n. \u0110\u1EB7t l\xE1 th\u1EE9 hai t\u1ED1n th\xEAm 2
      tim; b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD c\xF2n 1 tim."
    english: Hunter can use its skill only on the board. This second card costs another
      2 hearts, leaving 1.
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng khi \u0111\xE3
      \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n. \u0110\u1EB7t l\xE1 th\u1EE9 hai t\u1ED1n th\xEAm 2
      tim; b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD c\xF2n 1 tim."
  - key: tutorial.8.success
    source: "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n \u0111\xE3 l\xEAn b\xE0n. D\xE2n l\xE0ng c\xF2n 1/5
      tim."
    english: Hunter is on the board. Villagers have 1/5 hearts.
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n \u0111\xE3 l\xEAn b\xE0n. D\xE2n l\xE0ng c\xF2n
      1/5 tim."
  - key: tutorial.9.title
    source: "Chuy\u1EC3n l\u01B0\u1EE3t"
    english: Change turns
    vietnamese: "Chuy\u1EC3n l\u01B0\u1EE3t"
  - key: tutorial.9.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
    english: Click the highlighted END TURN button.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang
      s\xE1ng."
  - key: tutorial.9.purpose
    source: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c ti\xEAu h\u1EBFt tim. H\u1EBFt
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t, \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1ED9ng v\u1EDBi 5 tim."
    english: You do not have to spend every heart. The other side starts its turn
      with 5 hearts.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng b\u1EAFt bu\u1ED9c ti\xEAu h\u1EBFt tim. H\u1EBFt
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t, \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1ED9ng v\u1EDBi 5 tim."
  - key: tutorial.9.success
    source: "\u0110\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t phe Cursermancer; khay b\xE0i \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1ED5i theo l\u01B0\u1EE3t."
    english: Cursermancer turn; the displayed hand has changed.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t phe Cursermancer; khay b\xE0i \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1ED5i theo l\u01B0\u1EE3t."
  - key: tutorial.10.title
    source: "Nh\xECn vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt"
    english: See secret roles
    vietnamese: "Nh\xECn vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt"
  - key: tutorial.10.instruction
    source: "Quan s\xE1t l\xE1 S\u1ED0 1 \u0111ang hi\u1EC7n m\u1EB7t Cursermancer,
      r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
    english: "Observe card NUMBER 1 showing its Cursermancer face, then click UNDERSTOOD
      \xB7 CONTINUE."
    vietnamese: "Quan s\xE1t l\xE1 S\u1ED0 1 \u0111ang hi\u1EC7n m\u1EB7t Cursermancer,
      r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
  - key: tutorial.10.purpose
    source: "Phe Cursermancer t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng th\u1EA5y danh t\xEDnh v\xE0
      nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh, k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt khi Blind b\xE1o sai.
      D\xE2n l\xE0ng ch\u1EC9 th\u1EA5y th\xF4ng tin c\xF4ng khai; kh\xF4ng c\xF3
      n\xFAt xem b\xED m\u1EADt."
    english: Cursermancer automatically sees true identities and infection, even
      when Blind reports a lie. Villagers see public information only. There is no
      reveal button.
    vietnamese: "Phe Cursermancer t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng th\u1EA5y danh t\xEDnh v\xE0
      nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh, k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt khi Blind b\xE1o sai.
      D\xE2n l\xE0ng ch\u1EC9 th\u1EA5y th\xF4ng tin c\xF4ng khai; kh\xF4ng c\xF3
      n\xFAt xem b\xED m\u1EADt."
  - key: tutorial.10.success
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 hi\u1EC3u: m\u1ED7i phe c\xF3 g\xF3c nh\xECn ri\xEAng,
      Cursermancer kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n gi\u1EEF n\xFAt \u0111\u1EC3 xem."
    english: Each side has its own view. Cursermancer does not need to hold a reveal
      button.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 hi\u1EC3u: m\u1ED7i phe c\xF3 g\xF3c nh\xECn
      ri\xEAng, Cursermancer kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n gi\u1EEF n\xFAt \u0111\u1EC3 xem."
  - key: tutorial.11.title
    source: "\u0110\u1EB7t Cursermancer l\xEAn b\xE0n"
    english: Play the Cursermancer
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EB7t Cursermancer l\xEAn b\xE0n"
  - key: tutorial.11.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 S\u1ED0 1 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF c\xF3 vi\u1EC1n
      xanh."
    english: LEFT-DRAG card NUMBER 1 to the green outlined seat.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 S\u1ED0 1 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF c\xF3
      vi\u1EC1n xanh."
  - key: tutorial.11.purpose
    source: "Cursermancer v\u1EABn ng\u1EE5y trang b\u1EB1ng m\u1EB7t b\xE0i th\u01B0\u1EDDng.
      \u0110\u1EB7t l\xE1 c\u1EE7a phe Cursermancer trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t Cursermancer
      c\u0169ng t\u1ED1n 2 tim."
    english: Cursermancer remains disguised to the other side. Playing a Cursermancer-faction
      card on its own turn also costs 2 hearts.
    vietnamese: "Cursermancer v\u1EABn ng\u1EE5y trang b\u1EB1ng m\u1EB7t b\xE0i
      th\u01B0\u1EDDng. \u0110\u1EB7t l\xE1 c\u1EE7a phe Cursermancer trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      Cursermancer c\u0169ng t\u1ED1n 2 tim."
  - key: tutorial.11.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u0111\xE3 ng\u1ED3i tr\xEAn b\xE0n d\u01B0\u1EDBi d\u1EA1ng
      ng\u1EE5y trang."
    english: Card 1 is seated on the board in disguise.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u0111\xE3 ng\u1ED3i tr\xEAn b\xE0n d\u01B0\u1EDBi
      d\u1EA1ng ng\u1EE5y trang."
  - key: tutorial.12.title
    source: "Tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
    english: Back to Villagers
    vietnamese: "Tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
  - key: tutorial.12.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0111\u1EC3 chuy\u1EC3n sang
      D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
    english: Click END TURN to switch to Villagers.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0111\u1EC3 chuy\u1EC3n
      sang D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
  - key: tutorial.12.purpose
    source: "\u1EDE l\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1EDBi, D\xE2n l\xE0ng c\xF3 l\u1EA1i 5 tim.
      S\u1ED1 tim n\xE0y \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng Th\u1EE3
      s\u0103n."
    english: 'Villagers regain 5 hearts at the start of this turn: enough to try
      Hunter''s skill.'
    vietnamese: "\u1EDE l\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1EDBi, D\xE2n l\xE0ng c\xF3 l\u1EA1i 5
      tim. S\u1ED1 tim n\xE0y \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng
      Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n."
  - key: tutorial.12.success
    source: "D\xE2n l\xE0ng c\xF3 5 tim \u0111\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
    english: Villagers have 5 hearts to use a skill.
    vietnamese: "D\xE2n l\xE0ng c\xF3 5 tim \u0111\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng."
  - key: tutorial.13.title
    source: "D\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n"
    english: Use Hunter's skill
    vietnamese: "D\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n"
  - key: tutorial.13.instruction
    source: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I \u1EDF l\xE1 S\u1ED0 9, k\xE9o m\u0169i
      ng\u1EAFm \u0111\u1EBFn l\xE1 S\u1ED0 1 r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: HOLD RIGHT MOUSE on card NUMBER 9, drag the aiming arrow to card NUMBER
      1, then release.
    vietnamese: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I \u1EDF l\xE1 S\u1ED0 9, k\xE9o m\u0169i
      ng\u1EAFm \u0111\u1EBFn l\xE1 S\u1ED0 1 r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: tutorial.13.purpose
    source: "Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i K\xC9O l\xE0 nh\u1EAFm k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng; chu\u1ED9t
      ph\u1EA3i B\u1EA4M l\xE0 xem b\xE0i. Ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn t\u1ED1n 5 tim v\xE0
      \u0111\u01B0a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\xE0o ngh\u0129a trang."
    english: RIGHT-DRAG aims a skill; RIGHT-CLICK inspects. The shot costs 5 hearts
      and sends the target to the Cemetery.
    vietnamese: "Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i K\xC9O l\xE0 nh\u1EAFm k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng; chu\u1ED9t
      ph\u1EA3i B\u1EA4M l\xE0 xem b\xE0i. Ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn t\u1ED1n 5 tim v\xE0
      \u0111\u01B0a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\xE0o ngh\u0129a trang."
  - key: tutorial.13.success
    source: "\u0110\xE3 b\u1EAFn \u0111\xFAng m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\xE0 d\xF9ng h\u1EBFt
      5 tim."
    english: The correct target was shot, spending all 5 hearts.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 b\u1EAFn \u0111\xFAng m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\xE0 d\xF9ng
      h\u1EBFt 5 tim."
  - key: tutorial.14.title
    source: "M\u1EDF ngh\u0129a trang"
    english: Open the Cemetery
    vietnamese: "M\u1EDF ngh\u0129a trang"
  - key: tutorial.14.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m n\xFAt NGH\u0128A TRANG \u0111ang s\xE1ng b\xEAn tr\xE1i."
    english: Click the highlighted CEMETERY button on the left.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m n\xFAt NGH\u0128A TRANG \u0111ang s\xE1ng b\xEAn tr\xE1i."
  - key: tutorial.14.purpose
    source: "C\xE1c l\xE1 b\u1ECB ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t n\u1EB1m \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y.
      Vi\u1EC7c xem ngh\u0129a trang kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim. M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c v\u1EDBi b\xE0i ch\u1EBFt."
    english: Destroyed cards are kept here. Viewing the Cemetery is free. Some skills
      interact with dead cards.
    vietnamese: "C\xE1c l\xE1 b\u1ECB ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t n\u1EB1m \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y.
      Vi\u1EC7c xem ngh\u0129a trang kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim. M\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 t\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c v\u1EDBi b\xE0i ch\u1EBFt."
  - key: tutorial.14.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u0111\xE3 n\u1EB1m trong ngh\u0129a trang."
    english: Card 1 is now in the Cemetery.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u0111\xE3 n\u1EB1m trong ngh\u0129a trang."
  - key: tutorial.15.title
    source: "\u0110\xF3ng ngh\u0129a trang"
    english: Close the Cemetery
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xF3ng ngh\u0129a trang"
  - key: tutorial.15.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m l\u1EA1i n\xFAt NGH\u0128A TRANG \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1
      b\xE0n ch\u01A1i."
    english: Click CLOSE on the Cemetery panel to return to the board.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m l\u1EA1i n\xFAt NGH\u0128A TRANG \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF
      v\u1EC1 b\xE0n ch\u01A1i."
  - key: tutorial.15.purpose
    source: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 m\u1EDF l\u1EA1i khi c\u1EA7n ki\u1EC3m tra
      l\xE1 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i. B\xE0i ch\u1EBFt kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EB7t ho\u1EB7c b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
    english: Reopen it whenever you need to inspect eliminated cards. Dead cards
      cannot be played or vote.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 m\u1EDF l\u1EA1i khi c\u1EA7n ki\u1EC3m
      tra l\xE1 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i. B\xE0i ch\u1EBFt kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EB7t ho\u1EB7c b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: tutorial.15.success
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 b\xE0n ch\u01A1i."
    english: You are back at the board.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 b\xE0n ch\u01A1i."
  - key: text.301
    source: "Th\u1EED nghi th\u1EE9c"
    english: Try the ritual
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EED nghi th\u1EE9c"
  - key: tutorial.16.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m TH\u1EEC NGHI TH\u1EE8C. B\xE0i h\u1ECDc s\u1EBD \u0111\u1EB7t
      s\u1EB5n l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 v\xE0 s\u1ED1 2 \u0111\u1EC3 luy\u1EC7n t\u1EADp."
    english: Click TRY THE RITUAL. The lesson will place cards 11 and 2 for practice.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m TH\u1EEC NGHI TH\u1EE8C. B\xE0i h\u1ECDc s\u1EBD \u0111\u1EB7t
      s\u1EB5n l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 v\xE0 s\u1ED1 2 \u0111\u1EC3 luy\u1EC7n t\u1EADp."
  - key: tutorial.16.purpose
    source: "Trong v\xE1n th\u1EADt, nghi th\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EBFn khi b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA7y
      ho\u1EB7c Tr\u01B0\u1EDFng l\xE0ng g\u1ECDi. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 t\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng
      m\u1EABu, kh\xF4ng tr\u1EEB tim c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
    english: In a real match, a full board or Reeve starts the ritual. This is a
      prepared example and spends no hearts.
    vietnamese: "Trong v\xE1n th\u1EADt, nghi th\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EBFn khi b\xE0n
      \u0111\u1EA7y ho\u1EB7c Tr\u01B0\u1EDFng l\xE0ng g\u1ECDi. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0
      t\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng m\u1EABu, kh\xF4ng tr\u1EEB tim c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
  - key: tutorial.16.success
    source: "T\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng m\u1EABu \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng: \u0111ang t\u1EADp
      phe Cursermancer."
    english: The example is ready. You are practicing the Cursermancer side.
    vietnamese: "T\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng m\u1EABu \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng: \u0111ang
      t\u1EADp phe Cursermancer."
  - key: tutorial.17.title
    source: "Nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu"
    english: Infect a target
    vietnamese: "Nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu"
  - key: tutorial.17.instruction
    source: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I \u1EDF l\xE1 S\u1ED0 11, k\xE9o sang l\xE1
      S\u1ED0 9 vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: HOLD LEFT MOUSE on card NUMBER 11, drag to green outlined card NUMBER
      9, then release.
    vietnamese: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I \u1EDF l\xE1 S\u1ED0 11, k\xE9o sang
      l\xE1 S\u1ED0 9 vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: tutorial.17.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 11 l\xE0 Cursermancer \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn. Cursermancer l\xE2y
      cho m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\xF9ng h\xE0ng/c\u1ED9t; gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng ch\u1EB7n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE2y. Nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh kh\xE1c v\u1EDBi vai tr\xF2
      Cursermancer."
    english: Card 11 is the chosen Cursermancer. Infection travels along a row or
      column; empty seats block it. Infection is different from the Cursermancer
      role.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 11 l\xE0 Cursermancer \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn. Cursermancer l\xE2y
      cho m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\xF9ng h\xE0ng/c\u1ED9t; gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng ch\u1EB7n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE2y. Nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh kh\xE1c v\u1EDBi vai tr\xF2
      Cursermancer."
  - key: tutorial.17.success
    source: "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n s\u1ED1 9 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m; l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      11 v\u1EABn l\xE0 Cursermancer."
    english: Hunter number 9 is infected. Card 11 remains the Cursermancer.
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n s\u1ED1 9 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m; l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 11 v\u1EABn l\xE0 Cursermancer."
  - key: text.324
    source: "Sang hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF"
    english: To Sacrifice
    vietnamese: "Sang hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF"
  - key: tutorial.18.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m SANG HI\u1EBEN T\u1EBE \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
    english: Click the highlighted TO SACRIFICE button.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m SANG HI\u1EBEN T\u1EBE \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
  - key: tutorial.18.purpose
    source: "Hai phe l\u1EA7n l\u01B0\u1EE3t b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. M\u1ED7i l\xE1 \u0111ang
      \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n c\u1EE7a nh\xF3m \u0111\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t ph\u1EA3i
      ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c."
    english: Both sides vote in turn. Each on-board card of the active original faction
      must choose a different card.
    vietnamese: "Hai phe l\u1EA7n l\u01B0\u1EE3t b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. M\u1ED7i l\xE1
      \u0111ang \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n c\u1EE7a nh\xF3m \u0111\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      ph\u1EA3i ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c."
  - key: tutorial.18.success
    source: "\u0110\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a nh\xF3m D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng."
    english: The Villager faction votes first.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a nh\xF3m
      D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
  - key: tutorial.19.title
    source: "Phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10"
    english: Card 10's vote
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10"
  - key: tutorial.19.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 S\u1ED0 10 \u0111\u1EBFn l\xE1
      S\u1ED0 2 vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: LEFT-DRAG from card NUMBER 10 to green outlined card NUMBER 2, then
      release.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 S\u1ED0 10 \u0111\u1EBFn
      l\xE1 S\u1ED0 2 vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: tutorial.19.purpose
    source: "M\u0169i t\xEAn l\xFAc n\xE0y l\xE0 phi\u1EBFu b\u1EA7u, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i
      di chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i. Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu cho
      ch\xEDnh m\xECnh."
    english: The arrow now casts a vote; it does not move the card. A card cannot
      vote for itself.
    vietnamese: "M\u0169i t\xEAn l\xFAc n\xE0y l\xE0 phi\u1EBFu b\u1EA7u, kh\xF4ng
      ph\u1EA3i di chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i. Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu
      cho ch\xEDnh m\xECnh."
  - key: tutorial.19.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      2."
    english: Card 10 has voted for card 2.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      2."
  - key: tutorial.20.title
    source: "Phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n"
    english: Hunter's vote
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n"
  - key: tutorial.20.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 S\u1ED0 9 \u0111\u1EBFn l\xE1
      S\u1ED0 2."
    english: LEFT-DRAG from card NUMBER 9 to card NUMBER 2.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 S\u1ED0 9 \u0111\u1EBFn
      l\xE1 S\u1ED0 2."
  - key: tutorial.20.purpose
    source: "M\u1ED7i l\xE1 b\u1ECF m\u1ED9t phi\u1EBFu ri\xEAng. \u0110\xE3 d\xF9ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ho\u1EB7c \u0111ang nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh v\u1EABn ph\u1EA3i
      b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu n\u1EBFu l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
    english: Each card casts its own vote. Using a skill or being infected does not
      exempt a living on-board card.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED7i l\xE1 b\u1ECF m\u1ED9t phi\u1EBFu ri\xEAng. \u0110\xE3
      d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ho\u1EB7c \u0111ang nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh v\u1EABn
      ph\u1EA3i b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu n\u1EBFu l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
  - key: tutorial.20.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 9 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 2."
    english: Card 9 has voted for card 2.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 9 \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      2."
  - key: tutorial.21.title
    source: "Phi\u1EBFu cu\u1ED1i c\u1EE7a nh\xF3m"
    english: The faction's last vote
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu cu\u1ED1i c\u1EE7a nh\xF3m"
  - key: tutorial.21.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 S\u1ED0 11 \u0111\u1EBFn l\xE1
      S\u1ED0 2."
    english: LEFT-DRAG from card NUMBER 11 to card NUMBER 2.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 S\u1ED0 11 \u0111\u1EBFn
      l\xE1 S\u1ED0 2."
  - key: tutorial.21.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 11 mang vai tr\xF2 Cursermancer nh\u01B0ng thu\u1ED9c nh\xF3m
      D\xE2n l\xE0ng, n\xEAn v\u1EABn b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu \u1EDF l\u01B0\u1EE3t c\u1EE7a
      nh\xF3m n\xE0y."
    english: Card 11 is secretly a Cursermancer but belongs to the Villager faction,
      so it votes with this group.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 11 mang vai tr\xF2 Cursermancer nh\u01B0ng thu\u1ED9c nh\xF3m
      D\xE2n l\xE0ng, n\xEAn v\u1EABn b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu \u1EDF l\u01B0\u1EE3t c\u1EE7a
      nh\xF3m n\xE0y."
  - key: tutorial.21.success
    source: "C\u1EA3 3 l\xE1 c\u1EE7a nh\xF3m D\xE2n l\xE0ng \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
    english: All 3 Villager-faction cards have voted.
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA3 3 l\xE1 c\u1EE7a nh\xF3m D\xE2n l\xE0ng \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF
      phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: text.324
    source: "Ch\u1ED1t phi\u1EBFu"
    english: Confirm votes
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ED1t phi\u1EBFu"
  - key: tutorial.22.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m CH\u1ED0T PHI\u1EBEU \u0111\u1EC3 chuy\u1EC3n cho phe c\xF2n
      l\u1EA1i."
    english: Click CONFIRM VOTES to pass to the other side.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m CH\u1ED0T PHI\u1EBEU \u0111\u1EC3 chuy\u1EC3n cho phe c\xF2n
      l\u1EA1i."
  - key: tutorial.22.purpose
    source: "N\xFAt ch\u1EC9 ch\u1ED1t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c khi \u0111\u1EE7 phi\u1EBFu.
      Khi ch\u01A1i th\u1EADt, v\u1ECB tr\xED phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF k\xEDn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt."
    english: You can confirm only when every required card has voted. The opponent's
      votes remain private before the tally.
    vietnamese: "N\xFAt ch\u1EC9 ch\u1ED1t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c khi \u0111\u1EE7 phi\u1EBFu.
      Khi ch\u01A1i th\u1EADt, v\u1ECB tr\xED phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF k\xEDn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt."
  - key: tutorial.22.success
    source: "Phi\u1EBFu D\xE2n l\xE0ng \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ED1t; \u0111\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      nh\xF3m phe Cursermancer."
    english: Villager votes confirmed. The Cursermancer faction votes next.
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu D\xE2n l\xE0ng \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ED1t; \u0111\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      nh\xF3m phe Cursermancer."
  - key: tutorial.23.title
    source: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng"
    english: The opponent's turn
    vietnamese: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng"
  - key: tutorial.23.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m XEM L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0110\u1ED0I PH\u01AF\u01A0NG. B\xE0i h\u1ECDc
      s\u1EBD b\u1ECF m\u1ED9t phi\u1EBFu m\u1EABu t\u1EEB l\xE1 s\u1ED1 2."
    english: Click VIEW OPPONENT TURN. The lesson will cast one sample vote from
      card 2.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m XEM L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0110\u1ED0I PH\u01AF\u01A0NG. B\xE0i
      h\u1ECDc s\u1EBD b\u1ECF m\u1ED9t phi\u1EBFu m\u1EABu t\u1EEB l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      2."
  - key: tutorial.23.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 2 b\u1EA7u cho l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10. Sau khi c\u1EA3 hai phe
      ch\u1ED1t, game t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1EBFm phi\u1EBFu v\xE0 \xE1p d\u1EE5ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3."
    english: Card 2 votes for card 10. When both sides confirm, the game tallies
      votes and applies skills.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 2 b\u1EA7u cho l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10. Sau khi c\u1EA3 hai
      phe ch\u1ED1t, game t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1EBFm phi\u1EBFu v\xE0 \xE1p d\u1EE5ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3."
  - key: tutorial.23.success
    source: "Hai phe \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ED1t. H\xE3y quan s\xE1t k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 t\u1ED5ng
      k\u1EBFt."
    english: Both sides have confirmed. Watch the tally.
    vietnamese: "Hai phe \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ED1t. H\xE3y quan s\xE1t k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3
      t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt."
  - key: tutorial.24.title
    source: "Quan s\xE1t t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt"
    english: Watch the tally
    vietnamese: "Quan s\xE1t t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt"
  - key: tutorial.24.instruction
    source: "\u0110\u1EE3i game \u0111\u1EBFm phi\u1EBFu, hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 2 r\u1ED3i thu c\xE1c l\xE1 s\u1ED1ng v\u1EC1 tay."
    english: Wait for the game to count votes, sacrifice card 2 and return surviving
      cards to hand.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EE3i game \u0111\u1EBFm phi\u1EBFu, hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 2 r\u1ED3i thu c\xE1c l\xE1 s\u1ED1ng v\u1EC1 tay."
  - key: tutorial.24.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF. N\u1EBFu
      h\xF2a \u1EDF s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu cao nh\u1EA5t, c\xE1c l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED3ng
      h\u1EA1ng \u0111\u1EC1u b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF."
    english: The most-voted card is sacrificed. A tie for the highest count sacrifices
      all tied cards.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF.
      N\u1EBFu h\xF2a \u1EDF s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu cao nh\u1EA5t, c\xE1c l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED3ng
      h\u1EA1ng \u0111\u1EC1u b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF."
  - key: tutorial.24.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 2 nh\u1EADn 3 phi\u1EBFu v\xE0 b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF;
      c\xE1c l\xE1 s\u1ED1ng \u0111\xE3 v\u1EC1 tay."
    english: Card 2 received 3 votes and was sacrificed. Survivors returned to hand.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 2 nh\u1EADn 3 phi\u1EBFu v\xE0 b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF;
      c\xE1c l\xE1 s\u1ED1ng \u0111\xE3 v\u1EC1 tay."
  - key: tutorial.25.title
    source: "Th\u1EED thanh tr\u1EEBng"
    english: Try Purge
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EED thanh tr\u1EEBng"
  - key: tutorial.25.instruction
    source: "B\xE0i h\u1ECDc chuy\u1EC3n sang D\xE2n l\xE0ng. B\u1EA5m THANH TR\u1EEANG
      \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
    english: The lesson switches to Villagers. Click the highlighted PURGE button.
    vietnamese: "B\xE0i h\u1ECDc chuy\u1EC3n sang D\xE2n l\xE0ng. B\u1EA5m THANH
      TR\u1EEANG \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
  - key: tutorial.25.purpose
    source: "Thanh tr\u1EEBng lo\u1EA1i m\u1ECDi l\xE1 \u0111ang nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh,
      k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 trong khay \u1EA9n. M\u1ED7i phe ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 2 l\u1EA7n
      m\u1ED7i v\xE1n; n\xF3 kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 t\xECm Cursermancer."
    english: Purge destroys every infected card, including cards in hidden hands.
      Each side has only 2 uses per match. It does not automatically find Cursermancers.
    vietnamese: "Thanh tr\u1EEBng lo\u1EA1i m\u1ECDi l\xE1 \u0111ang nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh,
      k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 trong khay \u1EA9n. M\u1ED7i phe ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 2 l\u1EA7n
      m\u1ED7i v\xE1n; n\xF3 kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 t\xECm Cursermancer."
  - key: tutorial.25.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 9 b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i v\xEC nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh. D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng c\xF2n 1/2 l\u1EA7n thanh tr\u1EEBng."
    english: Card 9 was eliminated because it was infected. Villagers have 1/2 Purges
      left.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 9 b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i v\xEC nhi\u1EC5m b\u1EC7nh. D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng c\xF2n 1/2 l\u1EA7n thanh tr\u1EEBng."
  - key: tutorial.26.title
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFt c\xE1ch ch\u01A1i"
    english: You know how to play
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFt c\xE1ch ch\u01A1i"
  - key: tutorial.26.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 t\u1EF1 ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2, \u0111\u1EB7t b\xE0i,
      d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a v\xE0 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. H\xE3y
      th\u1EED m\u1ED9t v\xE1n v\u1EDBi bot!"
    english: You have chosen roles, played cards, used skills, infected and voted.
      Try a match against the bot!
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 t\u1EF1 ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2, \u0111\u1EB7t
      b\xE0i, d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a v\xE0 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu.
      H\xE3y th\u1EED m\u1ED9t v\xE1n v\u1EDBi bot!"
  - key: tutorial.26.purpose
    source: "D\xE2n l\xE0ng th\u1EAFng khi h\u1EBFt Cursermancer. Cursermancer th\u1EAFng
      khi s\u1ED1 Cursermancer s\u1ED1ng \u2265 s\u1ED1 D\xE2n l\xE0ng s\u1ED1ng
      kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i Cursermancer. B\xE0i h\u1ECDc \u0111\xE3 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc;
      ch\u01B0a x\u1EED th\u1EAFng thua."
    english: "Villagers win when no Cursermancer survives. Cursermancer wins when
      living Cursermancers \u2265 living non-Cursermancer Villagers. This lesson
      is complete; no winner is declared."
    vietnamese: "D\xE2n l\xE0ng th\u1EAFng khi h\u1EBFt Cursermancer. Cursermancer
      th\u1EAFng khi s\u1ED1 Cursermancer s\u1ED1ng \u2265 s\u1ED1 D\xE2n l\xE0ng
      s\u1ED1ng kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i Cursermancer. B\xE0i h\u1ECDc \u0111\xE3 k\u1EBFt
      th\xFAc; ch\u01B0a x\u1EED th\u1EAFng thua."
  - key: tutorial.26.success
    source: "Ho\xE0n th\xE0nh h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn."
    english: Tutorial complete.
    vietnamese: "Ho\xE0n th\xE0nh h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn."
  - key: tutorial.inspect
    source: "D\xC2N L\xC0NG \xB7 S\u1ED0 10\n\n\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t l\xE1 th\u01B0\u1EDDng,
      kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng.\n\n\u0110\u1EB7t
      t\u1EEB nh\xF3m c\u1EE7a phe \u0111ang ch\u01A1i: 2 tim. Nh\xF3m \u0111\u1ED1i
      ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp: 5 tim.\n\nChu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i l\u1EA7n
      n\u1EEFa \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng."
    english: "VILLAGER \xB7 NUMBER 10\n\nAn ordinary card with no active skill.\n\nPlay
      from the active faction: 2 hearts. Opponent or neutral cards: 5 hearts.\n\nRight-click
      again to close."
    vietnamese: "D\xC2N L\xC0NG \xB7 S\u1ED0 10\n\n\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t l\xE1
      th\u01B0\u1EDDng, kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng.\n\n\u0110\u1EB7t
      t\u1EEB nh\xF3m c\u1EE7a phe \u0111ang ch\u01A1i: 2 tim. Nh\xF3m \u0111\u1ED1i
      ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp: 5 tim.\n\nChu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i l\u1EA7n
      n\u1EEFa \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng."
  - key: text.224
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn phe, t\u1EA1o ph\xF2ng ho\u1EB7c nh\u1EADp m\xE3 ph\xF2ng
      c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
    english: Choose a side, create a room or enter a room code.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn phe, t\u1EA1o ph\xF2ng ho\u1EB7c nh\u1EADp m\xE3 ph\xF2ng
      c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
  - key: text.225
    source: "H\u1ECDc c\xE1ch ch\u01A1i \xB7 h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc"
    english: "Learn to play \xB7 guided tutorial"
    vietnamese: "H\u1ECDc c\xE1ch ch\u01A1i \xB7 h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn t\u1EEBng
      b\u01B0\u1EDBc"
  - key: text.226
    source: "Ch\u01A1i D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
    english: Play as Villagers
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01A1i D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
  - key: text.227
    source: "\u0110\u1EA4U V\u1EDAI M\xC1Y D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
    english: AGAINST A VILLAGER BOT
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EA4U V\u1EDAI M\xC1Y D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
  - key: text.228
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn phe Cursermancer"
    english: Choose Cursermancer
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn phe Cursermancer"
  - key: text.229
    source: "M\u1ED9t ng\xF4i l\xE0ng. Hai ph\xEDa c\u1EE7a l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n.\nCh\u1ECDn
      phe c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
    english: 'One village. Two sides of a curse.

      Choose your side to begin.'
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t ng\xF4i l\xE0ng. Hai ph\xEDa c\u1EE7a l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n.\nCh\u1ECDn
      phe c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
  - key: text.230
    source: "\u0110\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi bot Cursermancer. Quan s\xE1t nghi th\u1EE9c,\nsuy
      lu\u1EADn v\xE0 d\u1EADp t\u1EAFt ngu\u1ED3n l\xE2y."
    english: 'Face a Cursermancer bot.

      Observe, deduce and end

      the
      source of infection.'
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi bot Cursermancer. Quan s\xE1t nghi th\u1EE9c,\nsuy
      lu\u1EADn v\xE0 d\u1EADp t\u1EAFt ngu\u1ED3n l\xE2y."
  - key: text.231
    source: "T\u1EA1o ho\u1EB7c v\xE0o ph\xF2ng b\u1EB1ng m\xE3.\nCh\u1ECDn phe Cursermancer
      ho\u1EB7c D\xE2n l\xE0ng\n\u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EA5u c\xF9ng b\u1EA1n b\xE8."
    english: 'Create or join with a code.

      Choose your side and play

      with
      a friend.'
    vietnamese: "T\u1EA1o ho\u1EB7c v\xE0o ph\xF2ng b\u1EB1ng m\xE3.\nCh\u1ECDn phe
      Cursermancer ho\u1EB7c D\xE2n l\xE0ng\n\u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EA5u c\xF9ng b\u1EA1n
      b\xE8."
  - key: text.232
    source: "M\xE3 ph\xF2ng \xB7 \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1ED1ng khi t\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EC3
      l\u1EA5y m\xE3 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng"
    english: "Room code \xB7 leave blank to create a random code"
    vietnamese: "M\xE3 ph\xF2ng \xB7 \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1ED1ng khi t\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EC3
      l\u1EA5y m\xE3 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng"
  - key: guided.button.continue
    source: "\u0110\xE3 hi\u1EC3u \xB7 Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
    english: "Got it \xB7 Continue"
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 hi\u1EC3u \xB7 Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
  - key: text.234
    source: "Tho\xE1t"
    english: Quit
    vietnamese: "Tho\xE1t"
  - key: text.235
    source: "C\u1EA5p 1 ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m quen"
    english: Level 1 is a good place to start
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA5p 1 ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE0m quen"
  - key: text.236
    source: "CH\u01A0I ONLINE \xB7 2 NG\u01AF\u1EDCI"
    english: "ONLINE \xB7 2 PLAYERS"
    vietnamese: "CH\u01A0I ONLINE \xB7 2 NG\u01AF\u1EDCI"
  - key: text.237
    source: 'VD: LANG01'
    english: E.g. VILLAGE01
    vietnamese: 'VD: LANG01'
  - key: text.238
    source: "\u0110\u1EA4U V\u1EDAI M\xC1Y CURSERMANCER"
    english: AGAINST A CURSERMANCER BOT
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EA4U V\u1EDAI M\xC1Y CURSERMANCER"
  - key: text.239
    source: "CHI\u1EBEN THU\u1EACT  /  SUY LU\u1EACN  /  L\u1EDCI NGUY\u1EC0N"
    english: STRATEGY  /  DEDUCTION  /  THE CURSE
    vietnamese: "CHI\u1EBEN THU\u1EACT  /  SUY LU\u1EACN  /  L\u1EDCI NGUY\u1EC0N"
  - key: text.240
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn phe D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
    english: Choose Villagers
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn phe D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
  - key: text.241
    source: "T\u1EA1o ph\xF2ng"
    english: Create room
    vietnamese: "T\u1EA1o ph\xF2ng"
  - key: text.242
    source: "R\u1EDDi ph\xF2ng"
    english: Leave room
    vietnamese: "R\u1EDDi ph\xF2ng"
  - key: text.243
    source: "Ch\u01A1i online"
    english: Play online
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01A1i online"
  - key: text.244
    source: "CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I  Ch\u1ECDn / k\xE9o b\xE0i     \xB7     CHU\u1ED8T
      PH\u1EA2I  Xem m\xF4 t\u1EA3     \xB7     ESC  Lu\u1EADt ch\u01A1i"
    english: "LEFT MOUSE  Select / drag     \xB7     RIGHT MOUSE  Inspect     \xB7    
      ESC  Rules"
    vietnamese: "CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I  Ch\u1ECDn / k\xE9o b\xE0i     \xB7     CHU\u1ED8T
      PH\u1EA2I  Xem m\xF4 t\u1EA3     \xB7     ESC  Lu\u1EADt ch\u01A1i"
  - key: text.245
    source: "Lu\u1EADt ch\u01A1i"
    english: Rules
    vietnamese: "Lu\u1EADt ch\u01A1i"
  - key: text.246
    source: Phe Cursermancer
    english: Cursermancer
    vietnamese: Phe Cursermancer
  - key: text.247
    source: "Phe D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
    english: Villagers
    vietnamese: "Phe D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
  - key: text.248
    source: "\u0110\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi bot D\xE2n l\xE0ng. Ch\u1ECDn Cursermancer\nb\xED
      m\u1EADt, l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m v\xE0 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7\nl\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n."
    english: 'Face a Villager bot.

      Choose secret Cursermancers,

      spread
      and protect the curse.'
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi bot D\xE2n l\xE0ng. Ch\u1ECDn Cursermancer\nb\xED
      m\u1EADt, l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m v\xE0 b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7\nl\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n."
  - key: text.249
    source: "Ch\u01A1i Cursermancer"
    english: Play as Cursermancer
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01A1i Cursermancer"
  - key: text.250
    source: "\u0110\u1ED8 KH\xD3 KHI \u0110\u1EA4U BOT"
    english: BOT DIFFICULTY
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ED8 KH\xD3 KHI \u0110\u1EA4U BOT"
  - key: text.251
    source: "V\xE0o ph\xF2ng"
    english: Join room
    vietnamese: "V\xE0o ph\xF2ng"
  - key: text.252
    source: "Cu\u1ED9n \u0111\u1EC3 xem \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7 \xB7 Tr\u1EADn
      \u0111\u1EA5u \u0111ang t\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng"
    english: "Scroll to read \xB7 Match paused"
    vietnamese: "Cu\u1ED9n \u0111\u1EC3 xem \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7 \xB7 Tr\u1EADn
      \u0111\u1EA5u \u0111ang t\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng"
  - key: text.253
    source: "Cu\u1ED9n \u0111\u1EC3 xem \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7 \xB7 Tr\u1EADn
      online v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
    english: "Scroll to read \xB7 Online match continues"
    vietnamese: "Cu\u1ED9n \u0111\u1EC3 xem \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7 \xB7 Tr\u1EADn
      online v\u1EABn ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
  - key: text.254
    source: "Phe c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n: CURSERMANCER\nCh\u1ECDn phe \u0111ang c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      gi\u1EEF s\u1EBD \u0111\u1ED5i vai c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 hai."
    english: 'Your side: CURSERMANCER

      Choosing an occupied side swaps both
      players.'
    vietnamese: "Phe c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n: CURSERMANCER\nCh\u1ECDn phe \u0111ang c\xF3
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF s\u1EBD \u0111\u1ED5i vai c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 hai."
  - key: text.255
    source: "HAI NG\u01AF\u1EDCI \xB7 HAI THI\u1EBET B\u1ECA"
    english: "TWO PLAYERS \xB7 TWO DEVICES"
    vietnamese: "HAI NG\u01AF\u1EDCI \xB7 HAI THI\u1EBET B\u1ECA"
  - key: text.256
    source: "LU\u1EACT CH\u01A0I NHANH"
    english: QUICK RULES
    vietnamese: "LU\u1EACT CH\u01A0I NHANH"
  - key: text.257
    source: "\u0110\xF3ng"
    english: Close
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xF3ng"
  - key: text.258
    source: "Gi\u1EEF \u0111\u1EC3 xem vai tr\xF2"
    english: Hold to reveal roles
    vietnamese: "Gi\u1EEF \u0111\u1EC3 xem vai tr\xF2"
  - key: text.259
    source: "V\xC1N CH\u01A0I K\u1EBET TH\xDAC"
    english: MATCH OVER
    vietnamese: "V\xC1N CH\u01A0I K\u1EBET TH\xDAC"
  - key: text.260
    source: "V\xC1N CH\u01A0I \u0110\xC3 K\u1EBET TH\xDAC"
    english: MATCH OVER
    vietnamese: "V\xC1N CH\u01A0I \u0110\xC3 K\u1EBET TH\xDAC"
  - key: text.261
    source: "Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i: xem b\xE0i\nESC: m\u1EDF / \u0111\xF3ng lu\u1EADt
      ch\u01A1i"
    english: 'Right-click: inspect

      ESC: open / close rules'
    vietnamese: "Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i: xem b\xE0i\nESC: m\u1EDF / \u0111\xF3ng lu\u1EADt
      ch\u01A1i"
  - key: text.262
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn b\xE0i trung l\u1EADp, sau \u0111\xF3 ch\u1ECDn Cursermancer
      b\xED m\u1EADt tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
    english: Draft neutral cards, then choose secret Cursermancers before starting.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn b\xE0i trung l\u1EADp, sau \u0111\xF3 ch\u1ECDn Cursermancer
      b\xED m\u1EADt tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
  - key: text.263
    source: "\u0110I\u1EC0U KHI\u1EC2N"
    english: CONTROLS
    vietnamese: "\u0110I\u1EC0U KHI\u1EC2N"
  - key: text.264
    source: "K\u1EBFt th\xFAc l\u01B0\u1EE3t"
    english: End turn
    vietnamese: "K\u1EBFt th\xFAc l\u01B0\u1EE3t"
  - key: text.265
    source: "NGH\u0128A TRANG \xB7 Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 xem b\xE0i"
    english: "CEMETERY \xB7 Right-click to inspect"
    vietnamese: "NGH\u0128A TRANG \xB7 Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 xem b\xE0i"
  - key: text.266
    source: "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0o trong ngh\u0129a trang."
    english: The Cemetery is empty.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0o trong ngh\u0129a trang."
  - key: guided.ui.7
    source: "VAI TR\xD2 B\xCD M\u1EACT"
    english: SECRET ROLE
    vietnamese: "VAI TR\xD2 B\xCD M\u1EACT"
  - key: text.268
    source: "\u1EA8n / m\u1EDF tay b\xE0i"
    english: Hide / show hand
    vietnamese: "\u1EA8n / m\u1EDF tay b\xE0i"
  - key: text.269
    source: "D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
    english: Villagers
    vietnamese: "D\xE2n l\xE0ng"
  - key: text.270
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn l\xE1 b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i"
    english: Choose right card
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn l\xE1 b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i"
  - key: text.271
    source: "Trung l\u1EADp"
    english: Neutral
    vietnamese: "Trung l\u1EADp"
  - key: text.272
    source: "Ngh\u0129a trang"
    english: Cemetery
    vietnamese: "Ngh\u0129a trang"
  - key: text.273
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn l\xE1 b\xEAn tr\xE1i"
    english: Choose left card
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn l\xE1 b\xEAn tr\xE1i"
  - key: text.274
    source: "Ch\u01A1i ti\u1EBFp"
    english: Play again
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01A1i ti\u1EBFp"
  - key: text.275
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn l\xE1 \u1EDF tay b\xE0i b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i.\nTh\u1EE3 s\u0103n
      s\u1ED1 9 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 l\xE0 Cursermancer."
    english: 'Choose cards from the hand on the right.

      Hunter number 9 cannot
      be a Cursermancer.'
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn l\xE1 \u1EDF tay b\xE0i b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i.\nTh\u1EE3 s\u0103n
      s\u1ED1 9 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 l\xE0 Cursermancer."
  - key: text.276
    source: "\u0110\u1ED5i phe v\xE1n sau"
    english: Swap sides next match
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ED5i phe v\xE1n sau"
  - key: text.277
    source: "V\u1EC1 menu"
    english: Back to menu
    vietnamese: "V\u1EC1 menu"
  - key: text.278
    source: "S\u1ED5 tay"
    english: Notes
    vietnamese: "S\u1ED5 tay"
  - key: text.279
    source: "CHU\u1EA8N B\u1ECA V\xC1N CH\u01A0I"
    english: MATCH SETUP
    vietnamese: "CHU\u1EA8N B\u1ECA V\xC1N CH\u01A0I"
  - key: text.280
    source: "B\u1EAET \u0110\u1EA6U \u1EDE \u0110\xC2Y"
    english: START HERE
    vietnamese: "B\u1EAET \u0110\u1EA6U \u1EDE \u0110\xC2Y"
  - key: guided.button.start
    source: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u h\u1ECDc"
    english: Start learning
    vietnamese: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u h\u1ECDc"
  - key: text.282
    source: "Xem lu\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7"
    english: Read full rules
    vietnamese: "Xem lu\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\u1EE7"
  - key: text.283
    source: "M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n ch\u1EC9 th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n thao t\xE1c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ch\u1EC9 s\xE1ng."
    english: Perform only the highlighted action at each step.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n ch\u1EC9 th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n thao t\xE1c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ch\u1EC9 s\xE1ng."
  - key: text.284
    source: "Ch\u01A1i th\u1EED v\u1EDBi bot"
    english: Practice with a bot
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01A1i th\u1EED v\u1EDBi bot"
  - key: text.285
    source: "TH\u1EA2 V\xC0O \u0110\xC2Y"
    english: DROP HERE
    vietnamese: "TH\u1EA2 V\xC0O \u0110\xC2Y"
  - key: text.286
    source: "H\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i"
    english: Restart tutorial
    vietnamese: "H\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i"
  - key: text.287
    source: "C\u1EE6A B\u1EA0N"
    english: YOURS
    vietnamese: "C\u1EE6A B\u1EA0N"
  - key: text.288
    source: "\u0110\u1ED0I TH\u1EE6"
    english: OPPONENT
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ED0I TH\u1EE6"
  - key: text.289
    source: "TRUNG L\u1EACP"
    english: NEUTRAL
    vietnamese: "TRUNG L\u1EACP"
  - key: text.290
    source: "TRUNG L\u1EACP \xB7 B\u1EA0N"
    english: "NEUTRAL \xB7 YOU"
    vietnamese: "TRUNG L\u1EACP \xB7 B\u1EA0N"
  - key: text.291
    source: "TRUNG L\u1EACP \xB7 \u0110\u1ECACH"
    english: "NEUTRAL \xB7 RIVAL"
    vietnamese: "TRUNG L\u1EACP \xB7 \u0110\u1ECACH"
  - key: text.292
    source: "Xanh: b\xE0i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \xB7 Cam: b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7
      \xB7 T\xEDm: trung l\u1EADp. Nh\xE3n theo nh\xF3m b\xE0i g\u1ED1c, kh\xF4ng
      ti\u1EBFt l\u1ED9 vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt."
    english: "Cyan: yours \xB7 Amber: opponent \xB7 Purple: neutral. Labels show
      original factions, never secret roles."
    vietnamese: "Xanh: b\xE0i c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \xB7 Cam: b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7
      \xB7 T\xEDm: trung l\u1EADp. Nh\xE3n theo nh\xF3m b\xE0i g\u1ED1c, kh\xF4ng
      ti\u1EBFt l\u1ED9 vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt."
  - key: text.293
    source: PHE CURSERMANCER
    english: CURSERMANCER FACTION
    vietnamese: PHE CURSERMANCER
  - key: text.294
    source: "PHE D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
    english: VILLAGER FACTION
    vietnamese: "PHE D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
  - key: text.295
    source: "D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
    english: VILLAGERS
    vietnamese: "D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
  - key: text.296
    source: CURSERMANCER
    english: CURSERMANCER
    vietnamese: CURSERMANCER
  - key: ownership.neutralHand
    source: "B\xC0I TRUNG L\u1EACP"
    english: NEUTRAL CARDS
    vietnamese: "B\xC0I TRUNG L\u1EACP"
  - key: text.298
    source: "B\xC0I PHE CURSERMANCER"
    english: CURSERMANCER FACTION CARDS
    vietnamese: "B\xC0I PHE CURSERMANCER"
  - key: text.299
    source: "B\xC0I PHE D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
    english: VILLAGER FACTION CARDS
    vietnamese: "B\xC0I PHE D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
  - key: text.300
    source: "\xDAP B\xC0I"
    english: FACE DOWN
    vietnamese: "\xDAP B\xC0I"
  - key: guided.button.opponent
    source: "Xem l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng"
    english: Watch opponent turn
    vietnamese: "Xem l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng"
  - key: text.302
    source: "\u0110\xDANG R\u1ED2I!  "
    english: 'WELL DONE!  '
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xDANG R\u1ED2I!  "
  - key: text.303
    source: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u"
    english: Start
    vietnamese: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u"
  - key: text.304
    source: "Phe c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n: "
    english: 'Your side: '
    vietnamese: "Phe c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n: "
  - key: text.305
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn phe \u0111ang c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF s\u1EBD \u0111\u1ED5i
      vai c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 hai."
    english: Choosing an occupied side swaps both players.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn phe \u0111ang c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF s\u1EBD \u0111\u1ED5i
      vai c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 hai."
  - key: text.306
    source: "Vai tr\xF2 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xF4ng khai. Ch\u1ECDn Ch\u01A1i
      ti\u1EBFp khi b\u1EA1n s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng."
    english: Roles are now public. Choose Play again when ready.
    vietnamese: "Vai tr\xF2 \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xF4ng khai. Ch\u1ECDn
      Ch\u01A1i ti\u1EBFp khi b\u1EA1n s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng."
  - key: text.307
    source: "V\xE1n ch\u01A1i k\u1EBFt th\xFAc"
    english: Match over
    vietnamese: "V\xE1n ch\u01A1i k\u1EBFt th\xFAc"
  - key: text.308
    source: "01  /  CH\u1ECCN B\xC0I TRUNG L\u1EACP"
    english: 01  /  NEUTRAL DRAFT
    vietnamese: "01  /  CH\u1ECCN B\xC0I TRUNG L\u1EACP"
  - key: text.309
    source: "02  /  BOT \u0110ANG CH\u1ECCN CURSERMANCER B\xCD M\u1EACT"
    english: 02  /  BOT SELECTING SECRET CURSERMANCERS
    vietnamese: "02  /  BOT \u0110ANG CH\u1ECCN CURSERMANCER B\xCD M\u1EACT"
  - key: text.310
    source: "02  /  CHU\u1EA8N B\u1ECA VAI TR\xD2"
    english: 02  /  ROLE SETUP
    vietnamese: "02  /  CHU\u1EA8N B\u1ECA VAI TR\xD2"
  - key: text.311
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n D\xE2n l\xE0ng. Vai tr\xF2 Cursermancer
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF k\xEDn trong tr\u1EADn."
    english: You control the Villagers. Cursermancer identities remain secret.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n D\xE2n l\xE0ng. Vai tr\xF2 Cursermancer
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF k\xEDn trong tr\u1EADn."
  - key: text.312
    source: "\u0110\xE3 \u0111\u1EE7 Cursermancer. B\u1EA5m B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u
      v\xE1n \u0111\u1EC3 v\xE0o l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng."
    english: All Cursermancers selected. Click Start match to begin the action phase.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 \u0111\u1EE7 Cursermancer. B\u1EA5m B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u
      v\xE1n \u0111\u1EC3 v\xE0o l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng."
  - key: text.313
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EE7 Cursermancer \u1EDF t\u1EEBng nh\xF3m b\xE0i,
      theo danh s\xE1ch b\xEAn tr\xE1i."
    english: Select the required Cursermancers in each faction using the checklist
      on the left.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EE7 Cursermancer \u1EDF t\u1EEBng nh\xF3m b\xE0i,
      theo danh s\xE1ch b\xEAn tr\xE1i."
  - key: text.314
    source: "\u0110ANG T\u1ED4NG K\u1EBET PHI\u1EBEU"
    english: TALLYING VOTES
    vietnamese: "\u0110ANG T\u1ED4NG K\u1EBET PHI\u1EBEU"
  - key: text.315
    source: "\xC1p d\u1EE5ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF v\xE0 chu\u1EA9n
      b\u1ECB v\xF2ng ti\u1EBFp theo\u2026"
    english: "Resolving skills, sacrifices and the next round\u2026"
    vietnamese: "\xC1p d\u1EE5ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF v\xE0 chu\u1EA9n
      b\u1ECB v\xF2ng ti\u1EBFp theo\u2026"
  - key: text.316
    source: "NGHI TH\u1EE8C NGUY\u1EC0N R\u1EE6A"
    english: CURSE RITUAL
    vietnamese: "NGHI TH\u1EE8C NGUY\u1EC0N R\u1EE6A"
  - key: text.317
    source: "K\xE9o t\u1EEB Cursermancer tr\xEAn b\xE0n t\u1EDBi m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu
      c\xF9ng h\xE0ng ho\u1EB7c c\u1ED9t. Gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng ch\u1EB7n l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m."
    english: Drag from an on-board Cursermancer to a target in its row or column.
      Empty seats block infection.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o t\u1EEB Cursermancer tr\xEAn b\xE0n t\u1EDBi m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu
      c\xF9ng h\xE0ng ho\u1EB7c c\u1ED9t. Gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng ch\u1EB7n l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m."
  - key: text.318
    source: "L\u01AF\u1EE2T PHE CURSERMANCER"
    english: CURSERMANCER TURN
    vietnamese: "L\u01AF\u1EE2T PHE CURSERMANCER"
  - key: text.319
    source: "L\u01AF\u1EE2T PHE D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
    english: VILLAGER TURN
    vietnamese: "L\u01AF\u1EE2T PHE D\xC2N L\xC0NG"
  - key: text.320
    source: "\u0110\u1EB7t b\xE0i m\xECnh: 2 tim \xB7 B\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
      / trung l\u1EADp: 5 tim \xB7 K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng c\xF3 chi ph\xED ri\xEAng."
    english: "Play your card: 2 hearts \xB7 Opponent / neutral: 5 hearts \xB7 Skills
      have their own costs."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EB7t b\xE0i m\xECnh: 2 tim \xB7 B\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
      / trung l\u1EADp: 5 tim \xB7 K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng c\xF3 chi ph\xED ri\xEAng."
  - key: text.321
    source: "Bot \u0111ang h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng\u2026 M\u1EDF Lu\u1EADt ch\u01A1i
      \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng."
    english: "The bot is acting\u2026 Open Rules to pause."
    vietnamese: "Bot \u0111ang h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng\u2026 M\u1EDF Lu\u1EADt ch\u01A1i
      \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng."
  - key: text.322
    source: "Th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n theo h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn ph\xEDa tr\xEAn."
    english: Follow the instructions above.
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n theo h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn ph\xEDa tr\xEAn."
  - key: text.323
    source: "\u0110ang t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt\u2026"
    english: "Tallying\u2026"
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt\u2026"
  - key: text.324
    source: "\u0110ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng\u2026"
    english: "Waiting for the opponent\u2026"
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng\u2026"
  - key: text.325
    source: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF phe Cursermancer \u0111ang ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2
      b\xED m\u1EADt."
    english: The Cursermancer player is choosing secret roles.
    vietnamese: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF phe Cursermancer \u0111ang ch\u1ECDn vai
      tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt."
  - key: text.326
    source: "\u0110ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\u1ECDn."
    english: Waiting for the opponent to choose.
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\u1ECDn."
  - key: text.327
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn 1 l\xE1; c\xE1c nh\xF3m c\xF2n l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ch\u1ECDn ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn"
    english: Choose 1 card; the remaining groups are drafted randomly
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn 1 l\xE1; c\xE1c nh\xF3m c\xF2n l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ch\u1ECDn ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn"
  - key: text.328
    source: "\u0110\xE3 r\u1EDDi ph\xF2ng."
    english: You left the room.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 r\u1EDDi ph\xF2ng."
  - key: text.329
    source: "\u0110ang k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i Photon Fusion\u2026"
    english: "Connecting to Photon Fusion\u2026"
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i Photon Fusion\u2026"
  - key: text.330
    source: "Thi\u1EBFu ho\u1EB7c sai Photon Fusion App ID trong config."
    english: Missing or invalid Photon Fusion App ID in the configuration.
    vietnamese: "Thi\u1EBFu ho\u1EB7c sai Photon Fusion App ID trong config."
  - key: text.331
    source: "Ch\u1EDD ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE1n ti\u1EBFp theo."
    english: Waiting for the host to start the next match.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EDD ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xE1n ti\u1EBFp
      theo."
  - key: text.332
    source: "\u0110ang \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 b\u1ED9 b\xE0i trung l\u1EADp\u2026"
    english: "Synchronizing the neutral draft\u2026"
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 b\u1ED9 b\xE0i trung l\u1EADp\u2026"
  - key: text.333
    source: "\u0110\xE3 t\u1EA1o ph\xF2ng. G\u1EEDi m\xE3 cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi th\u1EE9
      hai."
    english: Room created. Share the code with the second player.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 t\u1EA1o ph\xF2ng. G\u1EEDi m\xE3 cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      th\u1EE9 hai."
  - key: text.334
    source: "\u0110\xE3 v\xE0o ph\xF2ng. Ch\u1EDD ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
    english: Room joined. Waiting for the host to start.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 v\xE0o ph\xF2ng. Ch\u1EDD ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng b\u1EAFt
      \u0111\u1EA7u."
  - key: text.335
    source: "Tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i qu\xE1 l\u1EDBn \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1EEDi."
    english: The game state is too large to send.
    vietnamese: "Tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i qu\xE1 l\u1EDBn \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1EEDi."
  - key: text.336
    source: "\u0110\xE3 b\u1ECF qua d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u m\u1EA1ng kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p
      l\u1EC7."
    english: Invalid network data was ignored.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 b\u1ECF qua d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u m\u1EA1ng kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p
      l\u1EC7."
  - key: text.337
    source: "Runner ch\u01B0a ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng ho\u1EB7c m\xE1y n\xE0y kh\xF4ng
      c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n chuy\u1EC3n scene."
    english: The network runner is not ready or this player cannot change scenes.
    vietnamese: "Runner ch\u01B0a ho\u1EA1t \u0111\u1ED9ng ho\u1EB7c m\xE1y n\xE0y
      kh\xF4ng c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n chuy\u1EC3n scene."
  - key: text.338
    source: "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 Photon Fusion 2 SDK. Import SDK r\u1ED3i ch\u1EDD Unity
      bi\xEAn d\u1ECBch; App ID \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u s\u1EB5n."
    english: Photon Fusion 2 SDK is missing. Import the SDK and wait for Unity to
      compile. The App ID is already saved.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 Photon Fusion 2 SDK. Import SDK r\u1ED3i ch\u1EDD
      Unity bi\xEAn d\u1ECBch; App ID \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u01B0u s\u1EB5n."
  - key: text.339
    source: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 scene: Photon Fusion 2 ch\u01B0a
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c bi\xEAn d\u1ECBch."
    english: 'Cannot synchronize scenes: Photon Fusion 2 has not compiled.'
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 scene: Photon Fusion 2
      ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c bi\xEAn d\u1ECBch."
  - key: text.340
    source: "M\xE3 ph\xF2ng g\u1ED3m 4\u201320 k\xFD t\u1EF1 A\u2013Z, 0\u20139 ho\u1EB7c
      d\u1EA5u -."
    english: "Room codes use 4\u201320 characters: A\u2013Z, 0\u20139 or hyphens."
    vietnamese: "M\xE3 ph\xF2ng g\u1ED3m 4\u201320 k\xFD t\u1EF1 A\u2013Z, 0\u20139
      ho\u1EB7c d\u1EA5u -."
  - key: text.341
    source: "\u0110ang chuy\u1EC3n c\u1EA3 hai m\xE1y v\xE0o b\xE0n ch\u01A1i (Fusion)..."
    english: "Loading the shared board on both players\u2026"
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang chuy\u1EC3n c\u1EA3 hai m\xE1y v\xE0o b\xE0n ch\u01A1i
      (Fusion)..."
  - key: text.342
    source: "Host \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u. \u0110ang t\u1EA3i b\xE0n ch\u01A1i
      (Fusion)..."
    english: "The host has started. Loading the shared board\u2026"
    vietnamese: "Host \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u. \u0110ang t\u1EA3i b\xE0n
      ch\u01A1i (Fusion)..."
  - key: text.343
    source: "\u0110\xE3 chuy\u1EC3n sang b\xE0n ch\u01A1i (Fusion)."
    english: Shared board loaded.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 chuy\u1EC3n sang b\xE0n ch\u01A1i (Fusion)."
  - key: text.344
    source: "\u0110\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\xE3 r\u1EDDi ph\xF2ng. Tr\u1EADn
      \u0111\xE3 d\u1EEBng; h\xE3y v\u1EC1 Menu."
    english: The opponent left. The match has stopped; return to Menu.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\xE3 r\u1EDDi ph\xF2ng. Tr\u1EADn
      \u0111\xE3 d\u1EEBng; h\xE3y v\u1EC1 Menu."
  - key: text.345
    source: "Ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng \u0111\xE3 r\u1EDDi. Phi\xEAn n\xE0y kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1
      chuy\u1EC3n ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng; h\xE3y t\u1EA1o ph\xF2ng m\u1EDBi."
    english: The host left. This session does not transfer hosting; create a new
      room.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng \u0111\xE3 r\u1EDDi. Phi\xEAn n\xE0y kh\xF4ng
      t\u1EF1 chuy\u1EC3n ch\u1EE7 ph\xF2ng; h\xE3y t\u1EA1o ph\xF2ng m\u1EDBi."
  - key: text.346
    source: "K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i \u0111ang ch\u1EADm. C\xE1c thao t\xE1c \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i, vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EE3i m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt."
    english: The connection is slow. Your queued actions are retained; please wait
      a moment.
    vietnamese: "K\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i \u0111ang ch\u1EADm. C\xE1c thao t\xE1c \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i, vui l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EE3i m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt."
  - key: text.347
    source: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\xE3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i. H\xE3y thao t\xE1c l\u1EA1i."
    english: The turn changed. Please try again.
    vietnamese: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\xE3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i. H\xE3y thao t\xE1c
      l\u1EA1i."
  - key: text.348
    source: "Thao t\xE1c n\xE0y kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7 trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t hi\u1EC7n
      t\u1EA1i."
    english: This action is not available during the current turn.
    vietnamese: "Thao t\xE1c n\xE0y kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7 trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i."
  - key: text.349
    source: "Gh\u1EBF n\xE0y kh\xF4ng c\xF2n t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i."
    english: This seat no longer exists.
    vietnamese: "Gh\u1EBF n\xE0y kh\xF4ng c\xF2n t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i."
  - key: text.350
    source: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\xE3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i. H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn l\u1EA1i
      l\xE1 b\xE0i."
    english: The target changed. Select the card again.
    vietnamese: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\xE3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i. H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn
      l\u1EA1i l\xE1 b\xE0i."
  - key: text.351
    source: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn xong b\xE0i trung l\u1EADp tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
    english: Finish the neutral draft first.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn xong b\xE0i trung l\u1EADp tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - key: text.352
    source: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thao t\xE1c. H\xE3y
      ch\u1ECDn l\u1EA1i m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu."
    english: Could not perform the action. Select the target again.
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thao t\xE1c. H\xE3y
      ch\u1ECDn l\u1EA1i m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu."
  - key: text.353
    source: "Ch\u1EC9 ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2 cho l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng trong khay
      b\xE0i."
    english: Select roles only for living cards in a hand.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EC9 ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2 cho l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng trong khay
      b\xE0i."
  - key: text.354
    source: "Phi\u1EBFu ph\u1EA3i nh\u1EAFm v\xE0o m\u1ED9t l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng
      kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
    english: Vote for a different living card on the board.
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu ph\u1EA3i nh\u1EAFm v\xE0o m\u1ED9t l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng
      kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
  - key: text.355
    source: "H\xE3y b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t l\xE1 thu\u1ED9c phe c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n \u0111ang \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
    english: Cast a vote from an on-board card of your faction.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t l\xE1 thu\u1ED9c phe
      c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111ang \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
  - key: text.356
    source: "L\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn h\u1ED3i sinh \u0111\xE3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i. H\xE3y
      m\u1EDF l\u1EA1i danh s\xE1ch."
    english: Resurrection choices changed. Open the list again.
    vietnamese: "L\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn h\u1ED3i sinh \u0111\xE3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i.
      H\xE3y m\u1EDF l\u1EA1i danh s\xE1ch."
  - key: text.357
    source: "L\xE1 b\xE0i ch\u01B0a \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n ho\u1EB7c kh\xF4ng c\xF3
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p."
    english: The card is not on the board or has no suitable active skill.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 b\xE0i ch\u01B0a \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n ho\u1EB7c kh\xF4ng
      c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p."
  - key: text.358
    source: "L\xE1 \u1EDF gh\u1EBF \u0111\xEDch \u0111ang b\u1ECB kh\xF3a, ch\u01B0a
      th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7."
    english: The card in the destination seat is locked and cannot be swapped yet.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 \u1EDF gh\u1EBF \u0111\xEDch \u0111ang b\u1ECB kh\xF3a, ch\u01B0a
      th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7."
  - key: text.359
    source: "H\xE3y b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o m\u1ED9t l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng tr\xEAn
      b\xE0n."
    english: Vote for a living card on the board.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o m\u1ED9t l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng
      tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
  - key: text.360
    source: "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n s\u1ED1 9 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh Cursermancer."
    english: Hunter number 9 cannot become a Cursermancer.
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EE3 s\u0103n s\u1ED1 9 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh
      Cursermancer."
  - key: text.361
    source: "H\xE3y ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t ch\u1ECDn Cursermancer theo t\u1EEBng nh\xF3m
      b\xE0i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
    english: Finish selecting Cursermancers in each faction before starting.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t ch\u1ECDn Cursermancer theo t\u1EEBng nh\xF3m
      b\xE0i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
  - key: text.362
    source: "PHE D\xC2N L\xC0NG TH\u1EAENG! (L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB
      d\u1EADp t\u1EAFt)"
    english: VILLAGERS WIN! (The curse has ended)
    vietnamese: "PHE D\xC2N L\xC0NG TH\u1EAENG! (L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u0111\xE3
      b\u1ECB d\u1EADp t\u1EAFt)"
  - key: text.363
    source: "PHE CURSERMANCER TH\u1EAENG! (B\xF3ng t\u1ED1i bao tr\xF9m ng\xF4i l\xE0ng)"
    english: CURSERMANCER WINS! (Darkness consumes the village)
    vietnamese: "PHE CURSERMANCER TH\u1EAENG! (B\xF3ng t\u1ED1i bao tr\xF9m ng\xF4i
      l\xE0ng)"
  - key: text.364
    source: "B\xE0i h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn thi\u1EBFu d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u. Ch\u1ECDn
      V\u1EC1 menu, ho\u1EB7c s\u1EEDa FirstMatchLesson trong Inspector."
    english: Tutorial data is missing. Return to Menu or repair FirstMatchLesson
      in the Inspector.
    vietnamese: "B\xE0i h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn thi\u1EBFu d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u. Ch\u1ECDn
      V\u1EC1 menu, ho\u1EB7c s\u1EEDa FirstMatchLesson trong Inspector."
  - key: text.365
    source: "\u0110\u1EA5u m\xE1y \xB7 C\u1EA5p {0} \xB7 {1} Cursermancer\nOnline
      lu\xF4n c\xF3 2 Cursermancer; c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 ch\u1EC9 \xE1p d\u1EE5ng
      khi \u0111\u1EA5u m\xE1y."
    english: "Bot match \xB7 Level {0} \xB7 {1} Cursermancer(s)\nOnline always uses
      2 Cursermancers; difficulty affects bots only."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EA5u m\xE1y \xB7 C\u1EA5p {0} \xB7 {1} Cursermancer\nOnline
      lu\xF4n c\xF3 2 Cursermancer; c\u1EA5p \u0111\u1ED9 ch\u1EC9 \xE1p d\u1EE5ng
      khi \u0111\u1EA5u m\xE1y."
  - key: text.366
    source: "Ph\xF2ng {0} \xB7 {1}/2 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \xB7 {2}"
    english: "Room {0} \xB7 {1}/2 players \xB7 {2}"
    vietnamese: "Ph\xF2ng {0} \xB7 {1}/2 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \xB7 {2}"
  - key: text.367
    source: "HI\u1EBEN T\u1EBE \xB7 {0}"
    english: "SACRIFICE \xB7 {0}"
    vietnamese: "HI\u1EBEN T\u1EBE \xB7 {0}"
  - key: text.368
    source: "\u0110\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu {0}/{1} \xB7 K\xE9o t\u1EEB m\u1ED7i l\xE1
      c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n t\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
    english: "Voted {0}/{1} \xB7 Drag from each of your cards to a different card
      on the board."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu {0}/{1} \xB7 K\xE9o t\u1EEB m\u1ED7i
      l\xE1 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n t\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
  - key: text.369
    source: '{0}: {1}/{2}'
    english: '{0}: {1}/{2}'
    vietnamese: '{0}: {1}/{2}'
  - key: text.370
    source: "Thanh tr\u1EEBng ({0}/2)"
    english: Purge ({0}/2)
    vietnamese: "Thanh tr\u1EEBng ({0}/2)"
  - key: text.371
    source: '{0}:  {1}/{2}'
    english: '{0}:  {1}/{2}'
    vietnamese: '{0}:  {1}/{2}'
  - key: text.372
    source: "H\u01AF\u1EDANG D\u1EAAN \xB7 {0}/{1} \xB7 {2}"
    english: "TUTORIAL \xB7 {0}/{1} \xB7 {2}"
    vietnamese: "H\u01AF\u1EDANG D\u1EAAN \xB7 {0}/{1} \xB7 {2}"
  - key: text.373
    source: "B\u01AF\u1EDAC {0} / {1}"
    english: STEP {0} / {1}
    vietnamese: "B\u01AF\u1EDAC {0} / {1}"
  - key: text.374
    source: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t {0}/{1} \xB7 Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i {2} ch\u1ECDn
      \xB7 {3}"
    english: "Pick {0}/{1} \xB7 Player {2} chooses \xB7 {3}"
    vietnamese: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t {0}/{1} \xB7 Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i {2} ch\u1ECDn
      \xB7 {3}"
  - key: text.375
    source: "Ch\u01B0a b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu: {0}. K\xE9o t\u1EEB c\xE1c l\xE1 n\xE0y
      t\u1EDBi l\xE1 mu\u1ED1n hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF."
    english: 'Still to vote: {0}. Drag from these cards to the sacrifice target.'
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01B0a b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu: {0}. K\xE9o t\u1EEB c\xE1c l\xE1 n\xE0y
      t\u1EDBi l\xE1 mu\u1ED1n hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF."
  - key: text.376
    source: "Ch\u01B0a b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu: {0}."
    english: 'Still to vote: {0}.'
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01B0a b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu: {0}."
  - key: text.377
    source: "{0} (s\u1ED1 {1})"
    english: '{0} (number {1})'
    vietnamese: "{0} (s\u1ED1 {1})"
  - key: text.378
    source: "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 tim cho {0} (c\u1EA7n {1} tim)."
    english: Not enough hearts for {0} ({1} hearts required).
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 tim cho {0} (c\u1EA7n {1} tim)."
  - key: text.379
    source: "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 tim \u0111\u1EC3 thu h\u1ED3i {0} (c\u1EA7n {1}
      tim)."
    english: Not enough hearts to return {0} ({1} hearts required).
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE7 tim \u0111\u1EC3 thu h\u1ED3i {0} (c\u1EA7n
      {1} tim)."
  - key: text.380
    source: "{0} \u0111ang b\u1ECB kh\xF3a ho\u1EB7c kh\xF4ng c\xF2n tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
    english: '{0} is locked or is no longer on the board.'
    vietnamese: "{0} \u0111ang b\u1ECB kh\xF3a ho\u1EB7c kh\xF4ng c\xF2n tr\xEAn
      b\xE0n."
  - key: text.381
    source: "{0} \u0111ang b\u1ECB kh\xF3a ho\u1EB7c gh\u1EBF kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7."
    english: '{0} is locked or the seat is invalid.'
    vietnamese: "{0} \u0111ang b\u1ECB kh\xF3a ho\u1EB7c gh\u1EBF kh\xF4ng h\u1EE3p
      l\u1EC7."
  - key: text.382
    source: "{0} kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu cho ch\xEDnh m\xECnh."
    english: '{0} cannot vote for itself.'
    vietnamese: "{0} kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu cho ch\xEDnh m\xECnh."
  - key: text.383
    source: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng c\u1EE7a {0}. Ki\u1EC3m
      tra m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu, s\u1ED1 tim v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n trong m\xF4
      t\u1EA3 b\xE0i."
    english: Cannot use {0}'s skill. Check the target, hearts and conditions in its
      description.
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng c\u1EE7a {0}. Ki\u1EC3m
      tra m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu, s\u1ED1 tim v\xE0 \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n trong m\xF4
      t\u1EA3 b\xE0i."
  - key: text.384
    source: "Nh\xF3m b\xE0i n\xE0y c\u1EA7n {0} Cursermancer. B\u1EA5m l\u1EA1i l\xE1
      \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1ECF ch\u1ECDn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi \u0111\u1ED5i."
    english: This faction needs {0} Cursermancer(s). Click a selected card again
      to deselect it before changing.
    vietnamese: "Nh\xF3m b\xE0i n\xE0y c\u1EA7n {0} Cursermancer. B\u1EA5m l\u1EA1i
      l\xE1 \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1ECF ch\u1ECDn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi
      \u0111\u1ED5i."
