  - key: "MenuScenes.Rules Text \u2014 edit wording here"
    source: "M\u1EE4C TI\xCAU\nD\xE2n l\xE0ng th\u1EAFng khi ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t to\xE0n
      b\u1ED9 Cursermancer. Cursermancer th\u1EAFng khi s\u1ED1 Cursermancer c\xF2n
      s\u1ED1ng b\u1EB1ng ho\u1EB7c nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n s\u1ED1 b\xE0i D\xE2n l\xE0ng
      c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng. Cursermancer trung l\u1EADp v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      t\xEDnh.\n\n1. H\xC0NH \u0110\u1ED8NG\nHai phe lu\xE2n phi\xEAn, m\u1ED7i l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      c\xF3 5 tim. \u0110\u1EB7t b\xE0i m\xECnh: 2 tim; b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp: 5 tim. Totem v\xE0 c\xE1c k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng c\xF3
      chi ph\xED ri\xEAng.\n\n2. NGUY\u1EC0N R\u1EE6A\nKhi b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA7y ho\u1EB7c
      Tr\u01B0\u1EDFng l\xE0ng g\u1ECDi, Cursermancer ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu
      c\xF9ng h\xE0ng/c\u1ED9t. Gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng ch\u1EB7n l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m.\n\n3.
      HI\u1EBEN T\u1EBE\nM\u1ED7i l\xE1 c\u1EE7a phe \u0111ang b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu
      ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n. Kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu.
      L\xE1 duy nh\u1EA5t tr\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\u1EC5n. Nhi\u1EC1u
      phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF; h\xF2a phi\u1EBFu th\xEC t\u1EA5t
      c\u1EA3 l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED3ng h\u1EA1ng b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF. K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3.\n\nTHANH TR\u1EEANG\nM\u1ED7i
      phe c\xF3 2 l\u1EA7n trong c\u1EA3 v\xE1n, lo\u1EA1i b\xE0i nhi\u1EC5m \u1EDF
      tay v\xE0 b\xE0n. Ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng.\n\nR\xDAT
      B\xC0I\nR\xFAt b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp ho\xE0n t\u1ED1i \u0111a
      2 tim, kh\xF4ng v\u01B0\u1EE3t chi ph\xED \u0111\u1EB7t. Totem ch\u1EC9 ho\xE0n
      1 tim.\n\n\u0110I\u1EC0U KHI\u1EC2N\nChu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn
      ho\u1EB7c k\xE9o b\xE0i. Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 xem m\xF4 t\u1EA3.
      C\xE1c k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t v\xE0 chi ph\xED n\u1EB1m
      trong m\xF4 t\u1EA3 t\u1EEBng l\xE1. ESC \u0111\xF3ng b\u1EA3ng lu\u1EADt v\xE0
      ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c tr\u1EADn."
    english: 'OBJECTIVE

      Villagers win when every Cursermancer is eliminated.
      Cursermancer wins when living Cursermancers equal or outnumber living non-Cursermancer
      Villagers. Neutral Cursermancers also count.


      1. ACTIONS

      Sides
      alternate turns with 5 hearts. Play your faction''s card: 2 hearts. Opponent
      or neutral card: 5 hearts. Totem and other skills have their own costs.


      2.
      INFECTION

      A full board or Reeve begins the ritual. Cursermancer targets
      a card in the same row or column. Empty seats block infection.


      3. SACRIFICE

      Each
      on-board card of the voting faction chooses a different card. No self-votes.
      A sole card on the board is exempt. The most-voted cards are sacrificed; a
      tie sacrifices all tied cards. Skills can change the result.


      PURGE

      Each
      side has 2 uses per match. Destroys infected cards in hands and on the board.
      Available during action turns only.


      RETURN TO HAND

      Returning
      your card or a neutral card refunds up to 2 hearts, never more than its placement
      cost. Totem refunds only 1 heart.


      CONTROLS

      Left-click to select
      or drag cards. Right-click to inspect. Each card''s description explains its
      skills and costs. ESC closes Rules and resumes play.'
    vietnamese: "M\u1EE4C TI\xCAU\nD\xE2n l\xE0ng th\u1EAFng khi ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t
      to\xE0n b\u1ED9 Cursermancer. Cursermancer th\u1EAFng khi s\u1ED1 Cursermancer
      c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng b\u1EB1ng ho\u1EB7c nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n s\u1ED1 b\xE0i D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng. Cursermancer trung l\u1EADp v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      t\xEDnh.\n\n1. H\xC0NH \u0110\u1ED8NG\nHai phe lu\xE2n phi\xEAn, m\u1ED7i l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      c\xF3 5 tim. \u0110\u1EB7t b\xE0i m\xECnh: 2 tim; b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp: 5 tim. Totem v\xE0 c\xE1c k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng c\xF3
      chi ph\xED ri\xEAng.\n\n2. NGUY\u1EC0N R\u1EE6A\nKhi b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA7y ho\u1EB7c
      Tr\u01B0\u1EDFng l\xE0ng g\u1ECDi, Cursermancer ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu
      c\xF9ng h\xE0ng/c\u1ED9t. Gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng ch\u1EB7n l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m.\n\n3.
      HI\u1EBEN T\u1EBE\nM\u1ED7i l\xE1 c\u1EE7a phe \u0111ang b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu
      ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n. Kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu.
      L\xE1 duy nh\u1EA5t tr\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c mi\u1EC5n. Nhi\u1EC1u
      phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF; h\xF2a phi\u1EBFu th\xEC t\u1EA5t
      c\u1EA3 l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED3ng h\u1EA1ng b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF. K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3.\n\nTHANH TR\u1EEANG\nM\u1ED7i
      phe c\xF3 2 l\u1EA7n trong c\u1EA3 v\xE1n, lo\u1EA1i b\xE0i nhi\u1EC5m \u1EDF
      tay v\xE0 b\xE0n. Ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng.\n\nR\xDAT
      B\xC0I\nR\xFAt b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp ho\xE0n t\u1ED1i \u0111a
      2 tim, kh\xF4ng v\u01B0\u1EE3t chi ph\xED \u0111\u1EB7t. Totem ch\u1EC9 ho\xE0n
      1 tim.\n\n\u0110I\u1EC0U KHI\u1EC2N\nChu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn
      ho\u1EB7c k\xE9o b\xE0i. Chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 xem m\xF4 t\u1EA3.
      C\xE1c k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t v\xE0 chi ph\xED n\u1EB1m
      trong m\xF4 t\u1EA3 t\u1EEBng l\xE1. ESC \u0111\xF3ng b\u1EA3ng lu\u1EADt v\xE0
      ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c tr\u1EADn."
  - key: text.395
    source: '<color=yellow><b>SUSPICION MARK:</b></color>

      This card is under
      suspicion by the Detective. Each stacked hat increases the target''s suspicion
      level.'
    english: '<color=yellow><b>SUSPICION MARK:</b></color>

      This card is under
      suspicion by the Detective. Each stacked hat increases the target''s suspicion
      level.'
    vietnamese: "<color=yellow><b>D\u1EA4U NGHI NG\u1EDC:</b></color>\nL\xE1 n\xE0y
      \u0111ang b\u1ECB Detective nghi ng\u1EDD. M\u1ED7i chi\u1EBFc m\u0169 ch\u1ED3ng
      th\xEAm l\xE0m t\u0103ng m\u1EE9c Nghi ng\u1EDD c\u1EE7a m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu."
