    source: "C\u1EA3 hai phe c\xF3 th\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng"
    english: Either side can use these cards
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA3 hai phe c\xF3 th\u1EC3 s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng"
  - key: ownership.publicFaction
    source: "Nh\xF3m b\xE0i g\u1ED1c \xB7 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt"
    english: "Printed faction \xB7 secret roles stay hidden"
    vietnamese: "Nh\xF3m b\xE0i g\u1ED1c \xB7 kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i vai tr\xF2 b\xED
      m\u1EADt"
  - key: guided.0.purpose
    source: "Trong l\xE0ng c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EA5u l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n,
      c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111ang t\xECm s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt. B\u1EA1n s\u1EBD
      th\u1EED c\u1EA3 hai ph\xEDa, \u0111\u1EC3 hi\u1EC3u m\u1ED7i quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\u1EE9u ai \u2014 ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u1EB7t ai v\xE0o nguy hi\u1EC3m."
    english: Someone hides the curse; someone is searching for the truth. Try both
      sides and discover how each decision can save a card, or put one in danger.
    vietnamese: "Trong l\xE0ng c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EA5u l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n,
      c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111ang t\xECm s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt. B\u1EA1n s\u1EBD
      th\u1EED c\u1EA3 hai ph\xEDa, \u0111\u1EC3 hi\u1EC3u m\u1ED7i quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\u1EE9u ai \u2014 ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u1EB7t ai v\xE0o nguy hi\u1EC3m."
  - key: guided.1.purpose
    source: "Gi\u1EEF chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y gi\u1EEFa ch\xFAng ta nh\xE9. L\xE1 s\u1ED1
      1 s\u1EBD tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh Cursermancer, nh\u01B0ng v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      kho\xE1c v\u1EBB ngo\xE0i b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EAFt
      D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
    english: Keep this between us. Number 1 will become a Cursermancer, while still
      wearing an ordinary face before the Villagers.
    vietnamese: "Gi\u1EEF chuy\u1EC7n n\xE0y gi\u1EEFa ch\xFAng ta nh\xE9. L\xE1
      s\u1ED1 1 s\u1EBD tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh Cursermancer, nh\u01B0ng v\u1EABn c\xF3
      th\u1EC3 kho\xE1c v\u1EBB ngo\xE0i b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      m\u1EAFt D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
  - key: guided.2.purpose
    source: "\u0110\u1EEBng ch\u1EC9 nh\xECn m\u1ED9t ph\xEDa c\u1EE7a b\xE0n ch\u01A1i.
      C\xE1c tab gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n t\xECm b\xE0i theo nh\xF3m g\u1ED1c; chi\u1EBFc
      \xE1o c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i ch\u01B0a n\xF3i h\u1EBFt vai tr\xF2 th\u1EADt
      c\u1EE7a n\xF3."
    english: "Look beyond one side of the table. Tabs sort cards by printed faction,
      but a card\u2019s appearance does not tell its whole story."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng ch\u1EC9 nh\xECn m\u1ED9t ph\xEDa c\u1EE7a b\xE0n
      ch\u01A1i. C\xE1c tab gi\xFAp b\u1EA1n t\xECm b\xE0i theo nh\xF3m g\u1ED1c;
      chi\u1EBFc \xE1o c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i ch\u01B0a n\xF3i h\u1EBFt vai
      tr\xF2 th\u1EADt c\u1EE7a n\xF3."
  - key: guided.3.purpose
    source: "Tr\xF4ng nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t Villager, nh\u01B0ng l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 c\u0169ng
      s\u1EBD mang vai tr\xF2 Cursermancer. H\xE3y nh\u1EDB \u0111i\u1EC1u n\xE0y
      khi suy lu\u1EADn: nh\xF3m b\xE0i v\xE0 vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt l\xE0 hai
      chuy\u1EC7n kh\xE1c nhau."
    english: 'Number 11 looks like a Villager, yet it too will be a Cursermancer.
      Remember this when drawing conclusions: printed faction and secret role are
      different things.'
    vietnamese: "Tr\xF4ng nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t Villager, nh\u01B0ng l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11
      c\u0169ng s\u1EBD mang vai tr\xF2 Cursermancer. H\xE3y nh\u1EDB \u0111i\u1EC1u
      n\xE0y khi suy lu\u1EADn: nh\xF3m b\xE0i v\xE0 vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt l\xE0
      hai chuy\u1EC7n kh\xE1c nhau."
  - key: guided.4.purpose
    source: "B\u1EA1n b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\u1EDBi 5 tim \u0111\u1EC3 h\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1ED9ng. Ch\u01B0a c\u1EA7n v\u1ED9i ti\xEAu ch\xFAng: h\xE3y nh\xECn
      nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 \u0111ang c\xF3 v\xE0 ngh\u0129 xem ai n\xEAn b\u01B0\u1EDBc
      l\xEAn b\xE0n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
    english: You begin with 5 hearts to act. No need to spend them in a hurry. Look
      at your cards and decide who should enter the board first.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\u1EDBi 5 tim \u0111\u1EC3 h\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1ED9ng. Ch\u01B0a c\u1EA7n v\u1ED9i ti\xEAu ch\xFAng: h\xE3y nh\xECn
      nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 \u0111ang c\xF3 v\xE0 ngh\u0129 xem ai n\xEAn b\u01B0\u1EDBc
      l\xEAn b\xE0n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - key: guided.5.purpose
    source: "G\u1EB7p m\u1ED9t l\xE1 ch\u01B0a quen, c\u1EE9 d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1ECDc
      nh\xE9. M\xF4 t\u1EA3 cho bi\u1EBFt n\xF3 l\xE0m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\xEC
      v\xE0 c\u1EA7n bao nhi\xEAu tim. Vi\u1EC7c xem b\xE0i kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim,
      n\xEAn t\xF2 m\xF2 m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt lu\xF4n c\xF3 \xEDch."
    english: When a card is unfamiliar, take a moment to read. Its description explains
      what it can do and what it costs. Inspecting spends no hearts, so curiosity
      is welcome.
    vietnamese: "G\u1EB7p m\u1ED9t l\xE1 ch\u01B0a quen, c\u1EE9 d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i
      \u0111\u1ECDc nh\xE9. M\xF4 t\u1EA3 cho bi\u1EBFt n\xF3 l\xE0m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      g\xEC v\xE0 c\u1EA7n bao nhi\xEAu tim. Vi\u1EC7c xem b\xE0i kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n
      tim, n\xEAn t\xF2 m\xF2 m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt lu\xF4n c\xF3 \xEDch."
  - key: guided.6.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ri\xEAng, nh\u01B0ng
      v\u1EABn c\xF3 ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i khi Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF. \u0110\xF3ng ph\u1EA7n
      xem \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED \u0111\u01B0a n\xF3 l\xEAn b\xE0n; b\u1EA1n ch\u01B0a
      m\u1EA5t m\u1ED9t tim n\xE0o v\xEC \u0111\u1ECDc b\xE0i."
    english: Number 10 has no special skill, but will still have a voice at Sacrifice.
      Close inspection and bring it to the board. Reading has cost you no hearts.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ri\xEAng, nh\u01B0ng
      v\u1EABn c\xF3 ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i khi Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF. \u0110\xF3ng ph\u1EA7n
      xem \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED \u0111\u01B0a n\xF3 l\xEAn b\xE0n; b\u1EA1n ch\u01B0a
      m\u1EA5t m\u1ED9t tim n\xE0o v\xEC \u0111\u1ECDc b\xE0i."
  - key: guided.7.purpose
    source: "Cho Villager s\u1ED1 10 m\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i nh\xE9. \u0110\u1EB7t
      b\xE0i thu\u1ED9c phe b\u1EA1n t\u1ED1n 2 tim, n\xEAn 5 tim s\u1EBD c\xF2n
      3 tim. \u0110\u1ED5i l\u1EA1i, ng\xF4i l\xE0ng c\xF3 th\xEAm m\u1ED9t l\xE1
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
    english: "Give Villager number 10 a seat. Playing your faction\u2019s card costs
      2 hearts, leaving 3 of your 5 hearts. In return, the village gains another
      card that can vote."
    vietnamese: "Cho Villager s\u1ED1 10 m\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i nh\xE9. \u0110\u1EB7t
      b\xE0i thu\u1ED9c phe b\u1EA1n t\u1ED1n 2 tim, n\xEAn 5 tim s\u1EBD c\xF2n
      3 tim. \u0110\u1ED5i l\u1EA1i, ng\xF4i l\xE0ng c\xF3 th\xEAm m\u1ED9t l\xE1
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: guided.8.purpose
    source: "Hunter ch\u1EC9 gi\xFAp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xE0ng khi \u0111\xE3 \u1EDF
      tr\xEAn b\xE0n. \u0110\u1EB7t n\xF3 t\u1ED1n th\xEAm 2 tim, \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i
      1 tim. Ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EE7 cho m\u1ED9t ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn; ta \u0111ang chu\u1EA9n
      b\u1ECB cho l\u01B0\u1EE3t sau."
    english: Hunter can help only from the board. Playing it costs another 2 hearts
      and leaves 1 heart. That is not enough to fire yet; you are preparing for a
      later turn.
    vietnamese: "Hunter ch\u1EC9 gi\xFAp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\xE0ng khi \u0111\xE3
      \u1EDF tr\xEAn b\xE0n. \u0110\u1EB7t n\xF3 t\u1ED1n th\xEAm 2 tim, \u0111\u1EC3
      l\u1EA1i 1 tim. Ch\u01B0a \u0111\u1EE7 cho m\u1ED9t ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn; ta \u0111ang
      chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB cho l\u01B0\u1EE3t sau."
  - key: guided.9.purpose
    source: "C\xF2n 1 tim c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n c\u1ED1 ti\xEAu h\u1EBFt. \u0110\xF4i
      khi m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc hay l\xE0 bi\u1EBFt d\u1EEBng, gi\u1EEF ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      m\xECnh v\u1EEBa chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB \u1EDF \u0111\xFAng ch\u1ED7 v\xE0 ch\u1EDD
      c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i ti\u1EBFp theo."
    english: With 1 heart left, you do not have to spend for the sake of spending.
      Sometimes the right move is to stop, keep your prepared card in place and wait.
    vietnamese: "C\xF2n 1 tim c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n c\u1ED1 ti\xEAu h\u1EBFt.
      \u0110\xF4i khi m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc hay l\xE0 bi\u1EBFt d\u1EEBng, gi\u1EEF
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\xECnh v\u1EEBa chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB \u1EDF \u0111\xFAng ch\u1ED7
      v\xE0 ch\u1EDD c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i ti\u1EBFp theo."
  - key: guided.10.purpose
    source: "\u0110\u1EEBng n\xF3i l\u1ED9 \u0111i\u1EC1u b\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa th\u1EA5y
      nh\xE9. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 g\xF3c nh\xECn ri\xEAng c\u1EE7a Cursermancer. D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5y vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt \u1EA5y; h\u1ECD ph\u1EA3i
      gh\xE9p s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng d\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt c\xF4ng khai."
    english: "Do not give away what you see. This is the Cursermancer\u2019s private
      view. Villagers cannot see that secret role; they must piece the truth together
      from public clues."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng n\xF3i l\u1ED9 \u0111i\u1EC1u b\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa th\u1EA5y
      nh\xE9. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 g\xF3c nh\xECn ri\xEAng c\u1EE7a Cursermancer. D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5y vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt \u1EA5y; h\u1ECD ph\u1EA3i
      gh\xE9p s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng d\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt c\xF4ng khai."
  - key: guided.11.purpose
    source: "L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n n\u1EB1m m\xE3i tr\xEAn tay th\xEC ch\u01B0a ch\u1EA1m
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ai. \u0110\u01B0a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 l\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u1EC3
      t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m; tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EAFt D\xE2n
      l\xE0ng, n\xF3 v\u1EABn \u0111ang gi\u1EEF v\u1EBB ng\u1EE5y trang."
    english: A curse kept in hand cannot reach anyone. Bring number 1 onto the board
      to find a path of infection. To the Villagers, it still wears its disguise.
    vietnamese: "L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n n\u1EB1m m\xE3i tr\xEAn tay th\xEC ch\u01B0a
      ch\u1EA1m \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ai. \u0110\u01B0a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 l\xEAn b\xE0n
      \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m; tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      m\u1EAFt D\xE2n l\xE0ng, n\xF3 v\u1EABn \u0111ang gi\u1EEF v\u1EBB ng\u1EE5y
      trang."
  - key: guided.12.purpose
    source: "C\xF2n nh\u1EDB Hunter \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE3i kh\xF4ng? Khi l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a D\xE2n l\xE0ng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u, b\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EE7 5 tim. L\u1EA7n chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3 gi\u1EDD c\xF3 th\u1EC3 th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t ph\xE1t
      b\u1EAFn."
    english: Remember Hunter waiting on the board? The Villager action turn refills
      your hearts to 5. That earlier preparation can now become a shot.
    vietnamese: "C\xF2n nh\u1EDB Hunter \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE3i kh\xF4ng? Khi l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a D\xE2n l\xE0ng b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u, b\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EE7 5 tim. L\u1EA7n chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xF3 gi\u1EDD c\xF3 th\u1EC3 th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t ph\xE1t
      b\u1EAFn."
  - key: guided.13.purpose
    source: "Ng\u1EAFm ch\u1EAFc nh\xE9. Ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn n\xE0y t\u1ED1n tr\u1ECDn
      5 tim v\xE0 s\u1EBD lo\u1EA1i m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu. Nh\u1EDB k\xE9o chu\u1ED9t
      ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng; b\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i
      m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n ch\u1EC9 m\u1EDF ph\u1EA7n m\xF4 t\u1EA3."
    english: Take a steady aim. This shot costs all 5 hearts and removes its target.
      Right-drag to use the skill; a single right-click only opens the description.
    vietnamese: "Ng\u1EAFm ch\u1EAFc nh\xE9. Ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn n\xE0y t\u1ED1n tr\u1ECDn
      5 tim v\xE0 s\u1EBD lo\u1EA1i m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu. Nh\u1EDB k\xE9o chu\u1ED9t
      ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng; b\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i
      m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n ch\u1EC9 m\u1EDF ph\u1EA7n m\xF4 t\u1EA3."
  - key: guided.14.purpose
    source: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 r\u1EDDi b\xE0n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ngh\u0129a c\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n
      c\u1EE7a n\xF3 bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t. Ngh\u0129a trang gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i nh\u1EEFng
      g\xEC \u0111\xE3 x\u1EA3y ra, \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1ED7 \u0111\u1ED1i
      chi\u1EBFu khi tr\xED nh\u1EDB b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\xE1nh l\u1EEBa
      m\xECnh."
    english: A card leaving the board does not erase its story. The Cemetery keeps
      a record of what happened, somewhere to check when your memory grows uncertain.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t l\xE1 r\u1EDDi b\xE0n kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ngh\u0129a c\xE2u
      chuy\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a n\xF3 bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t. Ngh\u0129a trang gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i
      nh\u1EEFng g\xEC \u0111\xE3 x\u1EA3y ra, \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n c\xF3 ch\u1ED7
      \u0111\u1ED1i chi\u1EBFu khi tr\xED nh\u1EDB b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u \u0111\xE1nh
      l\u1EEBa m\xECnh."
  - key: guided.15.purpose
    source: "Ghi nh\u1EDB ai \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i nh\xE9. L\xE1 ch\u1EBFt
      kh\xF4ng c\xF2n b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu; ch\u1ED7 v\u1EEBa tr\u1ED1ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      \u0111\u1ED5i c\u1EA3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i c\u1EE7a l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n
      l\u1EABn k\u1EBF ho\u1EA1ch c\u1EE7a ng\xF4i l\xE0ng."
    english: "Remember who was removed. Dead cards cannot vote. A newly empty seat
      may change both the curse\u2019s path and the village\u2019s plans."
    vietnamese: "Ghi nh\u1EDB ai \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i nh\xE9. L\xE1 ch\u1EBFt
      kh\xF4ng c\xF2n b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu; ch\u1ED7 v\u1EEBa tr\u1ED1ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      \u0111\u1ED5i c\u1EA3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i c\u1EE7a l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n
      l\u1EABn k\u1EBF ho\u1EA1ch c\u1EE7a ng\xF4i l\xE0ng."
  - key: guided.16.purpose
    source: "T\xF4i s\u1EBD s\u1EAFp th\xEAm hai l\xE1 \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n th\u1EED
      nghi th\u1EE9c ngay. Trong v\xE1n th\u1EADt, b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA7y ho\u1EB7c
      Reeve s\u1EBD g\u1ECDi pha n\xE0y t\u1EDBi. L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi l\xE0ng b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
    english: I will arrange two more cards so you can try a ritual now. In a real
      match, a full board or Reeve calls it. The curse acts before the village votes.
    vietnamese: "T\xF4i s\u1EBD s\u1EAFp th\xEAm hai l\xE1 \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n
      th\u1EED nghi th\u1EE9c ngay. Trong v\xE1n th\u1EADt, b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA7y
      ho\u1EB7c Reeve s\u1EBD g\u1ECDi pha n\xE0y t\u1EDBi. L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi l\xE0ng b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: guided.17.purpose
    source: "\u0110\u1EC3 l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n ch\u1EA1m Hunter nh\xE9. N\xF3 s\u1EBD
      b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m, v\u1EABn l\xE0 Hunter ch\u1EE9 ch\u01B0a th\xE0nh Cursermancer.
      D\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh theo n\xF3 c\u1EA3 khi v\u1EC1 tay; gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EB7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE2y."
    english: Let the curse reach Hunter. It becomes infected, but remains Hunter
      rather than turning into a Cursermancer. Sickness follows it into hand; empty
      seats can block infection.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EC3 l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n ch\u1EA1m Hunter nh\xE9. N\xF3
      s\u1EBD b\u1ECB nhi\u1EC5m, v\u1EABn l\xE0 Hunter ch\u1EE9 ch\u01B0a th\xE0nh
      Cursermancer. D\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh theo n\xF3 c\u1EA3 khi v\u1EC1 tay; gh\u1EBF
      tr\u1ED1ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EB7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng l\xE2y."
  - key: guided.18.purpose
    source: "L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i d\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt.
      Gi\u1EDD m\u1ED7i l\xE1 thu\u1ED9c phe \u0111ang b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu s\u1EBD
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EC9 ra m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n. \u0110\u1ECDc
      t\xECnh th\u1EBF tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi trao ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i \u1EA5y cho ai."
    english: The curse has left a trace. Now every card of the voting faction may
      point to another card on the board. Read the situation before deciding where
      those voices go.
    vietnamese: "L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA1i d\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt.
      Gi\u1EDD m\u1ED7i l\xE1 thu\u1ED9c phe \u0111ang b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu s\u1EBD
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EC9 ra m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n. \u0110\u1ECDc
      t\xECnh th\u1EBF tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi trao ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i \u1EA5y cho ai."
  - key: guided.19.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ng\u1ED3i t\u1EEB \u0111\u1EA7u,
      gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i. K\xE9o t\u1EEB ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu t\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n mu\u1ED1n hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF.
      B\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim v\xE0 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      t\u1EF1 ch\u1EC9 v\xE0o m\xECnh."
    english: Number 10 earned its seat earlier; now it has a voice. Drag from the
      voter to the card you want sacrificed. Voting costs no hearts, and a card cannot
      vote for itself.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ng\u1ED3i t\u1EEB \u0111\u1EA7u,
      gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i. K\xE9o t\u1EEB ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu t\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n mu\u1ED1n hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF.
      B\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim v\xE0 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      t\u1EF1 ch\u1EC9 v\xE0o m\xECnh."
  - key: guided.20.purpose
    source: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFn, nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a m\u1EA5t quy\u1EC1n
      b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng v\xE0 l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu l\xE0 hai vi\u1EC7c
      ri\xEAng; m\u1ED7i l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng thu\u1ED9c phe \u0111ang b\u1ECF
      phi\u1EBFu v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu."
    english: Hunter has fired, but has not lost its vote. Skills and voting are separate
      actions. Each living on-board card of the voting faction still needs a target.
    vietnamese: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFn, nh\u01B0ng ch\u01B0a m\u1EA5t quy\u1EC1n
      b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng v\xE0 l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu l\xE0 hai vi\u1EC7c
      ri\xEAng; m\u1ED7i l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng thu\u1ED9c phe \u0111ang b\u1ECF
      phi\u1EBFu v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu."
  - key: guided.21.purpose
    source: "B\u1EA1n bi\u1EBFt b\xED m\u1EADt c\u1EE7a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11, nh\u01B0ng
      phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a n\xF3 v\u1EABn theo nh\xF3m Villager in tr\xEAn b\xE0i.
      Vai tr\xF2 k\xEDn kh\xF4ng x\xF3a ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i \u1EA5y \u2014 \u0111\xF3
      c\u0169ng l\xE0 c\xE1ch l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n h\xF2a v\xE0o l\xE0ng."
    english: "You know number 11\u2019s secret, but its vote still follows its printed
      Villager faction. A hidden role does not erase that voice; it helps the curse
      blend into the village."
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n bi\u1EBFt b\xED m\u1EADt c\u1EE7a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11, nh\u01B0ng
      phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a n\xF3 v\u1EABn theo nh\xF3m Villager in tr\xEAn b\xE0i.
      Vai tr\xF2 k\xEDn kh\xF4ng x\xF3a ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i \u1EA5y \u2014 \u0111\xF3
      c\u0169ng l\xE0 c\xE1ch l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n h\xF2a v\xE0o l\xE0ng."
  - key: guided.22.purpose
    source: "Nh\xECn l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ch\u1ED1t nh\xE9.
      Trong v\xE1n th\u1EADt, n\u1EBFu c\xF2n l\xE1 ch\u01B0a b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu,
      game s\u1EBD nh\u1EAFc t\xEAn l\xE1 \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n t\xECm,
      thay v\xEC \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i b\u1ECB b\u1ECF qu\xEAn."
    english: Take one last look before confirming. In a real match, the game names
      any card still waiting to vote, so you can find it rather than leave its voice
      unheard.
    vietnamese: "Nh\xECn l\u1EA1i m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ch\u1ED1t
      nh\xE9. Trong v\xE1n th\u1EADt, n\u1EBFu c\xF2n l\xE1 ch\u01B0a b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu,
      game s\u1EBD nh\u1EAFc t\xEAn l\xE1 \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n t\xECm,
      thay v\xEC \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i b\u1ECB b\u1ECF qu\xEAn."
  - key: guided.23.purpose
    source: "Ng\xF4i l\xE0ng kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ph\xEDa duy nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn. T\xF4i s\u1EBD b\u1ECF m\u1ED9t phi\u1EBFu m\u1EABu t\u1EEB
      l\xE1 s\u1ED1 2, \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n th\u1EA5y hai b\xEAn c\xF9ng g\xF3p
      ph\u1EA7n t\u1EA1o ra k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 nghi th\u1EE9c."
    english: "The village is not the only side with a choice. I will cast a sample
      vote from number 2, showing how both sides contribute to the ritual\u2019s
      outcome."
    vietnamese: "Ng\xF4i l\xE0ng kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ph\xEDa duy nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn. T\xF4i s\u1EBD b\u1ECF m\u1ED9t phi\u1EBFu m\u1EABu t\u1EEB
      l\xE1 s\u1ED1 2, \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n th\u1EA5y hai b\xEAn c\xF9ng g\xF3p
      ph\u1EA7n t\u1EA1o ra k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 nghi th\u1EE9c."
  - key: guided.24.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 nh\u1EADn nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t s\u1EBD b\u1ECB hi\u1EBFn
      t\u1EBF; h\xF2a th\xEC c\xE1c l\xE1 c\xF9ng cao nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u1EC1u b\u1ECB
      lo\u1EA1i, tr\u1EEB khi k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ED5i k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3.
      Nh\xECn l\xE1 s\u1ED1 2 v\xE0 nh\u1EDB \u0111i\u1EC1u nh\u1EEFng phi\u1EBFu
      v\u1EEBa l\xE0m."
    english: The most-voted card is sacrificed; ties remove every card tied highest
      unless a skill changes the result. Watch number 2 and remember what those votes
      have done.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 nh\u1EADn nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t s\u1EBD b\u1ECB
      hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF; h\xF2a th\xEC c\xE1c l\xE1 c\xF9ng cao nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u1EC1u
      b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i, tr\u1EEB khi k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ED5i k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3.
      Nh\xECn l\xE1 s\u1ED1 2 v\xE0 nh\u1EDB \u0111i\u1EC1u nh\u1EEFng phi\u1EBFu
      v\u1EEBa l\xE0m."
  - key: guided.25.purpose
    source: "C\xF2n nh\u1EDB d\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh tr\xEAn Hunter kh\xF4ng? N\xF3 ch\u01B0a
      bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t khi l\xE1 v\u1EC1 tay. Thanh tr\u1EEBng t\xECm b\xE0i nhi\u1EC5m
      c\u1EA3 tr\xEAn b\xE0n l\u1EABn tr\xEAn tay, kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim nh\u01B0ng
      m\u1ED7i phe ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 2 l\u1EA7n d\xF9ng."
    english: "Remember Hunter\u2019s sickness? Returning to hand did not remove it.
      Purge finds infected cards on the board and in hands. It costs no hearts, but
      each side gets only 2 uses."
    vietnamese: "C\xF2n nh\u1EDB d\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh tr\xEAn Hunter kh\xF4ng? N\xF3
      ch\u01B0a bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t khi l\xE1 v\u1EC1 tay. Thanh tr\u1EEBng t\xECm
      b\xE0i nhi\u1EC5m c\u1EA3 tr\xEAn b\xE0n l\u1EABn tr\xEAn tay, kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n
      tim nh\u01B0ng m\u1ED7i phe ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 2 l\u1EA7n d\xF9ng."
  - key: guided.26.purpose
    source: "Khoan r\u1EDDi l\xE0ng nh\xE9. Ta c\xF2n nh\u1EEFng tr\xE1i tim tr\xEAn
      g\xF3c m\xE0n h\xECnh. Ch\xFAng l\xE0 s\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EC3 h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng,
      kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\xE1u c\u1EE7a l\xE1 b\xE0i. M\u1ED9t v\xF2ng t\u1EADp
      ri\xEAng \u0111ang ch\u1EDD b\u1EA1n v\u1EDBi 5 tim."
    english: "Stay in the village a little longer. See those hearts in the corner?
      They are energy for actions, not a card\u2019s health. A separate practice
      round awaits with 5 hearts."
    vietnamese: "Khoan r\u1EDDi l\xE0ng nh\xE9. Ta c\xF2n nh\u1EEFng tr\xE1i tim
      tr\xEAn g\xF3c m\xE0n h\xECnh. Ch\xFAng l\xE0 s\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EC3 h\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1ED9ng, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\xE1u c\u1EE7a l\xE1 b\xE0i. M\u1ED9t v\xF2ng
      t\u1EADp ri\xEAng \u0111ang ch\u1EDD b\u1EA1n v\u1EDBi 5 tim."
  - key: guided.0.success
    source: "L\u1EA1i g\u1EA7n \xE1nh \u0111\xE8n nh\xE9. Ta b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u
      t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t b\xED m\u1EADt."
    english: Come closer to the light. We begin with a secret.
    vietnamese: "L\u1EA1i g\u1EA7n \xE1nh \u0111\xE8n nh\xE9. Ta b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u
      t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t b\xED m\u1EADt."
  - key: guided.1.success
    source: "Su\u1EF5t\u2026 l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC1u ph\u1EA3i
      gi\u1EA5u."
    english: "Quiet now\u2026 number 1 has something to hide."
    vietnamese: "Su\u1EF5t\u2026 l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 \u0111i\u1EC1u
      ph\u1EA3i gi\u1EA5u."
  - key: guided.2.success
    source: "Nh\u1EEFng g\u01B0\u01A1ng m\u1EB7t quen thu\u1ED9c c\u0169ng c\xF3
      th\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF b\xED m\u1EADt."
    english: Even familiar faces can keep secrets.
    vietnamese: "Nh\u1EEFng g\u01B0\u01A1ng m\u1EB7t quen thu\u1ED9c c\u0169ng c\xF3
      th\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF b\xED m\u1EADt."
  - key: guided.3.success
    source: "Hai b\xED m\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gieo. \u0110\xEAm
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
    english: Two secrets are planted. The night can begin.
    vietnamese: "Hai b\xED m\u1EADt \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gieo. \u0110\xEAm
      c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
  - key: guided.4.success
    source: "\u0110\xE3 c\xF3 5 tim. H\xE3y nh\xECn k\u1EF9 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ch\u1ECDn
      n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111i."
    english: You have 5 hearts. Look closely before making your move.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 c\xF3 5 tim. H\xE3y nh\xECn k\u1EF9 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi
      ch\u1ECDn n\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111i."
  - key: guided.5.success
    source: "Gi\u1EDD b\u1EA1n bi\u1EBFt ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EEBa b\u01B0\u1EDBc
      v\xE0o c\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n r\u1ED3i."
    english: Now you know who has joined the story.
    vietnamese: "Gi\u1EDD b\u1EA1n bi\u1EBFt ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EEBa b\u01B0\u1EDBc
      v\xE0o c\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n r\u1ED3i."
  - key: guided.6.success
    source: "\u0110\u1EE7 g\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EC3 hi\u1EC3u r\u1ED3i. Cho n\xF3 m\u1ED9t
      ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i nh\xE9."
    english: "You have had a closer look. Let\u2019s give it a seat."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EE7 g\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EC3 hi\u1EC3u r\u1ED3i. Cho n\xF3
      m\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.7.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i. B\u1EA1n c\xF2n
      3 tim \u0111\u1EC3 t\xEDnh ti\u1EBFp."
    english: Number 10 has a seat. You have 3 hearts to plan with.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i. B\u1EA1n c\xF2n
      3 tim \u0111\u1EC3 t\xEDnh ti\u1EBFp."
  - key: guided.8.success
    source: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 v\xE0o v\u1ECB tr\xED. Ch\u1EDD \u0111\xFAng th\u1EDDi
      kh\u1EAFc th\xF4i."
    english: Hunter is in position. Now wait for the right moment.
    vietnamese: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 v\xE0o v\u1ECB tr\xED. Ch\u1EDD \u0111\xFAng th\u1EDDi
      kh\u1EAFc th\xF4i."
  - key: guided.9.success
    source: "Gi\u1EDD b\u01B0\u1EDBc kh\u1EBD sang ph\xEDa l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n nh\xE9."
    english: Now step quietly to the side of the curse.
    vietnamese: "Gi\u1EDD b\u01B0\u1EDBc kh\u1EBD sang ph\xEDa l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n
      nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.10.success
    source: "C\xF9ng m\u1ED9t b\xE0n ch\u01A1i, m\u1ED7i ph\xEDa bi\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t
      ph\u1EA7n s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt."
    english: One table, but each side knows a different part of the truth.
    vietnamese: "C\xF9ng m\u1ED9t b\xE0n ch\u01A1i, m\u1ED7i ph\xEDa bi\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t
      ph\u1EA7n s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt."
  - key: guided.11.success
    source: "L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 m\u1EB7t gi\u1EEFa ng\xF4i l\xE0ng."
    english: The curse now has a place among the village.
    vietnamese: "L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 m\u1EB7t gi\u1EEFa ng\xF4i
      l\xE0ng."
  - key: guided.12.success
    source: "5 tim \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i. Hunter \u0111ang ch\u1EDD quy\u1EBFt
      \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
    english: All 5 hearts are back. Hunter awaits your decision.
    vietnamese: "5 tim \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i. Hunter \u0111ang ch\u1EDD quy\u1EBFt
      \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
  - key: guided.13.success
    source: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 b\xF3p c\xF2. H\xE3y xem d\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt c\xF2n
      l\u1EA1i \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u."
    english: "Hunter has fired. Let\u2019s see where the trace remains."
    vietnamese: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 b\xF3p c\xF2. H\xE3y xem d\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt c\xF2n
      l\u1EA1i \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u."
  - key: guided.14.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y. B\u1EA1n v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      xem l\u1EA1i n\xF3."
    english: Number 1 is here. You can still inspect it.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y. B\u1EA1n v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      xem l\u1EA1i n\xF3."
  - key: guided.15.success
    source: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng v\u1EABn \u0111ang ch\u1EDD n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      \u0111i ti\u1EBFp theo."
    english: The surviving cards are waiting for the next move.
    vietnamese: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng v\u1EABn \u0111ang ch\u1EDD n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      \u0111i ti\u1EBFp theo."
  - key: guided.16.success
    source: "Nghi th\u1EE9c \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng. B\u01B0\u1EDBc kh\u1EBD
      th\xF4i nh\xE9."
    english: The ritual is ready. Tread softly.
    vietnamese: "Nghi th\u1EE9c \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng. B\u01B0\u1EDBc kh\u1EBD
      th\xF4i nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.17.success
    source: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 mang d\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh. Ng\xF4i l\xE0ng ch\u01B0a
      bi\u1EBFt h\u1EBFt \u0111\xE2u."
    english: Hunter bears the sickness. The village does not know everything yet.
    vietnamese: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 mang d\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh. Ng\xF4i l\xE0ng ch\u01B0a
      bi\u1EBFt h\u1EBFt \u0111\xE2u."
  - key: guided.18.success
    source: "\u0110\u1EBFn l\xFAc nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng."
    english: It is time for the votes to speak.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EBFn l\xFAc nh\u1EEFng l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng."
  - key: guided.19.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn. V\u1EABn c\xF2n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      ch\u01B0a l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng."
    english: Number 10 has chosen. Others have yet to speak.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn. V\u1EABn c\xF2n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      ch\u01B0a l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng."
  - key: guided.20.success
    source: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. C\xF2n m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      im l\u1EB7ng."
    english: Hunter has voted. One voice is still missing.
    vietnamese: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. C\xF2n m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      im l\u1EB7ng."
  - key: guided.21.success
    source: "C\u1EA3 ba l\xE1 \u0111\xE3 n\xF3i l\xEAn l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn c\u1EE7a
      m\xECnh."
    english: All three cards have made their choices.
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA3 ba l\xE1 \u0111\xE3 n\xF3i l\xEAn l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn c\u1EE7a
      m\xECnh."
  - key: guided.22.success
    source: "Phi\u1EBFu \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ED1t. Gi\u1EDD nghe ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia n\xE0o."
    english: The votes are confirmed. Now hear the other side.
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ED1t. Gi\u1EDD nghe ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia
      n\xE0o."
  - key: guided.23.success
    source: "C\u1EA3 hai ph\xEDa \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn. Ch\u1EDD nghi th\u1EE9c tr\u1EA3
      l\u1EDDi nh\xE9."
    english: Both sides have chosen. Let the ritual answer.
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA3 hai ph\xEDa \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn. Ch\u1EDD nghi th\u1EE9c
      tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.24.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 2 \u0111\xE3 r\u1EDDi cu\u1ED9c ch\u01A1i. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      s\u1ED1ng tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 tay."
    english: Number 2 has left play. The survivors return to hand.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 2 \u0111\xE3 r\u1EDDi cu\u1ED9c ch\u01A1i. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      s\u1ED1ng tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 tay."
  - key: guided.25.success
    source: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i v\xEC b\u1EC7nh. B\u1EA1n c\xF2n
      1 l\u1EA7n Thanh tr\u1EEBng."
    english: Hunter was removed by the sickness check. You have 1 Purge left.
    vietnamese: "Hunter \u0111\xE3 b\u1ECB lo\u1EA1i v\xEC b\u1EC7nh. B\u1EA1n c\xF2n
      1 l\u1EA7n Thanh tr\u1EEBng."
  - key: guided.26.success
    source: "Th\u1EED m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\u1ECF th\xF4i, r\u1ED3i nh\xECn
      tim thay \u0111\u1ED5i nh\xE9."
    english: Try one small move, then watch the hearts change.
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EED m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\u1ECF th\xF4i, r\u1ED3i nh\xECn
      tim thay \u0111\u1ED5i nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.0.title
    source: "\u0110\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn, \u0111\u1EEBng \u0111i m\u1ED9t m\xECnh"
    english: Your first night, together
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn, \u0111\u1EEBng \u0111i m\u1ED9t
      m\xECnh"
  - key: guided.0.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m B\u1EAET \u0110\u1EA6U H\u1ECCC. T\xF4i s\u1EBD c\xF9ng b\u1EA1n
      \u0111i qua \u0111\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn c\u1EE7a ng\xF4i l\xE0ng."
    english: "Click START LEARNING. I will walk beside you through the village\u2019s
      first night."
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m B\u1EAET \u0110\u1EA6U H\u1ECCC. T\xF4i s\u1EBD c\xF9ng
      b\u1EA1n \u0111i qua \u0111\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn c\u1EE7a ng\xF4i l\xE0ng."
  - key: guided.3.title
    source: "\u0110\u1EB1ng sau chi\u1EBFc \xE1o Villager"
    english: "Behind a Villager\u2019s face"
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EB1ng sau chi\u1EBFc \xE1o Villager"
  - key: guided.7.title
    source: "M\u1ED9t gh\u1EBF, m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i"
    english: A seat and a voice
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t gh\u1EBF, m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i"
  - key: guided.13.title
    source: "M\u1ED9t ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn, m\u1ED9t quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh"
    english: One shot, one decision
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn, m\u1ED9t quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh"
  - key: guided.17.title
    source: "M\u1ED9t d\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh trong im l\u1EB7ng"
    english: A quiet mark of sickness
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t d\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh trong im l\u1EB7ng"
  - key: guided.24.title
    source: "L\u1EAFng nghe k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3"
    english: Hear the result
    vietnamese: "L\u1EAFng nghe k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3"
  - key: guided.26.title
    source: "Gi\u1EEF s\u1EE9c cho m\u1ED9t \u0111\xEAm d\xE0i"
    english: Keep strength for a long night
    vietnamese: "Gi\u1EEF s\u1EE9c cho m\u1ED9t \u0111\xEAm d\xE0i"
  - key: guided.ui.0
    source: "\u0110\u1EBEN L\u01AF\u1EE2T B\u1EA0N"
    english: YOUR TURN
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EBEN L\u01AF\u1EE2T B\u1EA0N"
  - key: guided.ui.1
    source: "L\u1EDCI TH\xCC TH\u1EA6M"
    english: WHISPERS
    vietnamese: "L\u1EDCI TH\xCC TH\u1EA6M"
  - key: guided.ui.2
    source: "1 \xB7 B\u1EA4M CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I"
    english: "1 \xB7 RIGHT-CLICK"
    vietnamese: "1 \xB7 B\u1EA4M CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I"
  - key: guided.ui.3
    source: "1 \xB7 K\xC9O CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I"
    english: "1 \xB7 RIGHT-DRAG"
    vietnamese: "1 \xB7 K\xC9O CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I"
  - key: guided.ui.4
    source: "1 \xB7 K\xC9O CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I"
    english: "1 \xB7 LEFT-DRAG"
    vietnamese: "1 \xB7 K\xC9O CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I"
  - key: guided.ui.5
    source: "1 \xB7 B\u1EA4M CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I"
    english: "1 \xB7 LEFT-CLICK"
    vietnamese: "1 \xB7 B\u1EA4M CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I"
  - key: guided.ui.6
    source: "2 \xB7 TH\u1EA2 CHU\u1ED8T \u1EDE \u0110\xC2Y"
    english: "2 \xB7 RELEASE HERE"
    vietnamese: "2 \xB7 TH\u1EA2 CHU\u1ED8T \u1EDE \u0110\xC2Y"
  - key: guided.ui.8
    source: "B\xC0I NHI\u1EC4M S\u1EBC B\u1ECA LO\u1EA0I"
    english: INFECTED CARD TO REMOVE
    vietnamese: "B\xC0I NHI\u1EC4M S\u1EBC B\u1ECA LO\u1EA0I"
  - key: guided.ui.9
    source: "S\u1ED4 TAY \u0110I\u1EC0U TRA"
    english: INVESTIGATION NOTES
    vietnamese: "S\u1ED4 TAY \u0110I\u1EC0U TRA"
  - key: guided.ui.10
    source: "K\xE9o th\u1EBB s\u1ED1 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng \u0111\u1EC3
      ghi l\u1EA1i ph\xE1n \u0111o\xE1n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
    english: Drag number tokens to the matching seats to record your deductions.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o th\u1EBB s\u1ED1 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng
      \u0111\u1EC3 ghi l\u1EA1i ph\xE1n \u0111o\xE1n c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
  - key: guided.ui.11
    source: "H\xC0NG GH\u1EBE NGHI V\u1EA4N (1 - 7)"
    english: SUSPECTED SEATS (1 - 7)
    vietnamese: "H\xC0NG GH\u1EBE NGHI V\u1EA4N (1 - 7)"
  - key: guided.ui.12
    source: "TH\u1EBA S\u1ED0 L\xC1 B\xC0I (1 - 16)"
    english: CARD NUMBER TOKENS (1 - 16)
    vietnamese: "TH\u1EBA S\u1ED0 L\xC1 B\xC0I (1 - 16)"
  - key: guided.ui.13
    source: "Ch\u1EC9 b\u1EA1n th\u1EA5y ghi ch\xFA n\xE0y. B\u1EA5m n\xFAt \u0111\xF3ng
      ho\u1EB7c ra ngo\xE0i \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i b\xE0n."
    english: These notes are private. Close this window or click outside to return
      to the board.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EC9 b\u1EA1n th\u1EA5y ghi ch\xFA n\xE0y. B\u1EA5m n\xFAt \u0111\xF3ng
      ho\u1EB7c ra ngo\xE0i \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i b\xE0n."
  - key: guided.ui.14
    source: "\u0110\xFAng r\u1ED3i! {0}"
    english: That's it! {0}
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xFAng r\u1ED3i! {0}"
  - key: guided.ui.15
    source: "\u0110\u1EEBng lo, t\xF4i s\u1EBD \u0111i c\xF9ng b\u1EA1n t\u1EEBng
      b\u01B0\u1EDBc."
    english: Don't worry. I will guide you one step at a time.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng lo, t\xF4i s\u1EBD \u0111i c\xF9ng b\u1EA1n t\u1EEBng
      b\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - key: guided.26.instruction
    source: "\u0110\u1ECDc c\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng tr\xE1i tim, r\u1ED3i
      b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EF1
      th\u1EED."
    english: "Read what your hearts mean, then click GOT IT \xB7 CONTINUE to try
      them yourself."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ECDc c\xE2u chuy\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng tr\xE1i tim,
      r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C \u0111\u1EC3
      t\u1EF1 th\u1EED."
  - key: guided.27.title
    source: "Cho m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n b\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u1EDBi"
    english: Let a friend step forward
    vietnamese: "Cho m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA1n b\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u1EDBi"
  - key: guided.27.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF vi\u1EC1n
      xanh."
    english: LEFT-DRAG number 12 into the green seat.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF vi\u1EC1n
      xanh."
  - key: guided.27.purpose
    source: "Cho Villager s\u1ED1 12 m\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i nh\xE9. \u0110\u01B0a
      b\xE0i thu\u1ED9c phe b\u1EA1n t\u1EEB tay xu\u1ED1ng gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng t\u1ED1n
      2 tim. B\u1EA1n s\u1EBD c\xF2n 3 tim \u2014 \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC3 t\xEDnh
      n\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\u1EBFp theo."
    english: "Give Villager number 12 a seat. Bringing your faction\u2019s card from
      hand into an empty seat costs 2 hearts. You will have 3 hearts left to plan
      your next move."
    vietnamese: "Cho Villager s\u1ED1 12 m\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i nh\xE9. \u0110\u01B0a
      b\xE0i thu\u1ED9c phe b\u1EA1n t\u1EEB tay xu\u1ED1ng gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng t\u1ED1n
      2 tim. B\u1EA1n s\u1EBD c\xF2n 3 tim \u2014 \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111\u1EC3 t\xEDnh
      n\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\u1EBFp theo."
  - key: guided.27.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 \u0111\xE3 ng\u1ED3i xu\u1ED1ng. B\u1EA1n c\xF2n 3
      tim."
    english: Number 12 is seated. You have 3 hearts left.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 \u0111\xE3 ng\u1ED3i xu\u1ED1ng. B\u1EA1n c\xF2n
      3 tim."
  - key: guided.28.title
    source: "M\u1ED9t b\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i th\u1EBF c\u1EDD"
    english: One step to change the position
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t b\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i th\u1EBF c\u1EDD"
  - key: guided.28.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng vi\u1EC1n xanh."
    english: Drag number 12 to the empty green seat.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng vi\u1EC1n xanh."
  - key: guided.28.purpose
    source: "Trong b\xE0i t\u1EADp n\xE0y, l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 \u0111\xE3 h\u1EBFt kh\xF3a
      di chuy\u1EC3n. Chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i m\xECnh sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng ch\u1EC9
      t\u1ED1n 1 tim, n\xEAn 3 tim s\u1EBD c\xF2n 2 tim. B\xE0i trung l\u1EADp c\u0169ng
      c\xF3 gi\xE1 chuy\u1EC3n \u1EA5y."
    english: For this exercise, number 12 has finished its movement lock. Moving
      your card to an empty seat costs 1 heart, leaving 2 of your 3 hearts. Neutral
      cards move for that price too.
    vietnamese: "Trong b\xE0i t\u1EADp n\xE0y, l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 \u0111\xE3 h\u1EBFt
      kh\xF3a di chuy\u1EC3n. Chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i m\xECnh sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng
      ch\u1EC9 t\u1ED1n 1 tim, n\xEAn 3 tim s\u1EBD c\xF2n 2 tim. B\xE0i trung l\u1EADp
      c\u0169ng c\xF3 gi\xE1 chuy\u1EC3n \u1EA5y."
  - key: guided.28.success
    source: "M\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i m\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED5i b\u1EB1ng 1 tim.
      B\u1EA1n c\xF2n 2 tim."
    english: A new seat for 1 heart. You have 2 hearts left.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i m\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED5i b\u1EB1ng 1 tim.
      B\u1EA1n c\xF2n 2 tim."
  - key: guided.29.title
    source: "L\xF9i l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 b\u01B0\u1EDBc xa h\u01A1n"
    english: Step back to go further
    vietnamese: "L\xF9i l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 b\u01B0\u1EDBc xa h\u01A1n"
  - key: guided.29.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 v\u1EC1 khay b\xE0i b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi r\u1ED3i
      th\u1EA3."
    english: Drag number 12 back to the hand below, then release.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 v\u1EC1 khay b\xE0i b\xEAn d\u01B0\u1EDBi
      r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: guided.29.purpose
    source: "\u0110\xF4i khi \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0i v\u1EC1 tay l\xE0 c\xE1ch l\u1EA5y
      l\u1EA1i s\u1EE9c. L\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n 2 tim: t\u1EEB
      2 tim l\xEAn 4 tim. M\u1EE9c ho\xE0n kh\xF4ng v\u01B0\u1EE3t ph\xED \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1EB7t, v\xE0 b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF h\u01A1n 5 tim."
    english: 'Sometimes bringing a card home restores your strength. Number 12 refunds
      2 hearts: 2 hearts becomes 4 hearts. A refund never exceeds its placement payment
      or the 5-heart cap.'
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xF4i khi \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0i v\u1EC1 tay l\xE0 c\xE1ch l\u1EA5y
      l\u1EA1i s\u1EE9c. L\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n 2 tim: t\u1EEB
      2 tim l\xEAn 4 tim. M\u1EE9c ho\xE0n kh\xF4ng v\u01B0\u1EE3t ph\xED \u0111\xE3
      \u0111\u1EB7t, v\xE0 b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF h\u01A1n 5 tim."
  - key: guided.29.success
    source: "B\u1EA1n l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i 2 tim. C\xF2n 4 tim cho l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn
      ti\u1EBFp theo."
    english: You recovered 2 hearts. You have 4 hearts for your next choice.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i 2 tim. C\xF2n 4 tim cho l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn
      ti\u1EBFp theo."
  - key: guided.30.title
    source: "Th\u1EED m\u1ED9t qu\xE2n c\u1EDD ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia"
    english: "Try the other side\u2019s card"
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EED m\u1ED9t qu\xE2n c\u1EDD ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia"
  - key: guided.30.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C \u0111\u1EC3 qua
      m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng l\u01B0\u1EE3t v\xE0 h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EE7 tim."
    english: "Click GOT IT \xB7 CONTINUE to pass through a turn cycle and refill
      your hearts."
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C \u0111\u1EC3
      qua m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng l\u01B0\u1EE3t v\xE0 h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EE7 tim."
  - key: guided.30.purpose
    source: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng b\u1ECB gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n \u1EDF b\xE0i c\u1EE7a
      phe m\xECnh. C\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp l\xEAn b\xE0n, nh\u01B0ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\u1EA3i
      tr\u1EA3 5 tim. Ta qua l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED m\u1ED9t l\u1EF1a
      ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EAFt h\u01A1n nh\xE9."
    english: "You are not limited to your faction\u2019s cards. You may play opposing
      or neutral cards, but usually pay 5 hearts. Let\u2019s pass turns and try a
      more expensive choice."
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng b\u1ECB gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n \u1EDF b\xE0i c\u1EE7a
      phe m\xECnh. C\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng
      ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp l\xEAn b\xE0n, nh\u01B0ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\u1EA3i
      tr\u1EA3 5 tim. Ta qua l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED m\u1ED9t l\u1EF1a
      ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EAFt h\u01A1n nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.30.success
    source: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1EDBi \u0111\xE3 t\u1EDBi, mang l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EE7
      5 tim cho b\u1EA1n."
    english: A new turn brings all 5 hearts back to you.
    vietnamese: "L\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1EDBi \u0111\xE3 t\u1EDBi, mang l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EE7
      5 tim cho b\u1EA1n."
  - key: guided.31.title
    source: "M\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i \u0111\u1ED5i b\u1EB1ng c\u1EA3 l\u01B0\u1EE3t"
    english: A seat that spends your turn
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i \u0111\u1ED5i b\u1EB1ng c\u1EA3 l\u01B0\u1EE3t"
  - key: guided.31.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng vi\u1EC1n xanh."
    english: Drag number 3 into the empty green seat.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng vi\u1EC1n xanh."
  - key: guided.31.purpose
    source: "B\u1EA1n v\u1EABn l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i Villager, c\xF2n l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 3 thu\u1ED9c nh\xF3m Cursermancer. \u0110\u01B0a n\xF3 t\u1EEB tay
      xu\u1ED1ng t\u1ED1n 5 tim. Nh\xECn thanh tim v\u1EC1 0 nh\xE9: m\u1ED9t l\u1EF1a
      ch\u1ECDn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng h\u1EBFt s\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      n\xE0y."
    english: "You still control Villagers, while number 3 belongs to the Cursermancer
      faction. Playing it costs 5 hearts. Watch the meter reach 0: one choice can
      use your whole turn\u2019s energy."
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n v\u1EABn l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i Villager, c\xF2n
      l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 thu\u1ED9c nh\xF3m Cursermancer. \u0110\u01B0a n\xF3 t\u1EEB
      tay xu\u1ED1ng t\u1ED1n 5 tim. Nh\xECn thanh tim v\u1EC1 0 nh\xE9: m\u1ED9t
      l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng h\u1EBFt s\u1EE9c c\u1EE7a l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      n\xE0y."
  - key: guided.31.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 \u0111\xE3 l\xEAn b\xE0n, d\xF9ng h\u1EBFt 5 tim c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n."
    english: Number 3 is on the board, using all 5 of your hearts.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 \u0111\xE3 l\xEAn b\xE0n, d\xF9ng h\u1EBFt 5 tim
      c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
  - key: guided.32.title
    source: "M\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1EDBi, m\u1ED9t c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i"
    english: A new turn, a new chance
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1EDBi, m\u1ED9t c\u01A1 h\u1ED9i"
  - key: guided.32.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C \u0111\u1EC3 qua
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t v\xE0 nh\u1EADn l\u1EA1i 5 tim."
    english: "Click GOT IT \xB7 CONTINUE to pass turns and regain 5 hearts."
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C \u0111\u1EC3
      qua l\u01B0\u1EE3t v\xE0 nh\u1EADn l\u1EA1i 5 tim."
  - key: guided.32.purpose
    source: "H\u1EBFt tim ch\u01B0a ph\u1EA3i h\u1EBFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ch\u01A1i.
      \u0110\u1EA7u l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a m\xECnh, b\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EE7 5 tim; tim d\u01B0 kh\xF4ng c\u1ED9ng
      d\u1ED3n. N\xFAt n\xE0y cho hai ph\xEDa qua l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n
      th\u1EED ti\u1EBFp."
    english: "Running out of hearts is not the end. Your next action turn refills
      them to 5; leftovers do not accumulate. This button passes both sides\u2019
      turns so you can keep practising."
    vietnamese: "H\u1EBFt tim ch\u01B0a ph\u1EA3i h\u1EBFt \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ch\u01A1i.
      \u0110\u1EA7u l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a m\xECnh, b\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EE7 5 tim; tim d\u01B0 kh\xF4ng c\u1ED9ng
      d\u1ED3n. N\xFAt n\xE0y cho hai ph\xEDa qua l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n
      th\u1EED ti\u1EBFp."
  - key: guided.32.success
    source: "\u0110\u1EE7 5 tim r\u1ED3i. Th\u1EED \u0111\u1ED5i v\u1ECB tr\xED c\u1EE7a
      l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 nh\xE9."
    english: You have 5 hearts again. Try moving number 3.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EE7 5 tim r\u1ED3i. Th\u1EED \u0111\u1ED5i v\u1ECB tr\xED
      c\u1EE7a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.33.title
    source: "\u0110\u1ED5i th\u1EBF c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\xEAn kia"
    english: "Shift the other side\u2019s position"
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ED5i th\u1EBF c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\xEAn kia"
  - key: guided.33.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng vi\u1EC1n xanh."
    english: Drag number 3 to the empty green seat.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng vi\u1EC1n xanh."
  - key: guided.33.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 \u0111\xE3 h\u1EBFt kh\xF3a trong b\xE0i t\u1EADp. Chuy\u1EC3n
      b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng t\u1ED1n 3 tim;
      b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp ch\u1EC9 t\u1ED1n 1 tim. H\xE3y xem
      5 tim c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n c\xF2n l\u1EA1i bao nhi\xEAu."
    english: Number 3 is unlocked for this exercise. Moving an opposing card costs
      3 hearts; yours or a neutral card costs 1 heart. Watch what remains of your
      5 hearts.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 \u0111\xE3 h\u1EBFt kh\xF3a trong b\xE0i t\u1EADp.
      Chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng
      t\u1ED1n 3 tim; b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp ch\u1EC9 t\u1ED1n 1
      tim. H\xE3y xem 5 tim c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n c\xF2n l\u1EA1i bao nhi\xEAu."
  - key: guided.33.success
    source: "L\u1EA7n chuy\u1EC3n \u1EA5y t\u1ED1n 3 tim. B\u1EA1n c\xF2n 2 tim."
    english: That move cost 3 hearts. You have 2 hearts left.
    vietnamese: "L\u1EA7n chuy\u1EC3n \u1EA5y t\u1ED1n 3 tim. B\u1EA1n c\xF2n 2 tim."
  - key: guided.34.title
    source: "Ch\u1ED7 n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xE0nh cho ai?"
    english: Who could take this seat?
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ED7 n\xE0y c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xE0nh cho ai?"
  - key: guided.34.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EAFt
      \u0111\u1EA7u l\u01B0\u1EE3t t\u1EADp ti\u1EBFp theo."
    english: "Click GOT IT \xB7 CONTINUE to start the next practice turn."
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C \u0111\u1EC3
      b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u l\u01B0\u1EE3t t\u1EADp ti\u1EBFp theo."
  - key: guided.34.purpose
    source: "Gh\u1EBF \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3n
      m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c. Ta s\u1EBD d\xF9ng b\xE0i tr\xEAn tay \u0111\u1EC3
      thay l\xE1 \u0111ang ng\u1ED3i. L\u1EA7n n\xE0y c\xF3 b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i
      ph\u01B0\u01A1ng n\xEAn c\u1EA7n 5 tim; h\xE3y qua l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EC3
      chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EE7."
    english: An occupied seat can still welcome a different card. We will replace
      its occupant from your hand. This pair involves an opposing card and needs
      5 hearts, so pass turns first.
    vietnamese: "Gh\u1EBF \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      \u0111\xF3n m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xE1c. Ta s\u1EBD d\xF9ng b\xE0i tr\xEAn tay \u0111\u1EC3
      thay l\xE1 \u0111ang ng\u1ED3i. L\u1EA7n n\xE0y c\xF3 b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i
      ph\u01B0\u01A1ng n\xEAn c\u1EA7n 5 tim; h\xE3y qua l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EC3
      chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EE7."
  - key: guided.34.success
    source: "5 tim \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng. B\u1EA1n mu\u1ED1n ai ng\u1ED3i \u1EDF
      \u0111\xF3?"
    english: Your 5 hearts are ready. Who should sit there?
    vietnamese: "5 tim \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng. B\u1EA1n mu\u1ED1n ai ng\u1ED3i
      \u1EDF \u0111\xF3?"
  - key: guided.35.title
    source: "\u0110\u01B0a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi v\xE0o cu\u1ED9c"
    english: Bring someone new into play
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u01B0a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi v\xE0o cu\u1ED9c"
  - key: guided.35.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 t\u1EEB tay l\xEAn \u0111\xFAng l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      3 vi\u1EC1n xanh."
    english: Drag number 12 from hand onto the green-highlighted number 3.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 t\u1EEB tay l\xEAn \u0111\xFAng l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      3 vi\u1EC1n xanh."
  - key: guided.35.purpose
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 s\u1EBD ng\u1ED3i thay, l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 v\u1EC1 tay
      ch\u1EE7 s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu g\u1ED1c. C\u1EA3 l\u1EA7n thay n\xE0y t\u1ED1n 5
      tim, kh\xF4ng ho\xE0n tim ri\xEAng cho l\xE1 b\u1ECB thay. Gi\u1EDD th\u1EED
      trao ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i \u1EA5y cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi nh\xE9."
    english: "Number 12 takes the seat; number 3 returns to its original owner\u2019s
      hand. The whole replacement costs 5 hearts, with no extra refund for the displaced
      card. Give the newcomer its place."
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 s\u1EBD ng\u1ED3i thay, l\xE1 s\u1ED1 3 v\u1EC1
      tay ch\u1EE7 s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu g\u1ED1c. C\u1EA3 l\u1EA7n thay n\xE0y t\u1ED1n
      5 tim, kh\xF4ng ho\xE0n tim ri\xEAng cho l\xE1 b\u1ECB thay. Gi\u1EDD th\u1EED
      trao ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i \u1EA5y cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.35.success
    source: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 \u0111\xE3 ng\u1ED3i thay. C\u1EA3 thao t\xE1c t\u1ED1n
      \u0111\xFAng 5 tim."
    english: Number 12 has taken the seat. The whole action cost 5 hearts.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 \u0111\xE3 ng\u1ED3i thay. C\u1EA3 thao t\xE1c
      t\u1ED1n \u0111\xFAng 5 tim."
  - key: guided.36.title
    source: "Nh\u1EDB gi\xE1 c\u1EE7a t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc"
    english: Remember the price of each step
    vietnamese: "Nh\u1EDB gi\xE1 c\u1EE7a t\u1EEBng b\u01B0\u1EDBc"
  - key: guided.36.instruction
    source: "\u0110\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i c\xE1c c\xE1ch d\xF9ng v\xE0 l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i
      tim, r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
    english: "Review how you spend and recover hearts, then click GOT IT \xB7 CONTINUE."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i c\xE1c c\xE1ch d\xF9ng v\xE0 l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i
      tim, r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
  - key: guided.36.purpose
    source: "B\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa t\u1EF1 c\u1EA3m nh\u1EADn nh\u1EEFng c\xE1i gi\xE1
      \u1EA5y r\u1ED3i. Trang n\xE0y nh\u1EAFc l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n d\u1EC5
      nh\u1EDB: \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0i l\xEAn b\xE0n, chuy\u1EC3n gh\u1EBF v\xE0 r\xFAt
      v\u1EC1 tay l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn kh\xE1c nhau."
    english: 'You have felt those costs through your own moves. This page is a reminder:
      playing a card, moving its seat and bringing it home are different choices.'
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa t\u1EF1 c\u1EA3m nh\u1EADn nh\u1EEFng c\xE1i gi\xE1
      \u1EA5y r\u1ED3i. Trang n\xE0y nh\u1EAFc l\u1EA1i \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n d\u1EC5
      nh\u1EDB: \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0i l\xEAn b\xE0n, chuy\u1EC3n gh\u1EBF v\xE0 r\xFAt
      v\u1EC1 tay l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn kh\xE1c nhau."
  - key: guided.36.success
    source: "Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n nh\u1EDB v\u1ED9i. C\u1EE9 ngh\u0129 v\u1EC1 n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      b\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa t\u1EF1 l\xE0m."
    english: No need to rush your memory. Think of the moves you just made.
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n nh\u1EDB v\u1ED9i. C\u1EE9 ngh\u0129 v\u1EC1 n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      b\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa t\u1EF1 l\xE0m."
  - key: guided.37.title
    source: "M\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ED5i, hai s\u1ED1 ph\u1EADn"
    english: One swap, two changed paths
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ED5i, hai s\u1ED1 ph\u1EADn"
  - key: guided.37.instruction
    source: "\u0110\u1ECDc c\xE1c t\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED5i b\xE0i, r\u1ED3i
      b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
    english: "Read the swap situations, then click GOT IT \xB7 CONTINUE."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ECDc c\xE1c t\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED5i b\xE0i, r\u1ED3i
      b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
  - key: guided.37.purpose
    source: "C\xF3 l\xFAc b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n th\xEAm ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, ch\u1EC9
      mu\u1ED1n hai l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7. Gi\xE1 ph\u1EE5 thu\u1ED9c c\xF3
      bao nhi\xEAu b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng trong c\u1EB7p \u1EA5y.
      \u0110\u1ECDc t\u1EEBng t\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 th\u1EED."
    english: Sometimes you need no new card, just two cards in different seats. The
      cost depends on how many opposing cards are in the pair. Read each situation
      as a move you might make.
    vietnamese: "C\xF3 l\xFAc b\u1EA1n kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n th\xEAm ng\u01B0\u1EDDi,
      ch\u1EC9 mu\u1ED1n hai l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7. Gi\xE1 ph\u1EE5 thu\u1ED9c
      c\xF3 bao nhi\xEAu b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng trong c\u1EB7p \u1EA5y.
      \u0110\u1ECDc t\u1EEBng t\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      b\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 th\u1EED."
  - key: guided.37.success
    source: "\u0110\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7 \u0111\xFAng l\xFAc c\u0169ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      \u0111\u1ED5i h\u01B0\u1EDBng c\u1EA3 v\xE1n ch\u01A1i."
    english: A well-timed swap can change the course of a match.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7 \u0111\xFAng l\xFAc c\u0169ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      \u0111\u1ED5i h\u01B0\u1EDBng c\u1EA3 v\xE1n ch\u01A1i."
  - key: guided.8.title
    source: "\u0110\u01B0a Hunter v\xE0o v\u1ECB tr\xED"
    english: Put Hunter in position
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u01B0a Hunter v\xE0o v\u1ECB tr\xED"
  - key: guided.heartOverview
    source: "GI\u1EEE S\u1EE8C CHO M\u1ED8T \u0110\xCAM D\xC0I\n\nNh\u1EEFng tr\xE1i
      tim tr\xEAn g\xF3c m\xE0n h\xECnh l\xE0 s\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n h\xE0nh
      \u0111\u1ED9ng. M\u1ED7i phe c\xF3 ph\u1EA7n c\u1EE7a m\xECnh, t\u1ED1i \u0111a
      5 tim; \u0111\xE2y kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\xE1u c\u1EE7a l\xE1 b\xE0i.\n\nM\u1ED7i
      l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EB7t b\xE0i, chuy\u1EC3n gh\u1EBF, thay/\u0111\u1ED5i b\xE0i
      ho\u1EB7c d\xF9ng m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD ti\xEAu
      tim. Gi\xE1 d\u1EF1a v\xE0o nh\xF3m g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a l\xE1, kh\xF4ng d\u1EF1a
      v\xE0o vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt n\xF3 \u0111ang gi\u1EA5u.\n\nKhi l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u, tim \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EE7 5 tim. Ph\u1EA7n d\u01B0 kh\xF4ng c\u1ED9ng d\u1ED3n.
      \u0110\u1EBFn pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, b\u1EA1n d\xF9ng s\u1ED1 tim c\xF2n l\u1EA1i;
      ri\xEAng b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim.\n\n\u0110\u1EEBng lo ph\u1EA3i
      nh\u1EDB h\u1EBFt ngay. Ta s\u1EBD th\u1EED t\u1EEBng n\u01B0\u1EDBc, \u0111\u1EC3
      b\u1EA1n t\u1EF1 th\u1EA5y l\xFAc n\xE0o tim m\u1EA5t \u0111i v\xE0 l\xFAc
      n\xE0o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i."
    english: "KEEP STRENGTH FOR A LONG NIGHT\n\nThe hearts in the corner are your
      energy for actions. Each side has its own share, capped at 5 hearts. They are
      not a card\u2019s health.\n\nPlaying, moving, replacing/swapping cards and
      some skills spend hearts. Prices follow a card\u2019s printed faction, not
      the secret role it hides.\n\nYour action turn begins with a refill to 5 hearts.
      Leftovers do not accumulate. Sacrifice uses your remaining hearts; voting itself
      costs no hearts.\n\nDo not worry about remembering everything yet. We will
      try one move at a time, so you can see when hearts are spent and when they
      return."
    vietnamese: "GI\u1EEE S\u1EE8C CHO M\u1ED8T \u0110\xCAM D\xC0I\n\nNh\u1EEFng
      tr\xE1i tim tr\xEAn g\xF3c m\xE0n h\xECnh l\xE0 s\u1EE9c \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng. M\u1ED7i phe c\xF3 ph\u1EA7n c\u1EE7a m\xECnh, t\u1ED1i
      \u0111a 5 tim; \u0111\xE2y kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\xE1u c\u1EE7a l\xE1 b\xE0i.\n\nM\u1ED7i
      l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EB7t b\xE0i, chuy\u1EC3n gh\u1EBF, thay/\u0111\u1ED5i b\xE0i
      ho\u1EB7c d\xF9ng m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD ti\xEAu
      tim. Gi\xE1 d\u1EF1a v\xE0o nh\xF3m g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a l\xE1, kh\xF4ng d\u1EF1a
      v\xE0o vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt n\xF3 \u0111ang gi\u1EA5u.\n\nKhi l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u, tim \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EE7 5 tim. Ph\u1EA7n d\u01B0 kh\xF4ng c\u1ED9ng d\u1ED3n.
      \u0110\u1EBFn pha Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, b\u1EA1n d\xF9ng s\u1ED1 tim c\xF2n l\u1EA1i;
      ri\xEAng b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim.\n\n\u0110\u1EEBng lo ph\u1EA3i
      nh\u1EDB h\u1EBFt ngay. Ta s\u1EBD th\u1EED t\u1EEBng n\u01B0\u1EDBc, \u0111\u1EC3
      b\u1EA1n t\u1EF1 th\u1EA5y l\xFAc n\xE0o tim m\u1EA5t \u0111i v\xE0 l\xFAc
      n\xE0o \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i."
  - key: guided.movementCosts
    source: "CHO M\u1ED8T L\xC1 B\u01AF\u1EDAC L\xCAN B\xC0N\nM\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7 ng\u1ED3i
      cho b\xE0i thu\u1ED9c phe b\u1EA1n t\u1ED1n 2 tim. N\u1EBFu \u0111\u01B0a b\xE0i
      \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp t\u1EEB tay xu\u1ED1ng
      gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng, b\u1EA1n c\u1EA7n tr\u1EA3 5 tim.\n\n\u0110\u01AFA L\xC1
      \u0110\xC3 NG\u1ED2I SANG GH\u1EBE KH\xC1C\nKhi h\u1EBFt kh\xF3a, chuy\u1EC3n
      b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng t\u1ED1n 1
      tim. Mu\u1ED1n chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng, b\u1EA1n
      c\u1EA7n 3 tim.\n\n\u0110\xD3N L\xC1 B\xC0I TR\u1EDE V\u1EC0 TAY\nT\u1EF1 r\xFAt
      b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n t\u1ED1i
      \u0111a 2 tim, kh\xF4ng v\u01B0\u1EE3t s\u1ED1 tim \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EA3 khi
      \u0111\u1EB7t. B\u1EA1n c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF h\u01A1n 5 tim.\n\xC9p
      b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EC1 tay th\xEC b\u1EA1n tr\u1EA3
      5 tim; kh\xF4ng ai \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n tim.\n\nC\xF2n nh\u1EDB l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 12 kh\xF4ng? B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 ti\xEAu 1 tim \u0111\u1EC3 chuy\u1EC3n
      gh\u1EBF, r\u1ED3i l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i 2 tim khi r\xFAt v\u1EC1. \u0110\xF4i
      khi l\xF9i m\u1ED9t b\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB cho
      b\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\u1EBFp theo."
    english: "LET A CARD STEP ONTO THE BOARD\nA seat for your faction\u2019s card
      costs 2 hearts. Bringing an opposing or neutral card from hand to an empty
      seat needs 5 hearts.\n\nMOVE A SEATED CARD SOMEWHERE NEW\nOnce unlocked, moving
      your or a neutral card to an empty seat costs 1 heart. Moving an opposing card
      needs 3 hearts.\n\nWELCOME A CARD BACK TO HAND\nReturning your or a neutral
      card refunds up to 2 hearts, never more than its placement payment. You cannot
      hold more than 5 hearts.\nForcing an opposing card home costs you 5 hearts;
      nobody gets a refund.\n\nRemember number 12? You spent 1 heart to move it,
      then recovered 2 hearts by bringing it home. Sometimes a step back prepares
      your next move."
    vietnamese: "CHO M\u1ED8T L\xC1 B\u01AF\u1EDAC L\xCAN B\xC0N\nM\u1ED9t ch\u1ED7
      ng\u1ED3i cho b\xE0i thu\u1ED9c phe b\u1EA1n t\u1ED1n 2 tim. N\u1EBFu \u0111\u01B0a
      b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp t\u1EEB tay
      xu\u1ED1ng gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng, b\u1EA1n c\u1EA7n tr\u1EA3 5 tim.\n\n\u0110\u01AFA
      L\xC1 \u0110\xC3 NG\u1ED2I SANG GH\u1EBE KH\xC1C\nKhi h\u1EBFt kh\xF3a, chuy\u1EC3n
      b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp sang gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng t\u1ED1n 1
      tim. Mu\u1ED1n chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng, b\u1EA1n
      c\u1EA7n 3 tim.\n\n\u0110\xD3N L\xC1 B\xC0I TR\u1EDE V\u1EC0 TAY\nT\u1EF1 r\xFAt
      b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n t\u1ED1i
      \u0111a 2 tim, kh\xF4ng v\u01B0\u1EE3t s\u1ED1 tim \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EA3 khi
      \u0111\u1EB7t. B\u1EA1n c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 gi\u1EEF h\u01A1n 5 tim.\n\xC9p
      b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EC1 tay th\xEC b\u1EA1n tr\u1EA3
      5 tim; kh\xF4ng ai \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n tim.\n\nC\xF2n nh\u1EDB l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 12 kh\xF4ng? B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 ti\xEAu 1 tim \u0111\u1EC3 chuy\u1EC3n
      gh\u1EBF, r\u1ED3i l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i 2 tim khi r\xFAt v\u1EC1. \u0110\xF4i
      khi l\xF9i m\u1ED9t b\u01B0\u1EDBc l\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB cho
      b\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\u1EBFp theo."
  - key: guided.skillCosts
    source: "C\xD3 NH\u1EEENG TH\u1EDCI KH\u1EAEC \u0110\xC1NG \u0110\u1EC2 GI\u1EEE
      TIM\nHunter b\u1EAFn ho\u1EB7c Witch d\xF9ng ph\xE9p \u0111\u1EC1u c\u1EA7n
      5 tim. N\u1EBFu \u0111ang ch\u1EDD ra \u0111\xF2n, \u0111\u1EEBng v\u1ED9i
      ti\xEAu h\u1EBFt v\xE0o di chuy\u1EC3n. Gambler v\xE0 Invoker hi\u1EC7n kh\xF4ng
      t\u1ED1n tim khi d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, nh\u01B0ng v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n \u0111\xFAng
      m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\xE0 th\u1EDDi \u0111i\u1EC3m.\n\nM\u1ED6I L\xC1 C\u0168NG
      C\xD3 C\xC1CH RI\xCANG\nTotem c\xF2n k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng: \u0111\u1EB7t ho\u1EB7c
      chuy\u1EC3n gh\u1EBF t\u1ED1n 1 tim; t\u1EF1 r\xFAt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n
      1 tim. \xC9p Totem \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EC1 tay c\u0169ng t\u1ED1n
      1 tim.\n\u0110\u01B0a Prankster t\u1EEB tay l\xEAn b\xE0n t\u1ED1n 3 tim, d\xF9
      n\xF3 thu\u1ED9c nh\xF3m n\xE0o.\n\nH\u1EBET TIM, B\u1EA0N V\u1EAAN C\xD2N
      VI\u1EC6C \u0110\u1EC2 L\xC0M\nXem b\xE0i, \u0111\u1ED5i tab, ghi s\u1ED5,
      xem ngh\u0129a trang, ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2, nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a, b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu
      v\xE0 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EC1u kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim.
      Thanh tr\u1EEBng c\u0169ng mi\u1EC5n ph\xED, nh\u01B0ng m\u1ED7i phe ch\u1EC9
      c\xF3 2 l\u1EA7n d\xF9ng m\u1ED7i v\xE1n. Thi\u1EBFu tim th\xEC thao t\xE1c
      b\u1ECB t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i, kh\xF4ng tr\u1EEB th\xEAm."
    english: 'SOME MOMENTS ARE WORTH SAVING HEARTS FOR

      A Hunter shot or Witch
      cast needs 5 hearts. If you are waiting to strike, do not spend everything
      moving cards. Gambler and Invoker currently spend no hearts on their skills,
      but still need legal targets and timing.


      EACH CARD HAS ITS OWN WAY

      An
      unsilenced Totem costs 1 heart to play or move; returning it yourself refunds
      1 heart. Forcing an opposing Totem home also costs 1 heart.

      Playing
      Prankster from hand costs 3 hearts, whatever its faction.


      NO HEARTS
      DOES NOT MEAN NOTHING TO DO

      Inspecting, tabs, notes, Cemetery, role
      selection, infection, voting and ending a turn all cost no hearts. Purge is
      free too, but each side gets only 2 uses per match. Unaffordable actions are
      rejected without an extra deduction.'
    vietnamese: "C\xD3 NH\u1EEENG TH\u1EDCI KH\u1EAEC \u0110\xC1NG \u0110\u1EC2 GI\u1EEE
      TIM\nHunter b\u1EAFn ho\u1EB7c Witch d\xF9ng ph\xE9p \u0111\u1EC1u c\u1EA7n
      5 tim. N\u1EBFu \u0111ang ch\u1EDD ra \u0111\xF2n, \u0111\u1EEBng v\u1ED9i
      ti\xEAu h\u1EBFt v\xE0o di chuy\u1EC3n. Gambler v\xE0 Invoker hi\u1EC7n kh\xF4ng
      t\u1ED1n tim khi d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, nh\u01B0ng v\u1EABn c\u1EA7n \u0111\xFAng
      m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu v\xE0 th\u1EDDi \u0111i\u1EC3m.\n\nM\u1ED6I L\xC1 C\u0168NG
      C\xD3 C\xC1CH RI\xCANG\nTotem c\xF2n k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng: \u0111\u1EB7t ho\u1EB7c
      chuy\u1EC3n gh\u1EBF t\u1ED1n 1 tim; t\u1EF1 r\xFAt \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n
      1 tim. \xC9p Totem \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EC1 tay c\u0169ng t\u1ED1n
      1 tim.\n\u0110\u01B0a Prankster t\u1EEB tay l\xEAn b\xE0n t\u1ED1n 3 tim, d\xF9
      n\xF3 thu\u1ED9c nh\xF3m n\xE0o.\n\nH\u1EBET TIM, B\u1EA0N V\u1EAAN C\xD2N
      VI\u1EC6C \u0110\u1EC2 L\xC0M\nXem b\xE0i, \u0111\u1ED5i tab, ghi s\u1ED5,
      xem ngh\u0129a trang, ch\u1ECDn vai tr\xF2, nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a, b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu
      v\xE0 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EC1u kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1n tim.
      Thanh tr\u1EEBng c\u0169ng mi\u1EC5n ph\xED, nh\u01B0ng m\u1ED7i phe ch\u1EC9
      c\xF3 2 l\u1EA7n d\xF9ng m\u1ED7i v\xE1n. Thi\u1EBFu tim th\xEC thao t\xE1c
      b\u1ECB t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i, kh\xF4ng tr\u1EEB th\xEAm."
  - key: guided.inspection
    source: "Villager \xB7 S\u1ED0 10\n\n\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t l\xE1 th\u01B0\u1EDDng,
      kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng.\n\n\u0110\u1EB7t
      t\u1EEB nh\xF3m c\u1EE7a phe \u0111ang ch\u01A1i: 2 tim. Nh\xF3m \u0111\u1ED1i
      ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp: 5 tim.\n\nChu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i l\u1EA7n
      n\u1EEFa \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng."
    english: "VILLAGER \xB7 NUMBER 10\n\nAn ordinary card with no active skill.\n\nPlay
      from the active faction: 2 hearts. Opponent or neutral cards: 5 hearts.\n\nRight-click
      again to close."
    vietnamese: "Villager \xB7 S\u1ED0 10\n\n\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 m\u1ED9t l\xE1 th\u01B0\u1EDDng,
      kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u1EE7 \u0111\u1ED9ng.\n\n\u0110\u1EB7t
      t\u1EEB nh\xF3m c\u1EE7a phe \u0111ang ch\u01A1i: 2 tim. Nh\xF3m \u0111\u1ED1i
      ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp: 5 tim.\n\nChu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i l\u1EA7n
      n\u1EEFa \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng."
  - key: guided.38.title
    source: "\u0110\u1EC3 d\xE0nh cho th\u1EDDi kh\u1EAFc quan tr\u1ECDng"
    english: Save for the moment that matters
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EC3 d\xE0nh cho th\u1EDDi kh\u1EAFc quan tr\u1ECDng"
  - key: guided.38.instruction
    source: "\u0110\u1ECDc nh\u1EEFng ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7 v\xE0 h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng
      mi\u1EC5n ph\xED, r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
    english: "Read the exceptions and free actions, then click GOT IT \xB7 CONTINUE."
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ECDc nh\u1EEFng ngo\u1EA1i l\u1EC7 v\xE0 h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng
      mi\u1EC5n ph\xED, r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
  - key: guided.38.purpose
    source: "\u0110\u1EEBng ti\xEAu h\u1EBFt tim ch\u1EC9 v\xEC c\xF2n gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng.
      C\xF3 khi 5 tim gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i s\u1EBD th\xE0nh ph\xE1t Hunter b\u1EA1n
      \u0111ang ch\u1EDD. M\u1ED7i l\xE1 c\xF3 c\xE1ch gi\xFAp l\xE0ng ri\xEAng;
      \u0111\u1ECDc n\xF3 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh nh\xE9."
    english: Do not spend every heart just because a seat is open. Those saved 5
      hearts may become the Hunter shot you are waiting for. Read what each card
      offers before deciding.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng ti\xEAu h\u1EBFt tim ch\u1EC9 v\xEC c\xF2n gh\u1EBF
      tr\u1ED1ng. C\xF3 khi 5 tim gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i s\u1EBD th\xE0nh ph\xE1t Hunter
      b\u1EA1n \u0111ang ch\u1EDD. M\u1ED7i l\xE1 c\xF3 c\xE1ch gi\xFAp l\xE0ng ri\xEAng;
      \u0111\u1ECDc n\xF3 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh nh\xE9."
  - key: guided.38.success
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFt gi\u1EEF s\u1EE9c cho \u0111i\u1EC1u m\xECnh
      mu\u1ED1n l\xE0m."
    english: You know how to save your strength for the move you want.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 bi\u1EBFt gi\u1EEF s\u1EE9c cho \u0111i\u1EC1u
      m\xECnh mu\u1ED1n l\xE0m."
  - key: guided.swapCosts
    source: "KHI HAI L\xC1 TR\xCAN B\xC0N \u0110\u1ED4I CH\u1ED6\nC\xF3 l\xFAc ch\u1EC9
      \u0111\u1ED5i v\u1ECB tr\xED \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EE7 m\u1EDF ra m\u1ED9t n\u01B0\u1EDBc
      m\u1EDBi. N\u1EBFu c\u1EA3 hai l\xE0 b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp,
      b\u1EA1n tr\u1EA3 2 tim cho c\u1EA3 l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ED5i.\nC\xF3 \u0111\xFAng
      m\u1ED9t l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\xEC l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ED5i
      t\u1ED1n 3 tim. N\u1EBFu c\u1EA3 hai \u0111\u1EC1u l\xE0 b\xE0i \u0111\u1ED1i
      ph\u01B0\u01A1ng, b\u1EA1n c\u1EA7n tr\u1EA3 5 tim.\n\nKHI B\u1EA0N MU\u1ED0N
      \u0110\u01AFA M\u1ED8T L\xC1 M\u1EDAI V\xC0O\nK\xE9o b\xE0i t\u1EEB tay l\xEAn
      gh\u1EBF \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 b\xE0i: l\xE1 c\u0169 v\u1EC1 tay ch\u1EE7 s\u1EDF
      h\u1EEFu g\u1ED1c, l\xE1 m\u1EDBi ng\u1ED3i thay. C\u1EB7p b\xE0i ch\u1EC9
      g\u1ED3m b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp th\xEC t\u1ED1n 3 tim. C\xF3
      b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng n\xE0o trong c\u1EB7p
      th\xEC t\u1ED1n 5 tim. L\xE1 b\u1ECB thay kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n
      tim ri\xEAng.\n\nB\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa d\xF9ng l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 thay l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      3 b\u1EB1ng 5 tim, nh\u1EDB ch\u1EE9? C\u0169ng l\u01B0u \xFD: kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3
      \u0111\u1ED5i ng\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t c\u1EB7p li\xEAn t\u1EE5c trong
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t, v\xE0 l\xE1 \u0111ang kh\xF3a v\u1EABn ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EDD."
    english: "WHEN TWO SEATED CARDS CHANGE PLACES\nSometimes a new position is all
      you need. If both cards are yours or neutral, pay 2 hearts for the whole swap.\nExactly
      one opposing card makes the swap cost 3 hearts. If both belong to the opposing
      faction, you need 5 hearts.\n\nWHEN YOU WANT A NEW CARD TO STEP IN\nDrag a
      card from hand onto an occupied seat: the old card goes to its original owner\u2019s
      hand and the new one sits down. Only your/neutral cards in the pair costs 3
      hearts. Any opposing card makes it cost 5 hearts. The displaced card gets no
      extra refund.\n\nRemember replacing number 3 with number 12 for 5 hearts? Also
      remember: the same pair cannot be swapped back repeatedly in one turn, and
      locked cards must wait."
    vietnamese: "KHI HAI L\xC1 TR\xCAN B\xC0N \u0110\u1ED4I CH\u1ED6\nC\xF3 l\xFAc
      ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ED5i v\u1ECB tr\xED \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EE7 m\u1EDF ra m\u1ED9t
      n\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EDBi. N\u1EBFu c\u1EA3 hai l\xE0 b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c
      trung l\u1EADp, b\u1EA1n tr\u1EA3 2 tim cho c\u1EA3 l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1ED5i.\nC\xF3
      \u0111\xFAng m\u1ED9t l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\xEC l\u1EA7n
      \u0111\u1ED5i t\u1ED1n 3 tim. N\u1EBFu c\u1EA3 hai \u0111\u1EC1u l\xE0 b\xE0i
      \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng, b\u1EA1n c\u1EA7n tr\u1EA3 5 tim.\n\nKHI B\u1EA0N
      MU\u1ED0N \u0110\u01AFA M\u1ED8T L\xC1 M\u1EDAI V\xC0O\nK\xE9o b\xE0i t\u1EEB
      tay l\xEAn gh\u1EBF \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 b\xE0i: l\xE1 c\u0169 v\u1EC1 tay ch\u1EE7
      s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu g\u1ED1c, l\xE1 m\u1EDBi ng\u1ED3i thay. C\u1EB7p b\xE0i ch\u1EC9
      g\u1ED3m b\xE0i m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c trung l\u1EADp th\xEC t\u1ED1n 3 tim. C\xF3
      b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 l\xE1 \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng n\xE0o trong c\u1EB7p
      th\xEC t\u1ED1n 5 tim. L\xE1 b\u1ECB thay kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ho\xE0n
      tim ri\xEAng.\n\nB\u1EA1n v\u1EEBa d\xF9ng l\xE1 s\u1ED1 12 thay l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      3 b\u1EB1ng 5 tim, nh\u1EDB ch\u1EE9? C\u0169ng l\u01B0u \xFD: kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3
      \u0111\u1ED5i ng\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t c\u1EB7p li\xEAn t\u1EE5c trong
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t, v\xE0 l\xE1 \u0111ang kh\xF3a v\u1EABn ph\u1EA3i ch\u1EDD."
  - key: guided.39.title
    source: "Ng\u1ECDn \u0111\xE8n gi\u1EDD \u1EDF trong tay b\u1EA1n"
    english: The lantern is yours now
    vietnamese: "Ng\u1ECDn \u0111\xE8n gi\u1EDD \u1EDF trong tay b\u1EA1n"
  - key: guided.39.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 th\u1EED c\u1EA3 hai ph\xEDa v\xE0 t\u1EF1 d\xF9ng
      tim. B\u1EA5m CH\u01A0I TH\u1EEC V\u1EDAI BOT \u0111\u1EC3 vi\u1EBFt ti\u1EBFp
      v\xE1n c\u1EE7a m\xECnh."
    english: You have tried both sides and used hearts yourself. Click PRACTICE WITH
      A BOT to begin your own story.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 th\u1EED c\u1EA3 hai ph\xEDa v\xE0 t\u1EF1 d\xF9ng
      tim. B\u1EA5m CH\u01A0I TH\u1EEC V\u1EDAI BOT \u0111\u1EC3 vi\u1EBFt ti\u1EBFp
      v\xE1n c\u1EE7a m\xECnh."
  - key: guided.39.purpose
    source: "\u0110\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn \u0111\xE3 qua. D\xE2n l\xE0ng c\u1EA7n
      di\u1EC7t h\u1EBFt Cursermancer; l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n th\u1EAFng khi s\u1ED1
      Cursermancer s\u1ED1ng b\u1EB1ng ho\u1EB7c v\u01B0\u1EE3t s\u1ED1 Villager
      th\u1EADt c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng. Gi\u1EDD quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh l\xE0 c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n."
    english: Your first night is behind you. Villagers must remove every Cursermancer;
      the curse wins when living Cursermancers match or outnumber living true Villagers.
      Now the choices are yours.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xEAm \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn \u0111\xE3 qua. D\xE2n l\xE0ng
      c\u1EA7n di\u1EC7t h\u1EBFt Cursermancer; l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n th\u1EAFng khi
      s\u1ED1 Cursermancer s\u1ED1ng b\u1EB1ng ho\u1EB7c v\u01B0\u1EE3t s\u1ED1 Villager
      th\u1EADt c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng. Gi\u1EDD quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh l\xE0 c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n."
  - key: guided.39.success
    source: "Mang ng\u1ECDn \u0111\xE8n theo nh\xE9. Ng\xF4i l\xE0ng \u0111ang ch\u1EDD
      b\u1EA1n."
    english: Take the lantern with you. The village is waiting.
    vietnamese: "Mang ng\u1ECDn \u0111\xE8n theo nh\xE9. Ng\xF4i l\xE0ng \u0111ang
      ch\u1EDD b\u1EA1n."
  - key: guided.1.title
    source: "B\xED m\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn"
    english: The first secret
    vietnamese: "B\xED m\u1EADt \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn"
  - key: guided.1.instruction
    source: "Ch\u1ECDn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n: b\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T
      TR\xC1I v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 vi\u1EC1n v\xE0ng."
    english: 'Choose a keeper of the curse: LEFT-CLICK the gold-highlighted number
      1.'
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ECDn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\u1EEF l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n: b\u1EA5m
      CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 vi\u1EC1n v\xE0ng."
  - key: guided.2.title
    source: "Gh\xE9 sang ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia"
    english: Visit the other side
    vietnamese: "Gh\xE9 sang ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia"
  - key: guided.2.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m tab D\xC2N L\xC0NG \u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u khay b\xE0i. B\xEAn
      \u0111\xF3 c\xF2n m\u1ED9t b\xED m\u1EADt \u0111ang ch\u1EDD."
    english: Click the VILLAGERS tab above the hand. Another secret is waiting there.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m tab D\xC2N L\xC0NG \u1EDF \u0111\u1EA7u khay b\xE0i. B\xEAn
      \u0111\xF3 c\xF2n m\u1ED9t b\xED m\u1EADt \u0111ang ch\u1EDD."
  - key: guided.3.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 vi\u1EC1n v\xE0ng
      \u0111\u1EC3 gi\u1EA5u l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u1EDF \u0111\xF3."
    english: LEFT-CLICK the gold-highlighted number 11 to hide the curse there.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 vi\u1EC1n v\xE0ng
      \u0111\u1EC3 gi\u1EA5u l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u1EDF \u0111\xF3."
  - key: guided.4.title
    source: "Th\u1EAFp \u0111\xE8n l\xEAn n\xE0o"
    english: Light the lantern
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EAFp \u0111\xE8n l\xEAn n\xE0o"
  - key: guided.4.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m B\u1EAET \u0110\u1EA6U V\xC1N \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng.
      L\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn s\u1EBD thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
    english: Click the highlighted START MATCH button. Villagers will take the first
      turn.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m B\u1EAET \u0110\u1EA6U V\xC1N \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng.
      L\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn s\u1EBD thu\u1ED9c v\u1EC1 D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
  - key: guided.5.title
    source: "L\u1EAFng nghe m\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i"
    english: Listen to a card
    vietnamese: "L\u1EAFng nghe m\u1ED9t l\xE1 b\xE0i"
  - key: guided.5.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc
      m\xF4 t\u1EA3 c\u1EE7a n\xF3."
    english: RIGHT-CLICK number 10 to read its description.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I v\xE0o l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 \u0111\u1EC3
      \u0111\u1ECDc m\xF4 t\u1EA3 c\u1EE7a n\xF3."
  - key: guided.6.title
    source: "Mang \u0111i\u1EC1u v\u1EEBa bi\u1EBFt v\xE0o cu\u1ED9c"
    english: Put that knowledge to work
    vietnamese: "Mang \u0111i\u1EC1u v\u1EEBa bi\u1EBFt v\xE0o cu\u1ED9c"
  - key: guided.6.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa v\xE0o l\xE1 \u0111ang
      ph\xF3ng to \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng ph\u1EA7n xem."
    english: RIGHT-CLICK the enlarged card again to close inspection.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa v\xE0o l\xE1 \u0111ang
      ph\xF3ng to \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng ph\u1EA7n xem."
  - key: guided.7.instruction
    source: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I \u1EDF l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10, k\xE9o \u0111\u1EBFn
      gh\u1EBF vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: Hold LEFT MOUSE on number 10, drag to the green seat, then release.
    vietnamese: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I \u1EDF l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10, k\xE9o \u0111\u1EBFn
      gh\u1EBF vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: guided.8.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 s\u1ED1 9 \u0111\u1EBFn gh\u1EBF vi\u1EC1n
      xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: LEFT-DRAG number 9 to the green seat and release.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 s\u1ED1 9 \u0111\u1EBFn gh\u1EBF
      vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: guided.9.title
    source: "Gi\u1EEF s\u1EE9c cho l\u01B0\u1EE3t sau"
    english: Save your strength
    vietnamese: "Gi\u1EEF s\u1EE9c cho l\u01B0\u1EE3t sau"
  - key: guided.9.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T. Ta s\u1EBD nh\xECn b\xE0n
      ch\u01A1i t\u1EEB ph\xEDa Cursermancer."
    english: Click END TURN. We will look at the board from the Cursermancer side.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T. Ta s\u1EBD nh\xECn b\xE0n
      ch\u01A1i t\u1EEB ph\xEDa Cursermancer."
  - key: guided.10.title
    source: "\u0110i\u1EC1u ng\xF4i l\xE0ng ch\u01B0a th\u1EA5y"
    english: What the village cannot see
    vietnamese: "\u0110i\u1EC1u ng\xF4i l\xE0ng ch\u01B0a th\u1EA5y"
  - key: guided.10.instruction
    source: "Nh\xECn m\u1EB7t Cursermancer c\u1EE7a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1, r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m
      \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
    english: "Look at number 1\u2019s Cursermancer face, then click GOT IT \xB7 CONTINUE."
    vietnamese: "Nh\xECn m\u1EB7t Cursermancer c\u1EE7a l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1, r\u1ED3i
      b\u1EA5m \u0110\xC3 HI\u1EC2U \xB7 TI\u1EBEP T\u1EE4C."
  - key: guided.11.title
    source: "\u0110\u01B0a l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n l\u1EA1i g\u1EA7n"
    english: Bring the curse closer
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u01B0a l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n l\u1EA1i g\u1EA7n"
  - key: guided.11.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF vi\u1EC1n
      xanh."
    english: LEFT-DRAG number 1 into the green seat.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 v\xE0o gh\u1EBF vi\u1EC1n
      xanh."
  - key: guided.12.title
    source: "C\u01A1 h\u1ED9i c\u1EE7a Hunter"
    english: "Hunter\u2019s chance"
    vietnamese: "C\u01A1 h\u1ED9i c\u1EE7a Hunter"
  - key: guided.12.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i
      ph\xEDa D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
    english: Click END TURN to return to the Villager side.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i
      ph\xEDa D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
  - key: guided.13.instruction
    source: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I \u1EDF l\xE1 s\u1ED1 9, k\xE9o m\u0169i
      ng\u1EAFm t\u1EDBi l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: Hold RIGHT MOUSE on number 9, drag the aim to number 1, then release.
    vietnamese: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T PH\u1EA2I \u1EDF l\xE1 s\u1ED1 9, k\xE9o m\u0169i
      ng\u1EAFm t\u1EDBi l\xE1 s\u1ED1 1 r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: guided.14.title
    source: "D\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi r\u1EDDi b\xE0n"
    english: The trace of a fallen card
    vietnamese: "D\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi r\u1EDDi b\xE0n"
  - key: guided.14.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m NGH\u0128A TRANG \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm l\xE1 v\u1EEBa b\u1ECB
      lo\u1EA1i."
    english: Click CEMETERY to find the card that was just removed.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m NGH\u0128A TRANG \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm l\xE1 v\u1EEBa b\u1ECB
      lo\u1EA1i."
  - key: guided.15.title
    source: "Tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng"
    english: Back to those still standing
    vietnamese: "Tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng"
  - key: guided.15.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m NGH\u0128A TRANG l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i
      b\xE0n ch\u01A1i."
    english: Click CEMETERY again to return to the board.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m NGH\u0128A TRANG l\u1EA7n n\u1EEFa \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF
      l\u1EA1i b\xE0n ch\u01A1i."
  - key: guided.16.title
    source: "Khi l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n th\u1EE9c gi\u1EA5c"
    english: When the curse awakens
    vietnamese: "Khi l\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n th\u1EE9c gi\u1EA5c"
  - key: guided.16.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m TH\u1EEC NGHI TH\u1EE8C \u0111\u1EC3 b\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0o
      m\u1ED9t t\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EAFp s\u1EB5n."
    english: Click TRY THE RITUAL to enter a prepared practice situation.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m TH\u1EEC NGHI TH\u1EE8C \u0111\u1EC3 b\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0o
      m\u1ED9t t\xECnh hu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EAFp s\u1EB5n."
  - key: guided.17.instruction
    source: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I \u1EDF l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11, k\xE9o t\u1EDBi
      l\xE1 s\u1ED1 9 vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
    english: Hold LEFT MOUSE on number 11, drag to the green number 9, then release.
    vietnamese: "GI\u1EEE CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I \u1EDF l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11, k\xE9o t\u1EDBi
      l\xE1 s\u1ED1 9 vi\u1EC1n xanh r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3."
  - key: guided.18.title
    source: "\u0110\u1EC3 ng\xF4i l\xE0ng c\u1EA5t ti\u1EBFng"
    english: Let the village speak
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EC3 ng\xF4i l\xE0ng c\u1EA5t ti\u1EBFng"
  - key: guided.18.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0111\u1EC3 kh\xE9p pha Nguy\u1EC1n
      r\u1EE7a v\xE0 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
    english: Click END TURN to finish Infection and begin voting.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0111\u1EC3 kh\xE9p pha
      Nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a v\xE0 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: guided.19.title
    source: "Ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn"
    english: The first voice
    vietnamese: "Ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn"
  - key: guided.19.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 t\u1EDBi l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      2 vi\u1EC1n xanh \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
    english: LEFT-DRAG from number 10 to the green number 2 to cast a vote.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 s\u1ED1 10 t\u1EDBi l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 2 vi\u1EC1n xanh \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: guided.20.title
    source: "Hunter c\u0169ng c\xF3 m\u1ED9t l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu"
    english: Hunter has a vote too
    vietnamese: "Hunter c\u0169ng c\xF3 m\u1ED9t l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu"
  - key: guided.20.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB Hunter s\u1ED1 9 t\u1EDBi l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      2 vi\u1EC1n xanh."
    english: LEFT-DRAG from Hunter number 9 to the green number 2.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB Hunter s\u1ED1 9 t\u1EDBi l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 2 vi\u1EC1n xanh."
  - key: guided.21.title
    source: "K\u1EBB gi\u1EEF b\xED m\u1EADt c\u0169ng l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng"
    english: Even a secret keeper votes
    vietnamese: "K\u1EBB gi\u1EEF b\xED m\u1EADt c\u0169ng l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng"
  - key: guided.21.instruction
    source: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 t\u1EDBi l\xE1 s\u1ED1
      2 vi\u1EC1n xanh."
    english: LEFT-DRAG from number 11 to the green number 2.
    vietnamese: "K\xE9o CHU\u1ED8T TR\xC1I t\u1EEB l\xE1 s\u1ED1 11 t\u1EDBi l\xE1
      s\u1ED1 2 vi\u1EC1n xanh."
  - key: guided.22.title
    source: "\u0110\u1EEBng b\u1ECF qu\xEAn m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i"
    english: Leave no voice behind
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1EEBng b\u1ECF qu\xEAn m\u1ED9t ti\u1EBFng n\xF3i"
  - key: guided.22.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ED1t c\xE1c
      phi\u1EBFu v\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EB7t."
    english: Click END TURN to confirm the votes you just cast.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m K\u1EBET TH\xDAC L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ED1t
      c\xE1c phi\u1EBFu v\u1EEBa \u0111\u1EB7t."
  - key: guided.23.title
    source: "Nghe ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia"
    english: Hear the other side
    vietnamese: "Nghe ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia"
  - key: guided.23.instruction
    source: "B\u1EA5m XEM L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0110\u1ED0I PH\u01AF\u01A0NG \u0111\u1EC3
      theo d\xF5i phi\u1EBFu t\u1EEB ph\xEDa Cursermancer."
    english: "Click WATCH OPPONENT TURN to see the Cursermancer side\u2019s vote."
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m XEM L\u01AF\u1EE2T \u0110\u1ED0I PH\u01AF\u01A0NG \u0111\u1EC3
      theo d\xF5i phi\u1EBFu t\u1EEB ph\xEDa Cursermancer."
  - key: guided.24.instruction
    source: "Quan s\xE1t t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt. Nghi th\u1EE9c s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1EBFm
      phi\u1EBFu r\u1ED3i \u0111\u01B0a c\xE1c l\xE1 s\u1ED1ng v\u1EC1 tay."
    english: Watch the tally. The ritual counts the votes, then returns surviving
      cards to hand.
    vietnamese: "Quan s\xE1t t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt. Nghi th\u1EE9c s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1EBFm
      phi\u1EBFu r\u1ED3i \u0111\u01B0a c\xE1c l\xE1 s\u1ED1ng v\u1EC1 tay."
  - key: guided.25.title
    source: "D\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh ch\u01B0a \u0111i m\u1EA5t"
    english: The sickness is still here
    vietnamese: "D\u1EA5u b\u1EC7nh ch\u01B0a \u0111i m\u1EA5t"
  - key: guided.25.instruction
    source: "B\xE0i t\u1EADp tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa D\xE2n l\xE0ng. B\u1EA5m THANH
      TR\u1EEANG \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
    english: The exercise returns to Villagers. Click the highlighted PURGE button.
    vietnamese: "B\xE0i t\u1EADp tr\u1EDF v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa D\xE2n l\xE0ng. B\u1EA5m
      THANH TR\u1EEANG \u1EDF n\xFAt \u0111ang s\xE1ng."
  - key: action.feedback.00
    source: '{0}: this action needs {1} hearts; you have {2}. Choose a cheaper action
      or end your turn.'
    english: '{0}: this action needs {1} hearts; you have {2}. Choose a cheaper action
      or end your turn.'
    vietnamese: "{0}: thao t\xE1c n\xE0y c\u1EA7n {1} tim, b\u1EA1n c\xF2n {2} tim.
      H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn vi\u1EC7c \xEDt t\u1ED1n tim h\u01A1n ho\u1EB7c k\u1EBFt th\xFAc
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t."
  - key: action.feedback.01
    source: The match has ended. Choose Rematch or Menu.
    english: The match has ended. Choose Rematch or Menu.
    vietnamese: "V\xE1n ch\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 k\u1EBFt th\xFAc. Ch\u1ECDn Ch\u01A1i
      ti\u1EBFp ho\u1EB7c Menu nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.02
    source: Votes are being resolved. Wait for the next turn.
    english: Votes are being resolved. Wait for the next turn.
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu \u0111ang \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt. Ch\u1EDD
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t ti\u1EBFp theo nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.03
    source: It is your opponent's turn. Wait for your turn before playing or moving
      cards.
    english: It is your opponent's turn. Wait for your turn before playing or moving
      cards.
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang l\xE0 l\u01B0\u1EE3t \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng. Ch\u1EDD
      t\u1EDBi l\u01B0\u1EE3t m\xECnh \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t ho\u1EB7c di chuy\u1EC3n
      b\xE0i nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.04
    source: Cards in the cemetery cannot be moved. Use a resurrection skill to bring
      them back.
    english: Cards in the cemetery cannot be moved. Use a resurrection skill to bring
      them back.
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 k\xE9o b\xE0i \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt ra kh\u1ECFi
      ngh\u0129a trang. C\u1EA7n k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng h\u1ED3i sinh \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0a
      ch\xFAng tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i."
  - key: action.feedback.05
    source: '{0} is held by Elder. Move it outside Elder''s influence with a card
      effect, or remove Elder first.'
    english: '{0} is held by Elder. Move it outside Elder''s influence with a card
      effect, or remove Elder first.'
    vietnamese: "{0} \u0111ang b\u1ECB Elder gi\u1EEF. H\xE3y d\xF9ng hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng
      b\xE0i \u0111\u1EA9y n\xF3 ra kh\u1ECFi v\xF9ng c\u1EE7a Elder, ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u01B0a
      Elder \u0111i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - key: action.feedback.06
    source: '{0} cannot be moved by hand while its extra seats are occupied. Empty
      those seats first; card effects can still push it.'
    english: '{0} cannot be moved by hand while its extra seats are occupied. Empty
      those seats first; card effects can still push it.'
    vietnamese: "Gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5 c\u1EE7a {0} \u0111ang c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi n\xEAn
      kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 k\xE9o b\u1EB1ng tay. D\u1ECDn tr\u1ED1ng gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\xE9; hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng b\xE0i v\u1EABn c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EA9y
      n\xF3."
  - key: action.feedback.07
    source: '{0} is resting after being played. You can move or retrieve it on your
      next action turn.'
    english: '{0} is resting after being played. You can move or retrieve it on your
      next action turn.'
    vietnamese: "{0} v\u1EEBa \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7t xu\u1ED1ng n\xEAn
      ch\u01B0a th\u1EC3 k\xE9o \u0111i hay thu h\u1ED3i. \u0110\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng ti\u1EBFp theo c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, n\xF3 s\u1EBD s\u1EB5n
      s\xE0ng."
  - key: action.feedback.08
    source: Choose the secret roles and start the match before moving cards.
    english: Choose the secret roles and start the match before moving cards.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn xong vai tr\xF2 b\xED m\u1EADt v\xE0 b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u
      v\xE1n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi di chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i."
  - key: action.feedback.09
    source: Cards cannot move during the curse ritual. Drag from a seated Cursermancer
      to spread the curse, or continue to Sacrifice.
    english: Cards cannot move during the curse ritual. Drag from a seated Cursermancer
      to spread the curse, or continue to Sacrifice.
    vietnamese: "Nghi th\u1EE9c Nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a kh\xF4ng cho di chuy\u1EC3n
      b\xE0i. K\xE9o t\u1EEB Cursermancer tr\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u1EC3 l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m,
      ho\u1EB7c chuy\u1EC3n sang Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF."
  - key: action.feedback.10
    source: Cards cannot move during Sacrifice. Drag from each of your seated cards
      to another living card to vote.
    english: Cards cannot move during Sacrifice. Drag from each of your seated cards
      to another living card to vote.
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 di chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i trong Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF.
      K\xE9o t\u1EEB t\u1EEBng l\xE1 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\xEAn b\xE0n t\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t
      l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng kh\xE1c \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: action.feedback.11
    source: Close the enlarged card with right-click before moving cards.
    english: Close the enlarged card with right-click before moving cards.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\xF3ng l\xE1 \u0111ang
      ph\xF3ng to r\u1ED3i h\xE3y di chuy\u1EC3n b\xE0i nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.12
    source: This card is face down. Its information and actions are unavailable.
    english: This card is face down. Its information and actions are unavailable.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 n\xE0y \u0111ang \xFAp n\xEAn ch\u01B0a th\u1EC3 xem th\xF4ng
      tin hay th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n thao t\xE1c."
  - key: action.feedback.13
    source: Play this card onto a seat before using its skill. Right-click without
      dragging to read it.
    english: Play this card onto a seat before using its skill. Right-click without
      dragging to read it.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 n\xE0y c\u1EA7n ng\u1ED3i tr\xEAn gh\u1EBF m\u1EDBi d\xF9ng
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng. B\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i, kh\xF4ng
      k\xE9o, \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc m\xF4 t\u1EA3 nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.14
    source: This card has no active skill. Its passive effect works automatically
      when its conditions are met.
    english: This card has no active skill. Its passive effect works automatically
      when its conditions are met.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 n\xE0y kh\xF4ng c\xF3 k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng c\u1EA7n b\u1EA5m
      \u0111\u1EC3 d\xF9ng. Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng b\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED9ng s\u1EBD t\u1EF1
      k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t khi \u0111\u1EE7 \u0111i\u1EC1u ki\u1EC7n."
  - key: action.feedback.15
    source: Start the curse arrow from one of your seated Cursermancers.
    english: Start the curse arrow from one of your seated Cursermancers.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u m\u0169i t\xEAn l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m
      t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t Cursermancer c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111ang ng\u1ED3i tr\xEAn
      b\xE0n."
  - key: action.feedback.16
    source: Only your living cards on the board can cast your votes. Drag from one
      of them to another living card.
    english: Only your living cards on the board can cast your votes. Drag from one
      of them to another living card.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EC9 b\xE0i c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n tr\xEAn b\xE0n
      m\u1EDBi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu. K\xE9o t\u1EEB m\u1ED9t l\xE1
      \u0111\xF3 t\u1EDBi m\u1ED9t l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng kh\xE1c nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.17
    source: GameMaster cannot occupy an extra seat. Choose one of the seven main
      seats.
    english: GameMaster cannot occupy an extra seat. Choose one of the seven main
      seats.
    vietnamese: "GameMaster kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 ng\u1ED3i gh\u1EBF ph\u1EE5. H\xE3y
      ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t trong b\u1EA3y gh\u1EBF ch\xEDnh nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.18
    source: '{0} is resting and cannot be swapped yet. Wait until its next action
      turn.'
    english: '{0} is resting and cannot be swapped yet. Wait until its next action
      turn.'
    vietnamese: "{0} \u0111ang ngh\u1EC9 n\xEAn ch\u01B0a th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED5i
      ch\u1ED7. Ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EBFn l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng ti\u1EBFp
      theo c\u1EE7a phe l\xE1 b\xE0i n\xE0y nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.19
    source: These two cards have already swapped this turn. Choose a different pair
      or wait for the next turn.
    english: These two cards have already swapped this turn. Choose a different pair
      or wait for the next turn.
    vietnamese: "Hai l\xE1 n\xE0y \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1ED5i ch\u1ED7 v\u1EDBi nhau
      trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t n\xE0y r\u1ED3i. Ch\u1ECDn c\u1EB7p kh\xE1c ho\u1EB7c
      ch\u1EDD sang l\u01B0\u1EE3t ti\u1EBFp theo nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.20
    source: This card is no longer available. Choose another card.
    english: This card is no longer available. Choose another card.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 n\xE0y kh\xF4ng c\xF2n d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u1EDF
      v\u1ECB tr\xED hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i. H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn l\xE1 kh\xE1c nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.21
    source: '{0}''s printed skill is blocked by Saboteur. Move it out of Saboteur''s
      influence first.'
    english: '{0}''s printed skill is blocked by Saboteur. Move it out of Saboteur''s
      influence first.'
    vietnamese: "K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a {0} \u0111ang b\u1ECB Saboteur
      kh\xF3a. H\xE3y \u0111\u01B0a n\xF3 ra kh\u1ECFi v\xF9ng \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng
      c\u1EE7a Saboteur tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
  - key: action.feedback.22
    source: Choose a living target on the board, not a card in a hand or the cemetery.
    english: Choose a living target on the board, not a card in a hand or the cemetery.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng tr\xEAn b\xE0n.
      B\xE0i tr\xEAn tay v\xE0 trong ngh\u0129a trang kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i m\u1EE5c
      ti\xEAu h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7."
  - key: action.feedback.23
    source: '{0}: left-click the card itself to use this skill; do not drag onto
      another card.'
    english: '{0}: left-click the card itself to use this skill; do not drag onto
      another card.'
    vietnamese: "{0}: b\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i ngay tr\xEAn l\xE1 n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3
      d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, kh\xF4ng k\xE9o sang l\xE1 kh\xE1c nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.24
    source: '{0}: hold the right mouse button on this card, drag the arrow to a living
      target, then release.'
    english: '{0}: hold the right mouse button on this card, drag the arrow to a
      living target, then release.'
    vietnamese: "{0}: gi\u1EEF chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i tr\xEAn l\xE1 n\xE0y, k\xE9o
      m\u0169i t\xEAn t\u1EDBi m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng r\u1ED3i th\u1EA3
      \u0111\u1EC3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.25
    source: Hunter can shoot only during the Villagers' action turn.
    english: Hunter can shoot only during the Villagers' action turn.
    vietnamese: "Hunter ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c n\u1ED5 s\xFAng trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a phe D\xE2n l\xE0ng."
  - key: action.feedback.26
    source: Hunter cannot shoot itself. Choose another living card on the board.
    english: Hunter cannot shoot itself. Choose another living card on the board.
    vietnamese: "Hunter kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 b\u1EAFn m\xECnh. H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn
      m\u1ED9t l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng kh\xE1c tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
  - key: action.feedback.27
    source: Witch can act during an action turn or your Sacrifice voting turn, not
      the curse ritual.
    english: Witch can act during an action turn or your Sacrifice voting turn, not
      the curse ritual.
    vietnamese: "Witch ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng ho\u1EB7c l\u01B0\u1EE3t b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n, kh\xF4ng d\xF9ng trong Nguy\u1EC1n r\u1EE7a."
  - key: action.feedback.28
    source: Invoker can summon only during Sacrifice, when its last player is voting.
    english: Invoker can summon only during Sacrifice, when its last player is voting.
    vietnamese: "Invoker ch\u1EC9 g\u1ECDi h\u1ED3n trong Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, v\xE0o
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EB7t
      n\xF3 g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t."
  - key: action.feedback.29
    source: Only the player who last placed Invoker can summon with it during their
      voting turn.
    english: Only the player who last placed Invoker can summon with it during their
      voting turn.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EC9 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EB7t Invoker g\u1EA7n
      nh\u1EA5t m\u1EDBi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1ECDi h\u1ED3n b\u1EB1ng n\xF3, trong
      l\u01B0\u1EE3t b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a m\xECnh."
  - key: action.feedback.30
    source: Invoker must sit next to the cemetery to summon. Move it there during
      an action turn.
    english: Invoker must sit next to the cemetery to summon. Move it there during
      an action turn.
    vietnamese: "Invoker ph\u1EA3i ng\u1ED3i s\xE1t ngh\u0129a trang m\u1EDBi g\u1ECDi
      h\u1ED3n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c. H\xE3y \u0111\u01B0a n\xF3 t\u1EDBi \u0111\xF3
      trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.31
    source: The cemetery is empty. Invoker needs a dead card to summon.
    english: The cemetery is empty. Invoker needs a dead card to summon.
    vietnamese: "Ngh\u0129a trang ch\u01B0a c\xF3 ai. Invoker c\u1EA7n m\u1ED9t l\xE1
      \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt m\u1EDBi c\xF3 th\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi h\u1ED3n."
  - key: action.feedback.32
    source: Gambler accepts bets only during your Sacrifice voting turn.
    english: Gambler accepts bets only during your Sacrifice voting turn.
    vietnamese: "Gambler ch\u1EC9 nh\u1EADn \u0111\u1EB7t c\u01B0\u1EE3c trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
  - key: action.feedback.33
    source: Snooper normally acts automatically at the vote tally. If its active
      effect is available, Cursermancer selects a target during Sacrifice.
    english: Snooper normally acts automatically at the vote tally. If its active
      effect is available, Cursermancer selects a target during Sacrifice.
    vietnamese: "Snooper th\u01B0\u1EDDng t\u1EF1 k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t khi t\u1ED5ng
      k\u1EBFt phi\u1EBFu. N\u1EBFu c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng ch\u1EE7
      \u0111\u1ED9ng, Cursermancer ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu trong Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF."
  - key: action.feedback.34
    source: '{0} has already used its skill this round. It becomes ready after the
      Sacrifice ritual ends.'
    english: '{0} has already used its skill this round. It becomes ready after the
      Sacrifice ritual ends.'
    vietnamese: "{0} \u0111\xE3 d\xF9ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng trong v\xF2ng n\xE0y r\u1ED3i.
      K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng s\u1EBD s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng l\u1EA1i sau khi nghi th\u1EE9c
      Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF k\u1EBFt th\xFAc."
  - key: action.feedback.35
    source: This skill cannot use that target now. Check its description for the
      required phase and target.
    english: This skill cannot use that target now. Check its description for the
      required phase and target.
    vietnamese: "K\u1EF9 n\u0103ng ch\u01B0a d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c v\u1EDBi
      m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu n\xE0y. B\u1EA5m chu\u1ED9t ph\u1EA3i xem m\xF4 t\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC3
      ki\u1EC3m tra giai \u0111o\u1EA1n v\xE0 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\u1EA7n ch\u1ECDn
      nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.36
    source: Your turn change is being confirmed. Wait a moment before the next action.
    english: Your turn change is being confirmed. Wait a moment before the next action.
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang x\xE1c nh\u1EADn chuy\u1EC3n l\u01B0\u1EE3t. Ch\u1EDD
      m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt r\u1ED3i thao t\xE1c ti\u1EBFp nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.37
    source: Drop the card onto a seat, or into the hand area to retrieve a seated
      card.
    english: Drop the card onto a seat, or into the hand area to retrieve a seated
      card.
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EA3 b\xE0i l\xEAn gh\u1EBF \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t xu\u1ED1ng,
      ho\u1EB7c v\xE0o khay tay b\xE0i \u0111\u1EC3 thu h\u1ED3i m\u1ED9t l\xE1 \u0111ang
      ng\u1ED3i tr\xEAn b\xE0n."
  - key: action.feedback.38
    source: The board is still synchronizing. Wait for the cards to finish loading.
    english: The board is still synchronizing. Wait for the cards to finish loading.
    vietnamese: "B\xE0n ch\u01A1i \u0111ang \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9. Ch\u1EDD c\xE1c
      l\xE1 b\xE0i t\u1EA3i xong r\u1ED3i thao t\xE1c nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.39
    source: Choose a seated card to retrieve.
    english: Choose a seated card to retrieve.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t l\xE1 \u0111ang ng\u1ED3i tr\xEAn b\xE0n
      \u0111\u1EC3 thu h\u1ED3i."
  - key: action.feedback.40
    source: Choose a valid seat on the board.
    english: Choose a valid seat on the board.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t gh\u1EBF \u0111ang c\xF3 tr\xEAn b\xE0n
      ch\u01A1i nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.41
    source: The curse must follow a valid row or column from your Cursermancer. Empty
      seats break the path; choose a highlighted target.
    english: The curse must follow a valid row or column from your Cursermancer.
      Empty seats break the path; choose a highlighted target.
    vietnamese: "L\u1EDDi nguy\u1EC1n \u0111i theo h\xE0ng ho\u1EB7c c\u1ED9t t\u1EEB
      Cursermancer, nh\u01B0ng gh\u1EBF tr\u1ED1ng s\u1EBD ch\u1EB7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng.
      H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111ang \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EC9
      s\xE1ng."
  - key: action.feedback.42
    source: Choose a living card, not an empty seat.
    english: Choose a living card, not an empty seat.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t l\xE1 c\xF2n s\u1ED1ng thay v\xEC gh\u1EBF
      tr\u1ED1ng nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.43
    source: Preacher's shield blocks the curse on this target. Choose an unprotected
      card.
    english: Preacher's shield blocks the curse on this target. Choose an unprotected
      card.
    vietnamese: "Khi\xEAn c\u1EE7a Preacher ch\u1EB7n l\xE2y nhi\u1EC5m v\xE0o m\u1EE5c
      ti\xEAu n\xE0y. H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t l\xE1 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7."
  - key: action.feedback.44
    source: Purge is available only during an action turn. Finish the ritual first.
    english: Purge is available only during an action turn. Finish the ritual first.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EC9 d\xF9ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c Thanh tr\u1EEBng trong l\u01B0\u1EE3t
      h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng. H\xE3y ho\xE0n t\u1EA5t nghi th\u1EE9c tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.45
    source: You have used both Purges for this match. No Purges remain.
    english: You have used both Purges for this match. No Purges remain.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 d\xF9ng h\u1EBFt hai l\u1EA7n Thanh tr\u1EEBng
      c\u1EE7a v\xE1n n\xE0y r\u1ED3i."
  - key: action.feedback.46
    source: Try the highlighted action first. The current instruction tells you which
      card and mouse button to use.
    english: Try the highlighted action first. The current instruction tells you
      which card and mouse button to use.
    vietnamese: "Th\u1EED thao t\xE1c \u0111ang \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EC9 s\xE1ng
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\xE9. L\u1EDDi h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i
      s\u1EBD ch\u1EC9 b\u1EA1n c\u1EA7n ch\u1ECDn l\xE1 n\xE0o v\xE0 d\xF9ng n\xFAt
      chu\u1ED9t n\xE0o."
  - key: action.feedback.47
    source: Preacher blocked Hunter's shot. The shot still spent its hearts and can
      be used again after Sacrifice.
    english: Preacher blocked Hunter's shot. The shot still spent its hearts and
      can be used again after Sacrifice.
    vietnamese: "Preacher \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EB7n ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn c\u1EE7a Hunter.
      Ph\xE1t b\u1EAFn v\u1EABn t\u1ED1n tim; Hunter s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      b\u1EAFn l\u1EA1i sau khi Hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF k\u1EBFt th\xFAc."
  - key: action.feedback.48
    source: Your opponent disconnected. Use Menu to leave, or wait for the connection
      to recover.
    english: Your opponent disconnected. Use Menu to leave, or wait for the connection
      to recover.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i.
      B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1EA5m Menu \u0111\u1EC3 r\u1EDDi v\xE1n, ho\u1EB7c
      ch\u1EDD k\u1EBFt n\u1ED1i tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i."
  - key: action.feedback.49
    source: Finish choosing the required Cursermancers in each card group before
      starting the match.
    english: Finish choosing the required Cursermancers in each card group before
      starting the match.
    vietnamese: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EE7 Cursermancer theo y\xEAu c\u1EA7u
      c\u1EE7a t\u1EEBng nh\xF3m b\xE0i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u
      v\xE1n nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.50
    source: Wait for the other player's Neutral pick before choosing your next card.
    english: Wait for the other player's Neutral pick before choosing your next card.
    vietnamese: "\u0110ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\u1ECDn b\xE0i
      Neutral. Xong l\u01B0\u1EE3t c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD, b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      ch\u1ECDn ti\u1EBFp nh\xE9."
  - key: action.feedback.51
    source: Your chosen card is being added. Wait for the next pair before choosing
      again.
    english: Your chosen card is being added. Wait for the next pair before choosing
      again.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 b\u1EA1n ch\u1ECDn \u0111ang \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u01B0a
      v\xE0o b\u1ED9 b\xE0i. Ch\u1EDD c\u1EB7p b\xE0i ti\u1EBFp theo xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n
      r\u1ED3i ch\u1ECDn ti\u1EBFp nh\xE9."
  - key: votes.presentation.00
    source: Players' ballots
    english: Players' ballots
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i"
  - key: votes.presentation.01
    source: These are the players' original ballots. Neutral effects are applied
      next.
    english: These are the players' original ballots. Neutral effects are applied
      next.
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 phi\u1EBFu g\u1ED1c do ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i
      b\u1ECF. Ti\u1EBFp theo, c\xE1c l\xE1 Neutral s\u1EBD t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng
      l\xEAn k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 n\xE0y."
  - key: votes.presentation.02
    source: 'Trader divides the highest count ({0}) among {1} occupied seats: {2}
      votes each. Remainder discarded.'
    english: 'Trader divides the highest count ({0}) among {1} occupied seats: {2}
      votes each. Remainder discarded.'
    vietnamese: "Trader l\u1EA5y s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu cao nh\u1EA5t ({0}), chia cho
      {1} gh\u1EBF c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi: m\u1ED7i l\xE1 c\xF2n {2} phi\u1EBFu. L\xE0m
      tr\xF2n xu\u1ED1ng, b\u1ECF ph\u1EA7n d\u01B0."
  - key: votes.presentation.03
    source: Jester scatters extra votes at random. Only the cards shown in this step
      receive them.
    english: Jester scatters extra votes at random. Only the cards shown in this
      step receive them.
    vietnamese: "Jester tung th\xEAm phi\u1EBFu ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn. Nh\u1EEFng l\xE1
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c li\u1EC7t k\xEA \u1EDF b\u01B0\u1EDBc n\xE0y nh\u1EADn
      th\xEAm phi\u1EBFu; c\xE1c l\xE1 kh\xE1c gi\u1EEF nguy\xEAn."
  - key: votes.presentation.04
    source: Snooper adds one vote to its indicated target. If no valid target is
      available, no vote is added.
    english: Snooper adds one vote to its indicated target. If no valid target is
      available, no vote is added.
    vietnamese: "Snooper c\u1ED9ng m\u1ED9t phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o l\xE1 b\u1ECB ch\u1EC9
      \u0111i\u1EC3m. N\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng c\xF3 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7,
      l\u1EA7n n\xE0y kh\xF4ng c\u1ED9ng phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: votes.presentation.05
    source: 'The first bettor wins: no counter-bet was placed. Add 1 vote to the
      chosen target.'
    english: 'The first bettor wins: no counter-bet was placed. Add 1 vote to the
      chosen target.'
    vietnamese: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu tr\u01B0\u1EDBc th\u1EAFng c\u01B0\u1EE3c
      v\xEC ng\u01B0\u1EDDi sau kh\xF4ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c. M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\xE3
      ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1ED9ng 1 phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: votes.presentation.06
    source: The second bettor wins because both players bet. Add 1 vote to the chosen
      target.
    english: The second bettor wins because both players bet. Add 1 vote to the chosen
      target.
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA3 hai c\xF9ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECF
      phi\u1EBFu sau th\u1EAFng c\u01B0\u1EE3c. M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn
      \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1ED9ng 1 phi\u1EBFu."
  - key: votes.presentation.07
    source: The first bettor loses because both players bet. Remove 1 vote from that
      player's recorded ballot target, if possible.
    english: The first bettor loses because both players bet. Remove 1 vote from
      that player's recorded ballot target, if possible.
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA3 hai c\xF9ng c\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECF
      phi\u1EBFu tr\u01B0\u1EDBc thua c\u01B0\u1EE3c. B\u1EDBt 1 phi\u1EBFu \u1EDF
      m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF3,
      n\u1EBFu c\xF2n phi\u1EBFu \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EDBt."
  - key: votes.presentation.08
    source: 'The second bettor loses: only the second player bet. Remove 1 vote from
      that player''s recorded ballot target, if possible.'
    english: 'The second bettor loses: only the second player bet. Remove 1 vote
      from that player''s recorded ballot target, if possible.'
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1EC9 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu sau c\u01B0\u1EE3c n\xEAn
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF3 thua c\u01B0\u1EE3c. B\u1EDBt 1 phi\u1EBFu \u1EDF
      m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu l\xE1 phi\u1EBFu g\u1ED1c c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD, n\u1EBFu c\xF2n
      phi\u1EBFu \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EDBt."
  - key: votes.presentation.09
    source: Sacrifier takes the sacrifice itself. The displayed votes stay unchanged;
      they no longer choose the victim.
    english: Sacrifier takes the sacrifice itself. The displayed votes stay unchanged;
      they no longer choose the victim.
    vietnamese: "Sacrifier nh\u1EADn hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF thay m\u1ECDi l\xE1 kh\xE1c.
      S\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF \u0111\u1EC3 b\u1EA1n
      xem, nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng c\xF2n quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh ai ch\u1EBFt."
  - key: votes.presentation.10
    source: 'Controller changes the verdict: cards with the lowest positive vote
      count are sacrificed, instead of the highest count.'
    english: 'Controller changes the verdict: cards with the lowest positive vote
      count are sacrificed, instead of the highest count.'
    vietnamese: "Controller \u0111\u1ED5i lu\u1EADt ph\xE1n quy\u1EBFt: l\xE1 c\xF3
      s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu th\u1EA5p nh\u1EA5t nh\u01B0ng l\u1EDBn h\u01A1n 0 b\u1ECB
      hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF, thay cho l\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u phi\u1EBFu nh\u1EA5t."
  - key: votes.presentation.11
    source: Detective adds 1 suspicion here. Suspicion guides its later comparisons;
      it is not an extra vote.
    english: Detective adds 1 suspicion here. Suspicion guides its later comparisons;
      it is not an extra vote.
    vietnamese: "Detective \u0111\u1EB7t th\xEAm 1 \u0111i\u1EC3m nghi v\u1EA5n l\xEAn
      l\xE1 n\xE0y. \u0110i\u1EC3m \u0111\xF3 d\xF9ng cho nh\u1EEFng l\u1EA7n so
      s\xE1nh sau c\u1EE7a Detective, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i phi\u1EBFu b\u1EA7u."
  - key: votes.presentation.12
    source: Your wager is selected. The other player's wager remains hidden until
      the tally.
    english: Your wager is selected. The other player's wager remains hidden until
      the tally.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\u01B0\u1EE3c. L\u1EF1a
      ch\u1ECDn c\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EE7a \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      gi\u1EEF k\xEDn t\u1EDBi l\xFAc t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt."
  - key: votes.presentation.13
    source: Your Snooper target is selected. This selection stays private until the
      tally.
    english: Your Snooper target is selected. This selection stays private until
      the tally.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu cho Snooper. L\u1EF1a
      ch\u1ECDn n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF ri\xEAng cho b\u1EA1n t\u1EDBi
      l\xFAc t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt."
  - key: votes.presentation.14
    source: This card just activated its skill.
    english: This card just activated its skill.
    vietnamese: "L\xE1 n\xE0y v\u1EEBa k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
  - key: votes.presentation.15
    source: votes
    english: votes
    vietnamese: "phi\u1EBFu"
  - key: votes.presentation.16
    source: suspicion
    english: suspicion
    vietnamese: "nghi v\u1EA5n"
  - key: votes.presentation.17
    source: No vote count changed in this step.
    english: No vote count changed in this step.
    vietnamese: "Kh\xF4ng l\xE1 n\xE0o \u0111\u1ED5i s\u1ED1 phi\u1EBFu \u1EDF b\u01B0\u1EDBc
      n\xE0y."
  - key: votes.presentation.18
    source: Chosen for sacrifice
    english: Chosen for sacrifice
    vietnamese: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ECDn hi\u1EBFn t\u1EBF"
  - key: votes.presentation.19
    source: VOTE RESOLUTION
    english: VOTE RESOLUTION
    vietnamese: "DI\u1EC4N BI\u1EBEN PHI\u1EBEU"
  - key: votes.presentation.20
    source: CARD EFFECT DETAILS
    english: CARD EFFECT DETAILS
    vietnamese: "CHI TI\u1EBET HI\u1EC6U \u1EE8NG B\xC0I"
  - key: votes.presentation.21
    source: Suspicion is not a vote. Detective uses it when comparing neighbours;
      it does not directly increase this card's ballots.
    english: Suspicion is not a vote. Detective uses it when comparing neighbours;
      it does not directly increase this card's ballots.
    vietnamese: "Nghi v\u1EA5n kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i phi\u1EBFu b\u1EA7u. Detective
      d\xF9ng \u0111i\u1EC3m n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3 so s\xE1nh hai l\xE1 b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh,
      kh\xF4ng tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp c\u1ED9ng phi\u1EBFu v\xE0o l\xE1 n\xE0y."
  - key: votes.presentation.22
    source: Only your wager is shown before the tally. Counter-bets are resolved
      together when both players finish voting.
    english: Only your wager is shown before the tally. Counter-bets are resolved
      together when both players finish voting.
    vietnamese: "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt, b\u1EA1n ch\u1EC9 th\u1EA5y
      c\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EE7a m\xECnh. C\u01B0\u1EE3c hai b\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      x\u1EED l\xFD c\xF9ng nhau sau khi c\u1EA3 hai b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu xong."
  - key: votes.presentation.23
    source: Selections stay private before the tally. Snooper's actual vote target
      is public when its effect resolves.
    english: Selections stay private before the tally. Snooper's actual vote target
      is public when its effect resolves.
    vietnamese: "L\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EEF k\xEDn tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt. L\xE1 th\u1EF1c s\u1EF1 nh\u1EADn phi\u1EBFu t\u1EEB Snooper
      s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xF4ng khai khi k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      x\u1EED l\xFD."
  - key: votes.presentation.24
    source: During voting, only your own ballots are visible. Both sides and Neutral
      effects are revealed at the tally.
    english: During voting, only your own ballots are visible. Both sides and Neutral
      effects are revealed at the tally.
    vietnamese: "Khi \u0111ang b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu, b\u1EA1n ch\u1EC9 th\u1EA5y phi\u1EBFu
      c\u1EE7a m\xECnh. Phi\u1EBFu hai b\xEAn v\xE0 t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a
      Neutral \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c c\xF4ng khai l\xFAc t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt."
  - key: votes.presentation.25
    source: "Original ballots \u2192 Neutral effects \u2192 Verdict. Click a vote
      badge to inspect that card."
    english: "Original ballots \u2192 Neutral effects \u2192 Verdict. Click a vote
      badge to inspect that card."
    vietnamese: "Phi\u1EBFu g\u1ED1c \u2192 T\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a Neutral
      \u2192 Ph\xE1n quy\u1EBFt. B\u1EA5m huy hi\u1EC7u phi\u1EBFu \u0111\u1EC3 xem
      ri\xEAng t\u1EEBng l\xE1."
  - key: votes.presentation.26
    source: No public vote changes yet. Cast your votes; the tally will explain every
      Neutral effect here.
    english: No public vote changes yet. Cast your votes; the tally will explain
      every Neutral effect here.
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 thay \u0111\u1ED5i phi\u1EBFu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      c\xF4ng khai. C\u1EE9 b\u1ECF phi\u1EBFu nh\xE9; khi t\u1ED5ng k\u1EBFt, t\u1EEBng
      t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u1EE7a Neutral s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EA3i
      th\xEDch \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y."
  - key: votes.presentation.27
    source: Vote details
    english: Vote details
    vietnamese: "Chi ti\u1EBFt phi\u1EBFu"
  - key: votes.presentation.28
    source: Replay
    english: Replay
    vietnamese: "Xem l\u1EA1i"
  - key: votes.presentation.29
    source: Close
    english: Close
    vietnamese: "\u0110\xF3ng"
  - key: votes.presentation.30
    source: "Step {0} \xB7 {1}"
    english: "Step {0} \xB7 {1}"
    vietnamese: "B\u01B0\u1EDBc {0} \xB7 {1}"
  - key: votes.presentation.31
    source: "Vote details \xB7 {0} steps"
    english: "Vote details \xB7 {0} steps"
    vietnamese: "Chi ti\u1EBFt phi\u1EBFu \xB7 {0} b\u01B0\u1EDBc"
  - key: votes.presentation.32
    source: '{0}: suspicion +{1}, not votes. Click this seal for details.'
    english: '{0}: suspicion +{1}, not votes. Click this seal for details.'
    vietnamese: "{0}: th\xEAm {1} \u0111i\u1EC3m nghi v\u1EA5n, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i
      phi\u1EBFu. B\u1EA5m huy hi\u1EC7u n\xE0y \u0111\u1EC3 xem gi\u1EA3i th\xEDch
      nh\xE9."
  - key: votes.presentation.33
    source: This seal marks your wager target. Click to read how Gambler resolves
      the bet.
    english: This seal marks your wager target. Click to read how Gambler resolves
      the bet.
    vietnamese: "D\u1EA5u n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\u01B0\u1EE3c c\u1EE7a
      b\u1EA1n. B\u1EA5m \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc c\xE1ch Gambler x\u1EED l\xFD
      th\u1EAFng v\xE0 thua c\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\xE9."
  - key: votes.presentation.34
    source: This eye marks Snooper's indicated target. Click for its vote effect;
      private selections stay hidden from the other player.
    english: This eye marks Snooper's indicated target. Click for its vote effect;
      private selections stay hidden from the other player.
    vietnamese: "Con m\u1EAFt ch\u1EC9 m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu c\u1EE7a Snooper. B\u1EA5m
      \u0111\u1EC3 xem t\xE1c \u0111\u1ED9ng l\xEAn phi\u1EBFu; l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn
      ri\xEAng v\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EA5u v\u1EDBi \u0111\u1ED1i ph\u01B0\u01A1ng."
  - key: votes.presentation.35
    source: '{0}: {1} votes currently shown. Click for where these votes came from.'
    english: '{0}: {1} votes currently shown. Click for where these votes came from.'
    vietnamese: "{0}: hi\u1EC7n c\xF3 {1} phi\u1EBFu \u0111ang \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB. B\u1EA5m \u0111\u1EC3 xem c\xE1c phi\u1EBFu n\xE0y \u0111\u1EBFn
      t\u1EEB \u0111\xE2u nh\xE9."
  - key: votes.presentation.36
    source: Selected target
    english: Selected target
    vietnamese: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111\xE3 ch\u1ECDn"
  - key: votes.presentation.37
    source: LAST TALLY
    english: LAST TALLY
    vietnamese: "L\u1EA6N T\u1ED4NG K\u1EBET G\u1EA6N NH\u1EA4T"
  - key: skill.fx.0
    source: DEAL!
    english: DEAL!
    vietnamese: "Ch\u1ED1t!"
  - key: skill.fx.1
    source: NO BALLOTS
    english: NO BALLOTS
    vietnamese: "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 phi\u1EBFu"
